// src/front/registry.at — PLAN-625 gallery registry(生成产物,勿手改)
// 由 auto-man generate_gallery_host / refresh_gallery_registry 从画廊语料
// (examples/ui)全量覆写,同 demos-registry.ts 的 web 臂先例。
// 双端同源:VM 臂 import_aliases 真实编译 / vue 臂 SFC 转译
// (tree_util.at PLAN-522/614 先例)。
// ⚠ VM 轨纪律(P614):参数列表遍历一律 while+索引(for-in 参数列表零迭代);
//   Obj 字面量全键书写(形状锁定,缺键字段访问=硬错)。
// 记录 schema(app.at `for demo in .filteredDemos` 的字段访问契约):
//   { id, title, category, icon, description, tags(List), doc, source,
//     pac_text, loadable, search_lc }  // pac 是 .at 关键字,字段避名 pac_text
// search_lc = (title + id + tags) 生成期预转小写拼接(搜索堆料;查询侧用
// 内建 .to_lower(),engine.rs str 方法表)。

pub fn all_demos() List {
    return [
        { id: "001-helloworld", title: "你好世界", category: "01-basic", icon: "app-window", description: "你好世界", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 001-helloworld — Static Text Display\n\nThe simplest possible AURA widget. Displays centered text on a white background.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **View tree** — The `view` block defines the widget's visual structure as a nested tree of elements\n- **Text widget** — `text` renders a string; use a literal string like `\"Hello, World!\"`\n- **Col layout** — `col` arranges children vertically in a column\n- **Class styling** — The `class` property applies CSS/Tailwind-style utility classes for layout and appearance\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    view {\n        col {\n            text \"Hello, World!\"\n            class: \"w-full h-full justify-center items-center bg-white\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/001-helloworld\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- View tree structure with nested elements\n- `text` widget for displaying static strings\n- `col` container for vertical layout\n- `class` property for styling with Tailwind utility classes\n", source: "widget App {\n    view {\n        col {\n            // Plan 481: selectable text —— 标题样式显式化(text-4xl 对齐 h1\n            // 默认),正文可选可复制(VM 拖选/双击/Ctrl+C,vue 显式 user-select)。\n            text \"Hello, World!\" {\n                style: \"text-4xl font-bold text-primary\",\n                selectable: true\n            }\n            // Plan 512: fit 迁移——center 居中外壳退役（Fill 会把内容测量\n            // 钉回窗口尺寸），根 col Shrink 包裹 + 内边距。\n            style: \"p-8 items-center\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"hello-world\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Hello World\"\ntitle_zh: \"你好世界\"\n# Plan 512: 窗口随内容自然尺寸收缩（fit 线，批二）。\nwindow: \"fit\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "你好世界 001-helloworld autoui" },
        { id: "002-counter", title: "计数器", category: "01-basic", icon: "app-window", description: "计数器", tags: ["Elm", "State", "Lambda"], doc: "# 002-counter — Interactive Counter\n\nAn increment/decrement/reset counter with three buttons demonstrating the Elm Architecture (model/view/update) pattern in AURA — in its simplest form, using inline lambda handlers (Plan 448).\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Model** — The `model` block holds the widget's mutable state (`var count int = 0`)\n- **Inline lambda handlers** — `onclick: () => {.count += 1}` binds a click directly to a state update; the compiler mints an anonymous event and synthesizes the handler, so simple callbacks need no `msg`/`on` round trip\n- **Compound assignment** — `.count += 1` / `.count -= 1` work in handler bodies on every backend\n- **Button widget** — `button` renders a clickable element with a label and event binding\n- **F-string interpolation** — `` `Counter: ${.count}` `` embeds model state in displayed text\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        var count int = 0\n    }\n\n    view {\n        center {\n            text `Counter: ${.count}`\n            row {\n                button \"-\" { onclick: () => {.count -= 1} }\n                button \"Reset\" { onclick: () => {.count = 0} }\n                button \"+\" { onclick: () => {.count += 1} }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nWhen a widget outgrows the inline form (payload-carrying events, handlers\ncalled from several places), declare the events explicitly instead:\n\n```auto\nmsg { Inc, Dec, Reset }   // names are optional since Plan 448 A\non {\n    .Inc -> { .count = .count + 1 }\n}\n// view binds: button \"+\" { onclick: .Inc }\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/002-counter\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- Elm Architecture: `model` block for state, inline lambdas or `msg`/`on` for events and updates\n- `button` widget with `onclick` event binding\n- `row` container for horizontal layout of buttons\n- F-string interpolation with `${.count}` to display reactive model values\n", source: "widget App {\n    model {\n        var count int = 0\n    }\n\n    // Plan 506: 外壳改\"内容即页面\"（无 center 包裹，循 011 样板），配合\n    // pac `window: \"fit\"` 窗口随内容收缩。\n    view {\n        col {\n            text `Counter: ${.count}`\n            row {\n                button \"-\" { onclick: () => {.count -= 1} }\n                button \"Reset\" { onclick: () => {.count = 0} }\n                button \"+\" { onclick: () => {.count += 1} }\n            }\n            style: \"items-center gap-4 p-6\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n\n// 对照：同一计数器的显式 msg/on 写法（与上面的内联 lambda 简写等价）。\n// 简单回调直接用内联 lambda；当事件需要携带参数、或一处逻辑要被\n// 多处/多事件复用时，改用下面的显式声明更合适。\n//\n// widget App {\n//     msg { Inc, Dec, Reset }\n//\n//     model {\n//         var count int = 0\n//     }\n//\n//     view {\n//         center {\n//             text `Counter: ${.count}`\n//             row {\n//                 button \"-\" { onclick: .Dec }\n//                 button \"Reset\" { onclick: .Reset }\n//                 button \"+\" { onclick: .Inc }\n//             }\n//         }\n//     }\n//\n//     on {\n//         .Inc -> { .count = .count + 1 }\n//         .Dec -> { .count = .count - 1 }\n//         .Reset -> { .count = 0 }\n//     }\n// }\n", pac_text: "name: \"counter\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Counter\"\ntitle_zh: \"计数器\"\n# Plan 506: 窗口随内容自然尺寸收缩（独立 VM 窗 / 虚拟桌面窗双路径）。\nwindow: \"fit\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "计数器 002-counter elm state lambda" },
        { id: "003-converter", title: "转换器", category: "01-basic", icon: "app-window", description: "转换器", tags: ["Binding", "7GUIs"], doc: "# 003-converter — Temperature Converter\n\nA bidirectional Celsius/Fahrenheit converter. Editing either field updates the model state and re-computes the other field — using inline lambda handlers (Plan 448), no `msg`/`on` round trip needed.\n\nInspired by 7GUIs Task #2 (Temperature Converter).\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Input widget** — `input` renders an editable text field with `value` binding (folds to two-way `v-model`) and `placeholder`\n- **Inline lambda handlers** — `oninput: () => {.fahrenheit = …}` binds typing directly to a state update; the compiler mints an anonymous event and synthesizes the handler\n- **Model state** — `double` fields hold the current Celsius and Fahrenheit values\n- **Design tokens** — `text-primary`, `bg-card`, `text-muted-foreground` style via the shadcn theme tokens instead of hardcoded colors\n- **Layout spacing** — `gap-4` on the `row` keeps the two fields apart; the card container (`border rounded-2xl shadow-sm`) frames the scene\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        var celsius double = 0.0\n        var fahrenheit double = 32.0\n    }\n\n    view {\n        center {\n            col {\n                style: \"w-full max-w-md p-8 bg-card border rounded-2xl shadow-sm mx-4\"\n\n                text \"Temperature Converter\" {\n                    style: \"text-2xl font-bold text-primary text-center mb-6\"\n                }\n\n                row {\n                    style: \"gap-4\"\n\n                    col {\n                        style: \"flex-1 gap-1.5\"\n                        text \"Celsius (°C)\" {\n                            style: \"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\"\n                        }\n                        input (value: .celsius) {\n                            oninput: () => {.fahrenheit = math.round((.celsius * 9.0 / 5.0 + 32.0) * 100.0) / 100.0}\n                            placeholder: \"0\"\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    col {\n                        style: \"flex-1 gap-1.5\"\n                        text \"Fahrenheit (°F)\" {\n                            style: \"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\"\n                        }\n                        input (value: .fahrenheit) {\n                            oninput: () => {.celsius = math.round((.fahrenheit - 32.0) * 5.0 / 9.0 * 100.0) / 100.0}\n                            placeholder: \"32\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                text \"°F = °C × 9/5 + 32\" {\n                    style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground text-center mt-6\"\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nIf an event later needs a payload or its logic is shared across several\nbindings, declare it explicitly instead:\n\n```auto\nmsg { CelsiusChanged, FahrenheitChanged }\non {\n    .CelsiusChanged -> { .fahrenheit = math.round((.celsius * 9.0 / 5.0 + 32.0) * 100.0) / 100.0 }\n}\n// view binds: input (value: .celsius) { oninput: .CelsiusChanged }\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/003-converter\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- `input` widget with `value` binding to model fields (two-way via `v-model`)\n- `oninput` inline lambda for responding to text field changes\n- `placeholder` property for input hint text\n- `row`/`col` nesting with `gap-*` for side-by-side spaced layout\n- Theming with design tokens (`text-primary`, `bg-card`, `text-muted-foreground`)\n", source: "// front/app.at — Temperature Converter.\n// PLAN-637 Phase A：重复 class 串提取为本地配方（展开后与原串逐字节等价，\n// 双端零漂移）。两串各仅 ×2 且与共享库形态不合（变体纪律，r2：不跨串合并），\n// 留本地不升库。全 demo 无调色板色，Phase B 无事。\n\n// 字段列（输入列容器，×2）\nstyle field_col = \"flex-1 gap-1.5\"\n// 字段标签（×2）\nstyle field_label = \"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\"\n\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        var celsius double = 0.0\n        var fahrenheit double = 32.0\n    }\n\n    // Plan 506: 外壳改\"内容即页面\"（无 center 包裹，循 011 样板），配合\n    // pac `window: \"fit\"` 窗口随内容收缩。\n    view {\n        col {\n            // mx-auto: 画廊视口内居中卡片(iced 端 Fill+max-w 不参与父级\n            // items-center,须自带 auto 边距;fit 窗口下 auto 边距自然归零)\n            style: \"max-w-md p-8 bg-card border rounded-2xl shadow-sm mx-auto\"\n\n            text \"Temperature Converter\" {\n                style: \"text-2xl font-bold text-primary text-center mb-6\"\n            }\n\n            row {\n                style: \"gap-4\"\n\n                col {\n                    style: field_col\n                    text \"Celsius (°C)\" {\n                        style: field_label\n                    }\n                    input (value: .celsius) {\n                        oninput: () => {.fahrenheit = math.round((.celsius * 9.0 / 5.0 + 32.0) * 100.0) / 100.0}\n                        placeholder: \"0\"\n                    }\n                }\n\n                col {\n                    style: field_col\n                    text \"Fahrenheit (°F)\" {\n                        style: field_label\n                    }\n                    input (value: .fahrenheit) {\n                        oninput: () => {.celsius = math.round((.fahrenheit - 32.0) * 5.0 / 9.0 * 100.0) / 100.0}\n                        placeholder: \"32\"\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            text \"°F = °C × 9/5 + 32\" {\n                style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground text-center mt-6\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"converter\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Converter\"\ntitle_zh: \"转换器\"\n# Plan 506: 窗口随内容自然尺寸收缩（独立 VM 窗 / 虚拟桌面窗双路径）。\nwindow: \"fit\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "转换器 003-converter binding 7guis" },
        { id: "004-profile-card", title: "个人资料卡", category: "01-basic", icon: "app-window", description: "个人资料卡", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 004-profile-card — User Profile Card\n\nA visually rich profile card with avatar image, name, status badge, role, bio, and action buttons. Demonstrates visual composition with static model data.\n\nInspired by PrimeBlocks card patterns.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Image widget** — `image` renders an image from a URL via the `src` property\n- **Col/row nesting** — Mixing `col` and `row` containers for vertical and horizontal arrangements\n- **Class styling** — Tailwind-style utility classes for spacing, colors, borders, shadows, and gradients\n- **Static data display** — Model fields hold display data without interactivity\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        var name str = \"Jane Cooper\"\n        var role str = \"Full Stack Developer\"\n        var bio str = \"Passionate about building great user experiences. Open source contributor and coffee enthusiast.\"\n        var avatar_url str = \"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=47\"\n        var status str = \"online\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // Header with gradient background\n            col {\n                class: \"h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-600 rounded-t-lg\"\n            }\n\n            // Avatar overlapping the header\n            col {\n                image (src: .avatar_url) {\n                    class: \"w-20 h-20 rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-md\"\n                }\n                class: \"-mt-10 items-center\"\n            }\n\n            // Name and role\n            col {\n                text .name\n                class: \"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900\"\n\n                row {\n                    text .status\n                    class: \"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400\"\n                    text \"Active\"\n                    class: \"text-sm text-gray-500\"\n                }\n                class: \"gap-2 items-center\"\n            }\n\n            // Role badge\n            row {\n                text .role\n                class: \"px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-sm rounded-full font-medium\"\n            }\n\n            // Bio\n            text .bio\n            class: \"text-gray-600 text-sm text-center px-6 leading-relaxed\"\n\n            // Action buttons\n            row {\n                button \"Follow\" {\n                    class: \"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600\"\n                }\n                button \"Message\" {\n                    class: \"px-4 py-2 bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-300\"\n                }\n                class: \"gap-3\"\n            }\n\n            class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg max-w-sm mx-auto items-center gap-4 pb-6\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/004-profile-card\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- `image` widget with `src` property for displaying images\n- Deep `col`/`row` nesting for complex card layouts\n- Gradient backgrounds with `bg-gradient-to-r` classes\n- Negative margin (`-mt-10`) for overlapping elements\n- Card pattern with shadow, rounded corners, and max-width\n", source: "// PLAN-637 Phase B token 化映射（2026-09-17，B1）：\n//   头像饰边 border-gray-200→border-border；姓名 text-gray-900→text-foreground；\n//   状态说明 text-gray-500→text-muted-foreground；徽章 bg-blue-100/text-blue-800→\n//   bg-secondary/text-secondary-foreground；bio text-gray-600→text-muted-foreground；\n//   Follow bg-blue-500/text-white/hover:bg-blue-600→bg-primary/text-primary-foreground/\n//   hover:bg-primary/90；Message bg-gray-200/text-gray-700/hover:bg-gray-300→\n//   bg-secondary/text-secondary-foreground/hover:bg-secondary/80；\n//   卡面 bg-white/border-gray-200→bg-card/border-border。\n//   豁免（2 项）：顶部 from-blue-500/to-purple-600 渐变（装饰性插画/渐变，r2 不入扫描）；\n//   在线状态点 bg-green-400（registry 无 success 语义键，装饰性指示色豁免，\n//   主题系统立项时评估回迁）。\n\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        var name str = \"Jane Cooper\"\n        var role str = \"Full Stack Developer\"\n        var bio str = \"Passionate about building great user experiences. Open source contributor and coffee enthusiast.\"\n        var avatar_url str = \"https://cn.cravatar.com/avatar/e1e7ba949ade0936e071132d2edd3b3c.png\"\n        var status str = \"online\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // Card container\n            col {\n                // Header with gradient background\n                col {\n                    style: \"w-full h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-600 rounded-t-lg\"\n                }\n\n                // Avatar overlapping the header\n                col {\n                    image (src: .avatar_url) {\n                        style: \"w-20 h-20 rounded-full border-4 border-border shadow-md\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"-mt-10 items-center\"\n                }\n\n                // Name and role\n                col {\n                    text .name {\n                        style: \"text-xl font-bold text-foreground\",\n                        selectable: true\n                    }\n\n                    row {\n                        col {\n                            style: \"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400\"\n                        }\n                        text \"Active\" {\n                            style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\n                            selectable: true\n                        }\n                        style: \"gap-2 items-center\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-1 items-center\"\n                }\n\n                // Role badge\n                row {\n                    text .role {\n                        style: \"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground text-sm rounded-full font-medium\",\n                        selectable: true\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Bio\n                text .bio {\n                    style: \"text-muted-foreground text-sm text-center px-6 leading-relaxed\",\n                    selectable: true\n                }\n\n                // Action buttons\n                row {\n                    button \"Follow\" {\n                        style: \"px-4 py-2 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-lg hover:bg-primary/90\"\n                    }\n                    button \"Message\" {\n                        style: \"px-4 py-2 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground rounded-lg hover:bg-secondary/80\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-3\"\n                }\n\n                style: \"bg-card rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-border w-96 items-center gap-4 pb-6 overflow-hidden\"\n            }\n            // Plan 512: fit 迁移——center 居中外壳退役，根 col Shrink 包裹；\n            // 卡片固定宽 w-96（原 max-w-sm 满窗语义在 Shrink 根下会塌缩）。\n            style: \"p-6 items-center\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"profile-card\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Profile Card\"\ntitle_zh: \"个人资料卡\"\n# Plan 512: 窗口随内容自然尺寸收缩（fit 线，批二）。\nwindow: \"fit\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "个人资料卡 004-profile-card autoui" },
        { id: "005-login", title: "登录", category: "01-basic", icon: "app-window", description: "登录", tags: ["Form", "Validation"], doc: "# 005-login — Login Form\n\nA complete login form with email and password fields, conditional error display, and a submit button. Demonstrates form patterns and conditional rendering.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Input widget** — `input` with `value`, `placeholder`, and `type` properties for form fields\n- **Two-way binding** — a bare `value: .field` input syncs typed text into state on every backend (Plan 448 C); side effects go inline (`oninput: () => {…}`, Plan 448 B)\n- **Conditional rendering** — `if` blocks show/hide error messages based on model state\n- **Button widget** — `button` with `onclick` event for form submission\n- **Form pattern** — Grouping labeled inputs, error messages, and a submit button in a card layout\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    msg { Submit }\n\n    model {\n        var email str = \"\"\n        var password str = \"\"\n        var email_error str = \"\"\n        var password_error str = \"\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            text \"Sign In\"\n            class: \"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"\n            text \"Welcome back! Please enter your credentials.\"\n            class: \"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8\"\n\n            col {\n                text \"Email\"\n                class: \"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\"\n                input (value: .email) {\n                    oninput: () => { if .email != \"\" { .email_error = \"\" } }\n                    placeholder: \"you@example.com\"\n                    class: \"w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg\"\n                }\n                if .email_error != \"\" {\n                    text .email_error\n                    class: \"text-red-500 text-xs mt-1\"\n                }\n                class: \"mb-4\"\n            }\n\n            col {\n                text \"Password\"\n                class: \"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\"\n                input (value: .password) {\n                    oninput: () => { if .password != \"\" { .password_error = \"\" } }\n                    placeholder: \"Enter your password\"\n                    type: \"password\"\n                    class: \"w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg\"\n                }\n                if .password_error != \"\" {\n                    text .password_error\n                    class: \"text-red-500 text-xs mt-1\"\n                }\n                class: \"mb-6\"\n            }\n\n            button \"Sign In\" {\n                onclick: .Submit\n                class: \"w-full py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-lg font-medium\"\n            }\n\n            row {\n                text \"Don't have an account?\"\n                class: \"text-sm text-gray-500\"\n                text \"Sign up\"\n                class: \"text-sm text-blue-500 font-medium\"\n                class: \"gap-1\"\n            }\n            class: \"mt-4 justify-center\"\n\n            class: \"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 max-w-md mx-auto w-full\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Submit -> {\n            .email_error = \"\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/005-login\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- `input` widget with `type: \"password\"` for masked text entry\n- `if` conditional rendering to show/hide error messages\n- Form layout pattern: labels, inputs, error text, and submit button in a card\n- Error state stored in model fields (`email_error`, `password_error`)\n- `button` with `onclick` for form submission\n", source: "\n// ── PLAN-637 B1：本地配方（×2 重复串提取）─────────────────────────────\n// Phase A 提取 + Phase B token 定案合并过（W1 小面授权，映射见下注）。\n// input_login 与 stylekit input_field 形态不同（rounded-lg/mt-2，无 text-sm），\n// 圆角/边距族归一待 Phase B 裁定后再升库（r2 变体纪律）。\nstyle input_login = \"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-border rounded-lg mt-2 text-foreground\"\n// 字段标签：text-gray-700 → text-foreground\nstyle field_label = \"text-sm font-medium text-foreground mt-6\"\n// 错误提示：text-red-500 → text-destructive\nstyle error_text = \"text-destructive text-xs mt-1\"\n\n// Phase B 映射（唯一串逐条）：h2/欢迎语/链接/主按钮/卡面——\n// text-gray-900→text-foreground；text-gray-500→text-muted-foreground；\n// bg-blue-500 text-white→bg-primary text-primary-foreground；\n// text-blue-500→text-primary；bg-white/border-gray-200→bg-card/border-border。\n\nwidget App {\n    msg { Submit }\n\n    model {\n        var email str = \"\"\n        var password str = \"\"\n        var email_error str = \"\"\n        var password_error str = \"\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            col {\n                h2 \"Sign In\" {\n                    style: \"text-3xl font-extrabold text-foreground\"\n                }\n\n                text \"Welcome back! Please enter your credentials.\" {\n                    style: \"text-muted-foreground mt-3\"\n                }\n\n                col {\n                    text \"Email\" {\n                        style: field_label\n                    }\n                    input (value: .email) {\n                        oninput: () => { if .email != \"\" { .email_error = \"\" } }\n                        placeholder: \"you@example.com\"\n                        style: input_login\n                    }\n                    if .email_error != \"\" {\n                        text .email_error {\n                            style: error_text\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                col {\n                    text \"Password\" {\n                        style: field_label\n                    }\n                    input (value: .password) {\n                        oninput: () => { if .password != \"\" { .password_error = \"\" } }\n                        placeholder: \"Enter your password\"\n                        type: \"password\"\n                        style: input_login\n                    }\n                    if .password_error != \"\" {\n                        text .password_error {\n                            style: error_text\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                button \"Sign In\" {\n                    onclick: .Submit\n                    style: \"w-full py-2.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-lg font-semibold mt-6\"\n                }\n\n                row {\n                    text \"Don't have an account?\" {\n                        style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mr-1\"\n                    }\n                    a \"Sign up\" {\n                        style: \"text-sm text-primary font-semibold underline\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"justify-center items-center mt-4\"\n                }\n\n                style: \"bg-card rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-border p-8 w-112\"\n            }\n            // Plan 512: fit 迁移——center 居中外壳退役，根 col Shrink 包裹；\n            // 卡片固定宽 w-112=448px（原 max-w-md+w-full 满窗语义在 Shrink\n            // 根下会塌缩；w-[28rem] rem 任意值 iced 端不支持，用 Tailwind\n            // 刻度 112×4px）。\n            style: \"p-6 items-center\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Submit -> {\n            if .email == \"\" {\n                .email_error = \"Email is required\"\n            } else {\n                .email_error = \"\"\n            }\n            if .password == \"\" {\n                .password_error = \"Password is required\"\n            } else {\n                .password_error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"login\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Login\"\ntitle_zh: \"登录\"\n# Plan 512: 窗口随内容自然尺寸收缩（fit 线，批二）。\nwindow: \"fit\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "登录 005-login form validation" },
        { id: "006-hero-section", title: "主视觉区", category: "01-basic", icon: "app-window", description: "主视觉区", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 006-hero-section — Landing Page Hero Section\n\nA full-width landing page hero with headline, subtitle, and CTA button over a theme-aware background.\n\n**Plan 458: 首个\"主题敏感\"示例** —— 默认 Dark（渐变 + 白字），右上角 **Theme\nSettings** 面板可在运行中切换 Light/Dark 与 5 个主题主色（accent）。\n\n## Concepts\n\n- Text hierarchy (headline + subtitle)\n- Button with click handler\n- Theme-aware styling (`style: if .dark_mode { ... } else { ... }`)\n- Gradient background styling (dark) / light surface (light)\n- Theme settings panel: `dark_mode` / `accent_color` 状态变量（双端运行时契约）\n- Accent swatches (indigo / coral / ocean / sage / amber)\n\n## Source\n\nSee `src/front/app.at`（节选）:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    msg { GetStarted, ToggleSettings, SetTheme(str), SetAccent(str) }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = true      // 双端主题钩子：变量名即契约\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\" // 双端主色钩子\n        var settings_open bool = false\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // 右上角 Theme Settings 触发按钮 + 弹出面板（Theme/Accent）\n            // ... 面板内部用 style: if 切换选中态 ...\n            style: if .dark_mode {\n                \"w-full h-full min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-500 to-purple-600 text-white\"\n            } else {\n                \"w-full h-full min-h-screen bg-gray-50 text-gray-900\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .GetStarted -> { print(\"Getting started!\") }\n        .ToggleSettings -> { .settings_open = !.settings_open }\n        .SetTheme(t) -> { /* t == \"light\" → .dark_mode = false ... */ }\n        .SetAccent(name) -> { .accent_color = name }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/006-hero-section\nauto run                    # 默认 Dark（pac.at theme: \"dark\"）\nauto run --theme light      # CLI 覆盖：浅色启动\nauto run --theme light --accent ocean   # 同时指定主色\nauto run --render vm        # VM/Iced 原生窗口（同样吃 --theme/--accent）\n```\n\n启动后点右上角 **⚙ Theme** 展开面板：Light/Dark 切换主题，5 个色点切换主色\n（CTA 按钮颜色随之变化）。CLI/pac.at 只是启动默认值，应用内切换即视即生效。\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- Text hierarchy: two `text` elements render as headline and subtitle based on order\n- Button with `onclick` handler bound to a message\n- Theme-sensitive colors: text/background always paired per theme branch\n- `dark_mode` / `accent_color` root state vars as the dual-backend runtime theme contract\n- Message handling in the `on` block with `print()`\n", source: "// app.at — Hero section. Plan 458: 首个\"主题敏感\"示例。\n//\n// 根节点声明 dark_mode / accent_color 状态变量 —— 这两个变量名是双端运行时\n// 契约(不要改名):VM 渲染器每帧回读并切换 shadcn 明暗调色板与主题主色,\n// Vue 代码gen据此生成 `.dark` class 绑定与 applyAccent(`--primary`)注入。\n// pac.at 里 `theme: \"dark\"` / `accent: \"indigo\"` 声明的是启动默认值(也可用\n// `auto run --theme light --accent ocean` 从 CLI 覆盖)。\n// PLAN-637 T-01b（用户裁定：demo 跟随系统）：应用级 SettingsPopover 消费面\n// 移除，主题控制由 gallery 宿主切换器承接；SetTheme/SetAccent 消息面保留\n// （宿主 → 内嵌 demo 主题传播路线的既有通道），本 demo 内无发射方。\n\n// PLAN-637 B2 Phase B 映射（2026-09-17）：亮支 bg-gray-50/text-gray-900→\n// bg-background/text-foreground；暗支 text-white→text-primary-foreground（渐变\n// from-blue-500/to-purple-600 豁免保留，r2 口径）。\n\nwidget App {\n    msg { GetStarted, SetTheme(str), SetAccent(str) }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = true\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // ── 主区:Hero 内容(主题条件配色;CTA 随 accent 走)──\n            col {\n                text \"Build Beautiful Apps\" { style: \"text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight\" }\n                text \"Write once, run anywhere with AutoLang\" { style: \"text-xl\" }\n                button \"Get Started\" {\n                    onclick: .GetStarted\n                    style: \"px-8 py-3 text-lg font-semibold rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 shadow-lg transition-colors\"\n                }\n                style: \"w-full flex-1 justify-center items-center gap-4 p-8\"\n            }\n            style: if .dark_mode {\n                \"w-full h-full min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-500 to-purple-600 text-primary-foreground\"\n            } else {\n                \"w-full h-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .GetStarted -> { print(\"Getting started!\") }\n        .SetTheme(t) -> {\n            if t == \"light\" {\n                .dark_mode = false\n            }\n            if t == \"dark\" {\n                .dark_mode = true\n            }\n        }\n        .SetAccent(name) -> { .accent_color = name }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"hero-section\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Hero Section\"\ntitle_zh: \"主视觉区\"\n// Plan 458: 启动默认主题与主题主色(优先级:CLI --theme/--accent > 这里 > 内置 dark/indigo)。\n// PLAN-637 T-01b: 应用级 Theme 面板移除（demo 跟随系统），主题控制由\n// gallery 宿主切换器承接，此处仅声明启动默认值。\ntheme: \"dark\"\naccent: \"indigo\"\n\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "主视觉区 006-hero-section autoui" },
        { id: "007-stats-board", title: "数据统计板", category: "02-components", icon: "app-window", description: "数据统计板", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 007-stats-board — Dashboard Metrics Board\n\nA dashboard showing four metric cards (Revenue, Users, Orders, Growth) in a horizontal row.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- Data display with model state\n- Repeated `col` card pattern\n- `row` layout with flex-1 equal-width cards\n- Shadow and rounded styling on cards\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        var title1 str = \"Revenue\"\n        var value1 str = \"$256K\"\n        var title2 str = \"Users\"\n        var value2 str = \"1,453\"\n        var title3 str = \"Orders\"\n        var value3 str = \"83M\"\n        var title4 str = \"Growth\"\n        var value4 str = \"+12%\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            text \"Dashboard Overview\"\n            row {\n                col {\n                    text .title1\n                    text .value1\n                    class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 flex-1\"\n                }\n                col {\n                    text .title2\n                    text .value2\n                    class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 flex-1\"\n                }\n                col {\n                    text .title3\n                    text .value3\n                    class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 flex-1\"\n                }\n                col {\n                    text .title4\n                    text .value4\n                    class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 flex-1\"\n                }\n                class: \"gap-4\"\n            }\n            class: \"w-full p-8 gap-6\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/007-stats-board\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- Model state: `var` bindings for each metric title and value\n- Data display: binding text content to model fields with `.title1`, `.value1`\n- Repeated card pattern: four `col` cards with identical structure\n- Row layout: `row` with `flex-1` cards for equal-width distribution\n- Card styling: `bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4` for a clean card appearance\n", source: "use stylekit.styles: caption_text, section_title\n\n// PLAN-637 B2（Phase A 提取 + Phase B 映射，2026-09-17）：\n//   Phase B 映射：text-gray-900→text-foreground；text-gray-500→text-muted-foreground；\n//   bg-white→bg-card；border-gray-100→border-border；页面底 bg-gray-50→bg-background。\n//   stylekit 消费：hint_sm→caption_text（×12 位点）、stat_value→section_title(text-sm)\n//   （×21 位点；Phase B 归一后体序全等）。title_lg（×3）因源串词序（text-lg 在前）\n//   与 section_title 输出序不同，字节等价不可达，留本地（词序敏感性未验证不冒险）。\n//   豁免：四 stat 图标 chip（bg-{red,blue,green,purple}-100 + 同色 text-*-500）与\n//   三 avatar 底色（bg-{blue,green,purple}-100）＝类目装饰色，registry 无对应语义键。\nstyle title_2xl = \"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\"   // Phase B: gray-900 → foreground\nstyle title_lg = \"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\"   // Phase B: gray-900 → foreground\nstyle stat_value = section_title(size: \"text-sm\")   // Phase B：归一后消费 stylekit（体 ≡ \"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\"）\nstyle stat_label = \"text-sm text-muted-foreground\"   // Phase B: text-gray-500 → text-muted-foreground\nstyle hint_sm = caption_text                        // Phase B：消费 stylekit caption_text\nstyle stat_card = \"bg-card rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-border p-4 flex-1\"   // Phase B: bg-white/border-gray-100 → bg-card/border-border\nstyle list_row_lg = \"w-full items-center py-3 border-b border-border\"   // Phase B\nstyle panel_card = \"bg-card rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-border p-5 flex-1 gap-4\"   // Phase B: 同 stat_card（Phase A 漏盘 p-5 变体，B 补提取）\nstyle member_stats_row = \"gap-4 mt-3\"   // Phase A 补提取（截断漏盘）\nstyle list_row_sm = \"w-full items-center py-2 border-b border-border\"   // Phase B\nstyle row_inline = \"gap-0 items-center\"\nstyle row_avatar = \"gap-3 items-center\"\n\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        // Header\n        var dashboard_title str = \"Dashboard\"\n        var dashboard_subtitle str = \"Campaign Insights\"\n\n        // Stat cards\n        var stat1_title str = \"Campaign Alerts\"\n        var stat1_value str = \"123k\"\n        var stat2_title str = \"System Alerts\"\n        var stat2_value str = \"89k\"\n        var stat3_title str = \"Promotional Offers\"\n        var stat3_value str = \"3k\"\n        var stat4_title str = \"Traffic Distribution\"\n        var stat4_value str = \"175k\"\n\n        // Campaign Performance\n        var perf_all_traffic str = \"14,582\"\n        var perf_instagram str = \"8,421\"\n        var perf_linkedin str = \"3,219\"\n        var perf_google str = \"1,987\"\n        var perf_x str = \"952\"\n\n        // Campaign Targets\n        var target_progress int = 86\n        var target_current str = \"8,571\"\n        var target_goal str = \"10,000\"\n        var kpi1 str = \"Revenue Target\"\n        var kpi1_value str = \"$32.5k\"\n        var kpi2 str = \"Active Users\"\n        var kpi2_value str = \"2,450\"\n        var kpi3 str = \"Conversion Rate\"\n        var kpi3_value str = \"5.6%\"\n        var kpi4 str = \"Avg. Order Value\"\n        var kpi4_value str = \"$128\"\n\n        // Team Performance\n        var member1_name str = \"Sarah Johnson\"\n        var member1_role str = \"Marketing Lead\"\n        var member1_posts str = \"142\"\n        var member1_followers str = \"12.5k\"\n        var member1_engagement str = \"4.8%\"\n        var member2_name str = \"Mike Chen\"\n        var member2_role str = \"Content Strategist\"\n        var member2_posts str = \"98\"\n        var member2_followers str = \"8.2k\"\n        var member2_engagement str = \"6.1%\"\n        var member3_name str = \"Emily Davis\"\n        var member3_role str = \"Social Media Manager\"\n        var member3_posts str = \"215\"\n        var member3_followers str = \"15.8k\"\n        var member3_engagement str = \"5.3%\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // Header\n            row {\n                col {\n                    h2 .dashboard_title {\n                        style: title_2xl\n                    }\n                    span .dashboard_subtitle {\n                        style: stat_label\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-1\"\n                }\n                spacer\n                style: \"w-full items-center justify-between\"\n            }\n\n            // Stat Cards Row\n            row {\n                col {\n                    row {\n                        col {\n                            style: \"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 text-xl font-bold\"\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            span .stat1_title {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            span .stat1_value {\n                                style: title_2xl\n                            }\n                            style: \"gap-0\"\n                        }\n                        style: row_avatar\n                    }\n                    style: stat_card\n                }\n                col {\n                    row {\n                        col {\n                            style: \"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-500 text-xl font-bold\"\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            span .stat2_title {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            span .stat2_value {\n                                style: title_2xl\n                            }\n                            style: \"gap-0\"\n                        }\n                        style: row_avatar\n                    }\n                    style: stat_card\n                }\n                col {\n                    row {\n                        col {\n                            style: \"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center text-green-500 text-xl font-bold\"\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            span .stat3_title {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            span .stat3_value {\n                                style: title_2xl\n                            }\n                            style: \"gap-0\"\n                        }\n                        style: row_avatar\n                    }\n                    style: stat_card\n                }\n                col {\n                    row {\n                        col {\n                            style: \"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-500 text-xl font-bold\"\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            span .stat4_title {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            span .stat4_value {\n                                style: title_2xl\n                            }\n                            style: \"gap-0\"\n                        }\n                        style: row_avatar\n                    }\n                    style: stat_card\n                }\n                style: \"gap-4\"\n            }\n\n            // Middle Row: Campaign Performance + Campaign Targets\n            row {\n                // Campaign Performance\n                col {\n                    h3 \"Campaign Performance\" {\n                        style: title_lg\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            span \"All Traffic\" {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .perf_all_traffic {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: list_row_lg\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span \"Instagram\" {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .perf_instagram {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: list_row_lg\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span \"LinkedIn\" {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .perf_linkedin {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: list_row_lg\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span \"Google\" {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .perf_google {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: list_row_lg\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span \"X\" {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .perf_x {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: \"w-full items-center py-3\"\n                        }\n                        style: \"w-full\"\n                    }\n                    style: panel_card\n                }\n\n                // Campaign Targets\n                col {\n                    h3 \"Campaign Targets\" {\n                        style: title_lg\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            span \"Overall Progress\" {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span \"85.7%\" {\n                                style: \"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\"\n                            }\n                            style: \"w-full items-center\"\n                        }\n                        progress (value: .target_progress, max: 100) {\n                            style: \"mt-2 mb-4\"\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span .target_current\n                            span \"/\"\n                            span .target_goal\n                            style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground gap-1\"\n                        }\n                        style: \"w-full\"\n                    }\n                    divider\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            span .kpi1 {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .kpi1_value {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: list_row_sm\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span .kpi2 {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .kpi2_value {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: list_row_sm\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span .kpi3 {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .kpi3_value {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: list_row_sm\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span .kpi4 {\n                                style: stat_label\n                            }\n                            spacer\n                            span .kpi4_value {\n                                style: stat_value\n                            }\n                            style: \"w-full items-center py-2\"\n                        }\n                        style: \"w-full\"\n                    }\n                    style: panel_card\n                }\n                style: \"gap-4\"\n            }\n\n            // Team Performance\n            col {\n                h3 \"Team Performance\" {\n                    style: title_lg\n                }\n                row {\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            avatar {\n                                style: \"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100\"\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span .member1_name {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                span .member1_role {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                style: \"gap-0\"\n                            }\n                            style: row_avatar\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            col {\n                                span \"Posts\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member1_posts {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Followers\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member1_followers {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Engagement\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member1_engagement {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            style: member_stats_row\n                        }\n                        style: stat_card\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            avatar {\n                                style: \"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-100\"\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span .member2_name {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                span .member2_role {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                style: \"gap-0\"\n                            }\n                            style: row_avatar\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            col {\n                                span \"Posts\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member2_posts {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Followers\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member2_followers {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Engagement\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member2_engagement {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            style: member_stats_row\n                        }\n                        style: stat_card\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            avatar {\n                                style: \"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-100\"\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span .member3_name {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                span .member3_role {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                style: \"gap-0\"\n                            }\n                            style: row_avatar\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            col {\n                                span \"Posts\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member3_posts {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Followers\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member3_followers {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Engagement\" {\n                                    style: hint_sm\n                                }\n                                span .member3_engagement {\n                                    style: stat_value\n                                }\n                                style: row_inline\n                            }\n                            style: member_stats_row\n                        }\n                        style: stat_card\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-4\"\n                }\n                style: \"w-full gap-4\"\n            }\n\n            style: \"w-full p-6 gap-6 bg-background min-h-screen\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"stats-board\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Stats Board\"\ntitle_zh: \"数据统计板\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "数据统计板 007-stats-board autoui" },
        { id: "008-pricing-table", title: "价格表", category: "02-components", icon: "app-window", description: "价格表", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 008-pricing-table — Three-Tier Pricing Table with Theme Settings\n\nThree-tier pricing plans (Single Developer, Team, Enterprise) with default Dark theme, a top title bar, and a Settings panel for switching Light/Dark theme and Accent colors.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Default Theme**: Dark Mode (`theme: \"dark\"` in `pac.at`, `var dark_mode bool = true`).\n- **Top Title Bar**: Header with app icon (`💳`), title (`Pricing Table`), example badge (`008`), and settings trigger button (`⚙ Settings`).\n- **Settings Dropdown Panel**:\n  - Theme mode toggle: ☀️ Light / 🌙 Dark.\n  - Accent color picker: 5 semantic palettes (Indigo, Coral, Ocean, Sage, Amber).\n- **Three Pricing Cards**:\n  - Single Developer ($39/mo): Starter tier with blue styling.\n  - Team ($99/mo): \"RECOMMENDED\" highlight tier with orange badge and borders.\n  - Enterprise (\"Exclusive Deals\"): High-tier card with zinc styling.\n- **Cross-Backend Parity**: Full visual & functional parity verified across Vue (`auto run`) and VM/Iced (`auto run -r vm`).\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/008-pricing-table\nauto build            # Compile and build Vue project\nauto run              # Run Vue dev server\nauto run -r vm        # Run Native VM + Iced Desktop mode\n```\n\nOverride theme from CLI:\n```bash\nauto run --theme light --accent coral\nauto run -r vm --theme light --accent ocean\n```\n\n", source: "// app.at — Pricing Table.\n// PLAN-637 B2 Phase B 映射（2026-09-17）：zinc/gray 明暗条件对按角色收敛到同 token——\n// zinc-100/gray-900→foreground；zinc-400/gray-500→muted-foreground；zinc-300/gray-700\n// →foreground（特性行正文）；卡片 bg-zinc-900/bg-white→bg-card、border-zinc-800/gray-200→\n// border-border（shadow-lg/sm 差异保留条件）；plan3 按钮 zinc-800/gray-800 系→secondary 族\n// （双臂全同）；页根 zinc-950/gray-50→bg-background（双臂全同）。条件结构保留（结构简化\n// 不属本计划授权面）。Phase A 提取：feat_check ×12 / feat_check_muted ×6 / feat_list ×3 /\n// title_block ×3；Phase B 收敛提取：feat_text ×18 / plan_name ×3 / plan_subtitle ×3 /\n// plan_price ×3。\n\n// Plan 506: in-app title bar / Settings panel removed (common header widget\n// retired) — title/theme/accent live in pac.at + os-config, host chrome carries them.\n// Default theme: Dark mode.\n// PLAN-637 B2 Phase A：重复 class 串提取为本地配方（体 ≡ 原字面量，\n// 展开后逐字节等价；单类短串（如 items-center）按不过度抽象口径豁免）。\nstyle feat_check = \"text-primary font-bold mr-2.5 text-sm\"\nstyle feat_check_muted = \"text-muted-foreground font-bold mr-2.5 text-sm\"   // Phase B: zinc-400 → muted-foreground\nstyle feat_list = \"gap-3.5 my-5 flex-1\"\nstyle title_block = \"gap-1 items-center\"\nstyle feat_text = \"text-sm text-foreground\"   // Phase B：明暗臂收敛（zinc-300/gray-700→foreground）\nstyle plan_name = \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\"   // Phase B 收敛提取\nstyle plan_subtitle = \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"   // Phase B 收敛提取\nstyle plan_price = \"text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mt-2\"   // Phase B 收敛提取\n\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        BuyPlan1,\n        BuyPlan2,\n        BuyPlan3\n    }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = true\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\"   // declared for os-config/env seeding (Plan 504 idiom)\n\n        // Single Developer\n        var plan1_name str = \"Single Developer\"\n        var plan1_subtitle str = \"For individual developers\"\n        var plan1_price str = \"$39\"\n        var plan1_devs str = \"1 Developer\"\n        var plan1_btn str = \"Buy Now\"\n\n        // Team\n        var plan2_name str = \"Team\"\n        var plan2_subtitle str = \"For small teams\"\n        var plan2_price str = \"$99\"\n        var plan2_devs str = \"Up to 5 Developers\"\n        var plan2_btn str = \"Buy Now\"\n\n        // Enterprise\n        var plan3_name str = \"Enterprise\"\n        var plan3_subtitle str = \"For larger teams\"\n        var plan3_deal str = \"Exclusive Deals\"\n        var plan3_devs str = \"Unlimited Developers\"\n        var plan3_btn str = \"Contact Us\"\n\n        // Shared features\n        var feat1 str = \"All Marketing + Application UI Blocks\"\n        var feat2 str = \"Figma UI Kit\"\n        var feat3 str = \"Lifetime Support\"\n        var feat4 str = \"Unlimited Updates\"\n        var feat5 str = \"Use on Unlimited Projects\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // ── Main Pricing Content ──\n            col {\n                // Section Header: Title uses Theme Accent Color\n                col {\n                    h2 \"Pricing Plans\" {\n                        style: \"text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary tracking-tight text-center\"\n                    }\n                    span \"Choose the plan that fits your needs\" {\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-1 items-center mb-2\"\n                }\n\n                // 3 Cards Row\n                row {\n                    // Plan 1: Single Developer\n                    col {\n                        col {\n                            h3 .plan1_name {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            span .plan1_subtitle {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            span .plan1_price {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mt-2\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mt-2\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            style: title_block\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .plan1_devs {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat1 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat2 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat3 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat4 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat5 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            style: feat_list\n                        }\n                        button .plan1_btn {\n                            onclick: .BuyPlan1\n                            style: \"w-full py-2.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-primary-foreground rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer\"\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 flex-1 max-w-[340px] min-w-[260px] shadow-lg justify-between\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 flex-1 max-w-[340px] min-w-[260px] shadow-sm justify-between\"\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // Plan 2: Team (Recommended)\n                    col {\n                        col {\n                            row {\n                                span \"RECOMMENDED\" {\n                                    style: \"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-xs font-bold rounded-full tracking-wide mb-1\"\n                                }\n                                style: \"justify-center\"\n                            }\n                            h3 .plan2_name {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            span .plan2_subtitle {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            span .plan2_price {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mt-2\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mt-2\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            style: title_block\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .plan2_devs {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat1 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat2 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat3 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat4 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check }\n                                span .feat5 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            style: feat_list\n                        }\n                        button .plan2_btn {\n                            onclick: .BuyPlan2\n                            style: \"w-full py-2.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-primary-foreground rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors shadow-md cursor-pointer\"\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"bg-card rounded-2xl border-2 border-primary p-6 flex-1 max-w-[340px] min-w-[260px] shadow-xl justify-between\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"bg-card rounded-2xl border-2 border-primary p-6 flex-1 max-w-[340px] min-w-[260px] shadow-md justify-between\"\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // Plan 3: Enterprise\n                    col {\n                        col {\n                            h3 .plan3_name {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            span .plan3_subtitle {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            span .plan3_deal {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mt-2\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mt-2\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                            style: title_block\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check_muted }\n                                span .plan3_devs {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check_muted }\n                                span .feat1 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check_muted }\n                                span .feat2 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check_muted }\n                                span .feat3 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check_muted }\n                                span .feat4 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            row {\n                                span \"✓\" { style: feat_check_muted }\n                                span .feat5 {\n                                    style: feat_text\n                                }\n                                style: \"items-center\"\n                            }\n                            style: feat_list\n                        }\n                        button .plan3_btn {\n                            onclick: .BuyPlan3\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"w-full py-2.5 bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary/80 text-secondary-foreground border border-border rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"w-full py-2.5 bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary/80 text-secondary-foreground border border-border rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 flex-1 max-w-[340px] min-w-[260px] shadow-lg justify-between\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 flex-1 max-w-[340px] min-w-[260px] shadow-sm justify-between\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    // PLAN-655: 还原 items-stretch——等高由 StretchLine 两阶段测量供给\n                    // (任意祖先上下文成立,scroll 兜底安全;P642-D12 路线 A)\n                    style: \"gap-6 max-w-5xl w-full items-stretch\"\n                }\n                style: \"w-full flex-1 px-8 py-6 gap-4 items-center justify-center max-w-6xl mx-auto\"\n            }\n\n            style: if .dark_mode {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground\"\n            } else {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .BuyPlan1 -> { print(\"Selected Plan: Single Developer\") }\n        .BuyPlan2 -> { print(\"Selected Plan: Team\") }\n        .BuyPlan3 -> { print(\"Selected Plan: Enterprise\") }\n    }\n}\n\n", pac_text: "name: \"pricing-table\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Pricing Table\"\ntitle_zh: \"价格表\"\ntheme: \"dark\"\naccent: \"indigo\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "价格表 008-pricing-table autoui" },
        { id: "009-article-feed", title: "文章流", category: "02-components", icon: "app-window", description: "文章流", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 009-article-feed — Blog Article Card Feed\n\nA vertical feed of three blog article cards, each showing title, excerpt, and author/date footer.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- Nested col/row composition\n- Text content binding to model fields\n- Repeated card pattern\n- Constrained-width layout with `max-w-2xl`\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    model {\n        var title1 str = \"Getting Started with AutoLang\"\n        var excerpt1 str = \"Learn the basics of AutoLang and build your first cross-platform app.\"\n        var author1 str = \"Alice\"\n        var date1 str = \"Apr 10, 2026\"\n        var title2 str = \"Cross-Platform UI with AURA\"\n        var excerpt2 str = \"Build once, deploy everywhere. AURA widgets compile to Vue, Compose, ArkTS, and GPUI.\"\n        var author2 str = \"Bob\"\n        var date2 str = \"Apr 12, 2026\"\n        var title3 str = \"Advanced Patterns in AutoLang\"\n        var excerpt3 str = \"Take your skills to the next level with tasks, specs, and the type system.\"\n        var author3 str = \"Charlie\"\n        var date3 str = \"Apr 14, 2026\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            text \"Latest Articles\"\n            col {\n                col {\n                    col {\n                        text .title1\n                        text .excerpt1\n                        row {\n                            text .author1\n                            text .date1\n                            class: \"gap-2 items-center\"\n                        }\n                        class: \"p-4 gap-2\"\n                    }\n                    class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden\"\n                }\n                col {\n                    col {\n                        text .title2\n                        text .excerpt2\n                        row {\n                            text .author2\n                            text .date2\n                            class: \"gap-2 items-center\"\n                        }\n                        class: \"p-4 gap-2\"\n                    }\n                    class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden\"\n                }\n                col {\n                    col {\n                        text .title3\n                        text .excerpt3\n                        row {\n                            text .author3\n                            text .date3\n                            class: \"gap-2 items-center\"\n                        }\n                        class: \"p-4 gap-2\"\n                    }\n                    class: \"bg-white rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden\"\n                }\n                class: \"gap-6\"\n            }\n            class: \"w-full max-w-2xl p-8 gap-6\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/009-article-feed\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- Nested col/row: card outer shell > content column > author footer row\n- Text content: binding model strings to text elements with `.title1`, `.excerpt1`\n- Repeated card pattern: three identical card structures with different data\n- Width constraint: `max-w-2xl` keeps the feed readable on wide screens\n- Card styling: `bg-white rounded-lg shadow overflow-hidden` for card appearance\n", source: "// app.at — Article Feed.\n// Plan 506: in-app title bar / Settings panel removed (common header widget\n// retired) — title/theme/accent live in pac.at + os-config, host chrome carries them.\n// Default theme: Dark mode.\n// PLAN-637 B2（A+B 合并，小面授权）：Phase A 提取 art_tag/read_more/thumb_emoji/\n// content_col 各 ×3；Phase B 映射：zinc-100/gray-900→foreground；zinc-400/gray-500\n// /gray-600→muted-foreground；缩略图 bg-zinc-800/80・bg-gray-100→bg-muted、\n// border-zinc-700/50・gray-200/50→border-border/50；卡片→bg-card/border-border、\n// hover:border-zinc-700・gray-300→hover:border-foreground/20；页根→bg-background。\n// 明暗双臂收敛为同串（条件结构保留）。\n\nstyle art_tag = \"text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary\"\nstyle read_more = \"p-0 h-auto text-sm text-primary font-semibold mt-2 hover:underline cursor-pointer\"\nstyle thumb_emoji = \"text-3xl opacity-60\"\nstyle content_col = \"gap-1 flex-1\"\n\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        ReadArticle1,\n        ReadArticle2,\n        ReadArticle3\n    }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = true\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\"   // declared for os-config/env seeding (Plan 504 idiom)\n\n        // Header\n        var header_title str = \"Blog Posts\"\n        var header_subtitle str = \"Discover the latest trends, tips, and best practices in modern web development. From UI components to design systems, stay updated with our expert insights.\"\n\n        // Article 1\n        var art1_tag str = \"Tutorial\"\n        var art1_author str = \"Sarah Chen\"\n        var art1_date str = \"1 Jan 2024\"\n        var art1_title str = \"Getting Started with shadcn/ui Components\"\n        var art1_excerpt str = \"Learn how to quickly integrate and customize shadcn/ui components in your Next.js projects. Covers installation, theming, and best practices for building modern interfaces.\"\n\n        // Article 2\n        var art2_tag str = \"Accessibility\"\n        var art2_author str = \"Marcus Rodriguez\"\n        var art2_date str = \"1 Jan 2024\"\n        var art2_title str = \"Building Accessible Web Applications\"\n        var art2_excerpt str = \"Explore how to create inclusive web experiences using shadcn/ui accessible components. Discover practical tips for implementing ARIA labels, keyboard navigation, and semantic HTML.\"\n\n        // Article 3\n        var art3_tag str = \"Design Systems\"\n        var art3_author str = \"Emma Thompson\"\n        var art3_date str = \"1 Jan 2024\"\n        var art3_title str = \"Modern Design Systems with Tailwind CSS\"\n        var art3_excerpt str = \"Dive into creating scalable design systems using Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui. Learn how to maintain consistency while building flexible and maintainable component libraries.\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // ── Main Article Feed Content ──\n            col {\n                // Section Header\n                col {\n                    h2 .header_title {\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"text-3xl font-extrabold text-foreground tracking-tight text-center\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"text-3xl font-extrabold text-foreground tracking-tight text-center\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    span .header_subtitle {\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center max-w-xl mt-1\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center max-w-xl mt-1\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-1 items-center mb-2\"\n                }\n\n                // Article 1\n                row {\n                    col {\n                        span \"📖\" {\n                            style: thumb_emoji\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"w-32 h-32 rounded-xl bg-muted border border-border/50 shrink-0 items-center justify-center\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"w-32 h-32 rounded-xl bg-muted border border-border/50 shrink-0 items-center justify-center\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            span .art1_tag {\n                                style: art_tag\n                            }\n                            style: \"items-center\"\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span .art1_author\n                            span \"·\"\n                            span .art1_date\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground gap-1.5 items-center mt-1\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground gap-1.5 items-center mt-1\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        h3 .art1_title {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mt-1 hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mt-1 hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        span .art1_excerpt {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        button \"Read more →\" {\n                            variant: \"ghost\"\n                            onclick: .ReadArticle1\n                            style: read_more\n                        }\n                        style: content_col\n                    }\n                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                        \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 gap-6 items-start shadow-lg w-full transition-all hover:border-foreground/20\"\n                    } else {\n                        \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 gap-6 items-start shadow-sm w-full transition-all hover:border-foreground/20\"\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Article 2\n                row {\n                    col {\n                        span \"♿\" {\n                            style: thumb_emoji\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"w-32 h-32 rounded-xl bg-muted border border-border/50 shrink-0 items-center justify-center\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"w-32 h-32 rounded-xl bg-muted border border-border/50 shrink-0 items-center justify-center\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            span .art2_tag {\n                                style: art_tag\n                            }\n                            style: \"items-center\"\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span .art2_author\n                            span \"·\"\n                            span .art2_date\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground gap-1.5 items-center mt-1\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground gap-1.5 items-center mt-1\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        h3 .art2_title {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mt-1 hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mt-1 hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        span .art2_excerpt {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        button \"Read more →\" {\n                            variant: \"ghost\"\n                            onclick: .ReadArticle2\n                            style: read_more\n                        }\n                        style: content_col\n                    }\n                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                        \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 gap-6 items-start shadow-lg w-full transition-all hover:border-foreground/20\"\n                    } else {\n                        \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 gap-6 items-start shadow-sm w-full transition-all hover:border-foreground/20\"\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Article 3\n                row {\n                    col {\n                        span \"🎨\" {\n                            style: thumb_emoji\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"w-32 h-32 rounded-xl bg-muted border border-border/50 shrink-0 items-center justify-center\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"w-32 h-32 rounded-xl bg-muted border border-border/50 shrink-0 items-center justify-center\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            span .art3_tag {\n                                style: art_tag\n                            }\n                            style: \"items-center\"\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            span .art3_author\n                            span \"·\"\n                            span .art3_date\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground gap-1.5 items-center mt-1\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground gap-1.5 items-center mt-1\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        h3 .art3_title {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mt-1 hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mt-1 hover:text-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        span .art3_excerpt {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        button \"Read more →\" {\n                            variant: \"ghost\"\n                            onclick: .ReadArticle3\n                            style: read_more\n                        }\n                        style: content_col\n                    }\n                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                        \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 gap-6 items-start shadow-lg w-full transition-all hover:border-foreground/20\"\n                    } else {\n                        \"bg-card rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 gap-6 items-start shadow-sm w-full transition-all hover:border-foreground/20\"\n                    }\n                }\n\n                style: \"w-full flex-1 px-8 py-6 gap-6 items-center justify-start max-w-4xl mx-auto\"\n            }\n\n            style: if .dark_mode {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground\"\n            } else {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .ReadArticle1 -> { print(\"Reading article 1\") }\n        .ReadArticle2 -> { print(\"Reading article 2\") }\n        .ReadArticle3 -> { print(\"Reading article 3\") }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"article-feed\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Article Feed\"\ntitle_zh: \"文章流\"\ntheme: \"dark\"\naccent: \"indigo\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "文章流 009-article-feed autoui" },
        { id: "010-contact-form", title: "联系表单", category: "02-components", icon: "app-window", description: "联系表单", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 010-contact-form — Contact Form with Submit Feedback\n\nA contact form with name, email, and message inputs plus a submit button that shows a confirmation message.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- Input widget with two-way binding — a bare `value: .field` syncs typed text into state on every backend (Plan 448 C), no msg/on boilerplate\n- Textarea widget for multi-line input\n- Button with onclick handler\n- Conditional success message\n\n## Source\n\nSee `front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    msg { Submit }\n\n    model {\n        var name str = \"\"\n        var email str = \"\"\n        var message str = \"\"\n        var submitted bool = false\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            text \"Contact Us\"\n            text \"We'd love to hear from you. Send us a message and we'll respond as soon as possible.\"\n            input { placeholder: \"Your Name\", value: .name }\n            input { placeholder: \"Your Email\", value: .email }\n            textarea { placeholder: \"Your Message\", value: .message }\n            button \"Send Message\" { onclick: .Submit }\n            if .submitted {\n                text \"Thank you! We'll be in touch.\"\n            }\n            class: \"w-full max-w-lg p-8 gap-4\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Submit -> {\n            .submitted = true\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/010-contact-form\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Concepts Taught\n\n- Input widget: `input` with `placeholder` and `value` — the bare `value:` binding is two-way\n- Textarea widget: `textarea` for multi-line text input\n- Button with `onclick` bound to the `Submit` message\n- Conditional rendering: `if .submitted` shows a success message after submit\n- Message block: `on` handlers update model fields and set `submitted` to true\n", source: "// app.at — Contact Form.\n// PLAN-637 B2（A+B 合并）：Phase A 提取 field_col ×3；Phase B 映射（2026-09-17）：\n// zinc/gray 明暗臂按角色收敛——zinc-100・gray-900/zinc-200→foreground；zinc-400・\n// gray-500・gray-600・gray-700（眉标签）→muted-foreground；border-zinc-800・gray-200→\n// border-border；卡面 bg-zinc-900・bg-white→bg-card（shadow 差异保留条件）；页根→\n// bg-background/text-foreground。豁免：发送成功回执的 emerald 簇 ×5（success 语义\n// registry 无键，装饰性状态色豁免，主题系统立项时评估回迁——与 004 状态点同口径）。\n\n// PLAN-637 T-01b（用户裁定：demo 跟随系统）：SettingsPopover 消费面移除，\n// 主题控制由 gallery 宿主切换器承接；SetTheme/SetAccent 消息面保留\n// （宿主 → 内嵌 demo 主题传播路线的既有通道），本 demo 内无发射方。\n\nstyle field_col = \"gap-1.5 w-full\"\n\nwidget App {\n    msg { Submit, SetTheme(str), SetAccent(str) }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = true\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\"   // declared for os-config/env seeding (Plan 504 idiom)\n\n        var name str = \"\"\n        var email str = \"\"\n        var message str = \"\"\n        var submitted bool = false\n\n        // FAQ data (Plan 448 F: list-of-structs + for, replacing the ten\n        // hand-unrolled faq1_q..faq5_a scalars; last item drops the border).\n        var faqs = [\n            { q: \"What are your business hours?\", a: \"Our support team is available Monday through Friday, 9am to 6pm EST. For urgent matters outside these hours, please email urgent@company.com.\" },\n            { q: \"How long does it take to get a response?\", a: \"Our team typically responds to all inquiries within 24 hours during business days.\" },\n            { q: \"Do you offer phone support?\", a: \"Phone support is available for Enterprise plan subscribers. Free and Starter plans receive email and community support.\" },\n            { q: \"Can I schedule a demo?\", a: \"Yes! Contact our sales team using the form and select demo request to schedule a live 30-minute walkthrough.\" }\n        ]\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // ── Main Contact Form & FAQ Content ──\n            col {\n                // Section Header\n                col {\n                    h1 \"How can we help?\" {\n                        style: \"text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary tracking-tight text-center\"\n                    }\n                    span \"Check our FAQ for quick answers or send us a message.\" {\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center max-w-xl mt-1\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center max-w-xl mt-1\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-1 items-center mb-2\"\n                }\n\n                // Two-column Layout\n                row {\n                    // Left Column: FAQ Card\n                    col {\n                        h3 \"Frequently Asked Questions\" {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            for i, f in .faqs {\n                                col {\n                                    span f.q {\n                                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                                            \"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"font-semibold text-foreground text-sm\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    span f.a {\n                                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    style: if i < .faqs.len() - 1 {\n                                        if .dark_mode {\n                                            \"py-3 border-b border-border\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"py-3 border-b border-border\"\n                                        }\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"py-3\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                            style: \"w-full\"\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"flex-1 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-lg gap-3\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"flex-1 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-sm gap-3\"\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // Right Column: Contact Form Card\n                    col {\n                        h3 \"Still have questions?\" {\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            col {\n                                span \"Name *\" {\n                                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                                input { placeholder: \"Your name\", value: .name }\n                                style: field_col\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Email *\" {\n                                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                                input { placeholder: \"you@example.com\", value: .email }\n                                style: field_col\n                            }\n                            col {\n                                span \"Message *\" {\n                                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                                textarea { placeholder: \"How can we help?\", value: .message }\n                                style: field_col\n                            }\n                            if .submitted {\n                                row {\n                                    span \"✓\" { style: \"text-emerald-500 font-bold text-base\" }\n                                    span \"Thank you! Your message has been sent.\" {\n                                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                                            \"text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"text-sm font-medium text-emerald-600\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"w-full p-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-800 gap-2 items-center mt-1\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"w-full p-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 gap-2 items-center mt-1\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                            button \"Send Message\" {\n                                onclick: .Submit\n                                style: \"w-full py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 shadow-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer mt-2\"\n                            }\n                            style: \"w-full gap-4\"\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"flex-1 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-lg gap-3\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"flex-1 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-sm gap-3\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    style: \"w-full gap-6 items-start\"\n                }\n\n                style: \"w-full flex-1 px-8 py-6 gap-6 items-center justify-start max-w-5xl mx-auto\"\n            }\n\n            style: if .dark_mode {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground relative\"\n            } else {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground relative\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Submit -> {\n            .submitted = true\n        }\n        .SetTheme(t) -> {\n            if t == \"light\" {\n                .dark_mode = false\n            }\n            if t == \"dark\" {\n                .dark_mode = true\n            }\n        }\n        .SetAccent(name) -> { .accent_color = name }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"contact-form\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Contact Form\"\ntitle_zh: \"联系表单\"\ntheme: \"dark\"\naccent: \"indigo\"\n\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "联系表单 010-contact-form autoui" },
        { id: "011-calculator", title: "计算器", category: "02-components", icon: "calculator", description: "计算器", tags: ["Grid", "Math"], doc: "# 011-calculator — Four-Function Calculator\n\nBasic calculator with a display and a 5-row button grid (0-9, +, -, *, /, =, C, %, .).\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Grid layout** — 4-column button grid arranged using nested `row` elements\n- **Complex state machine** — chained operations with `display`, `prev_value`, `operator`, and `new_number` flags\n- **Conditional logic in handlers** — `if` statements in `on` blocks to differentiate new-number vs append behavior\n- **Class variants** — distinct button styles (`calc-btn-func`, `calc-btn-op`, `calc-btn-num`, `calc-btn-eq`)\n\n## Source\n\nSee `src/front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    msg { Digit0, Digit1, Digit2, Digit3, Digit4, Digit5, Digit6, Digit7, Digit8, Digit9, Add, Sub, Mul, Div, Equals, Clear, Dot, Percent }\n\n    model {\n        var display str = \"0\"\n        var prev_value double = 0.0\n        var operator str = \"\"\n        var new_number bool = true\n    }\n\n    view {\n        center {\n            col {\n                // Display\n                col {\n                    text .display {\n                        class: \"text-5xl font-light text-gray-800 text-right w-full\"\n                    }\n                    text .operator {\n                        class: \"text-sm text-gray-400 text-right w-full\"\n                    }\n                    class: \"w-full p-6 bg-gray-900 rounded-t-2xl\"\n                }\n\n                // Button grid: 4 columns\n                col {\n                    row {\n                        button \"C\" { onclick: .Clear, class: \"calc-btn-func\" }\n                        button \"%\" { onclick: .Percent, class: \"calc-btn-func\" }\n                        button \"/\" { onclick: .Div, class: \"calc-btn-op\" }\n                        button \"*\" { onclick: .Mul, class: \"calc-btn-op\" }\n                    }\n                    row {\n                        button \"7\" { onclick: .Digit7, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"8\" { onclick: .Digit8, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"9\" { onclick: .Digit9, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"-\" { onclick: .Sub, class: \"calc-btn-op\" }\n                    }\n                    row {\n                        button \"4\" { onclick: .Digit4, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"5\" { onclick: .Digit5, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"6\" { onclick: .Digit6, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"+\" { onclick: .Add, class: \"calc-btn-op\" }\n                    }\n                    row {\n                        button \"1\" { onclick: .Digit1, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"2\" { onclick: .Digit2, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"3\" { onclick: .Digit3, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                        button \"=\" { onclick: .Equals, class: \"calc-btn-eq\" }\n                    }\n                    row {\n                        button \"0\" { onclick: .Digit0, class: \"calc-btn-num calc-btn-wide\" }\n                        button \".\" { onclick: .Dot, class: \"calc-btn-num\" }\n                    }\n                    class: \"w-full p-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-b-2xl gap-1\"\n                }\n                class: \"w-80 bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Clear -> { .display = \"0\"; .prev_value = 0.0; .operator = \"\"; .new_number = true }\n        .Digit1 -> { if .new_number { .display = \"1\" } else { .display = .display + \"1\" }; .new_number = false }\n        // ... other digits follow same pattern\n        .Add -> { .operator = \"+\"; .new_number = true }\n        .Equals -> { .display = \"0\"; .operator = \"\"; .new_number = true }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/011-calculator\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `gen/vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `gen/jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `gen/ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `gen/rust/` — Rust GPUI\n\n## Inspiration\n\nFlutter Simplistic Calculator, iced calculator examples.\n", source: "// app.at — Calculator (Plan 403: expression engine + grid + multi-mode).\n// Plan 504: 桌面化改造 —— 应用内 title bar / settings 面板移除（title/theme/\n// accent 上移 pac.at + os-config，宿主 chrome 承接）；外壳改\"内容即页面\"\n// （无 min-h-screen + center 包裹），配合 pac `window: \"fit\"` 窗口随内容收缩。\n// is_digit/pow 等通用函数不再应用内手写 —— 静态分发到 str.is_digit() /\n// math.pow()（Vue 端 TS 系统函数，VM 端 Rust 库函数）。\n//\n// Engine upgrade (需求 1c): the calculator now builds an expression STRING\n// (e.g. \"2*(3+4)\") and evaluates it on \"=\" with full operator precedence,\n// parentheses, and decimal support — via a shunting-yard evaluator (fn eval_expr).\n// This replaces the old chained-integer engine (no precedence, no parens, int-only).\n//\n// Layout (需求 2): grid-based keypad (4-col). Multi-mode (需求 3): Basic /\n// Scientific / Programmer layouts selected by a mode switch; the scientific grid\n// adds parentheses + sin/cos/sqrt/etc; programmer adds hex/bin (display only).\n//\n// PLAN-615 T-07: Programmer 模式升格为完整 HEX 计算器——HEX/DEC/OCT/BIN 四基\n// 切换 + 随基键盘（A-F）+ 四基实时换算读出 + 位运算六键（AND/OR/XOR/NOT/SHL/\n// SHR）+ MOD。int 域即时执行（无表达式/优先级），32 位无符号 wrap；数值以\n// 16-bit 肢对存储、肢运算库见 prog_util.at（双端 TS/VM 纯整型精确一致）。\n\nuse prog_util: pdigit_val, pdigit_new_lo, pdigit_new_hi, pop_lo, pop_hi, pdiv, pcur_fmt, pline_calc\n\n// PLAN-637 B5 Phase B 映射（2026-09-17）：数字键 zinc-800/gray-200→bg-secondary、配字\n// white/gray-900→white/secondary-foreground；功能键行 zinc-700/gray-300→bg-muted、配字\n// →white/secondary-foreground；显示器 text-red-400→text-primary；zinc-300/400→次级文字。\n// 豁免（类目色）：运算符 bg-orange-500 ×N、科学键 bg-indigo-700 ×N（配对 text-white 同留）\n// ——计算器键位色彩编码，registry 无语义键。\nstyle key_digit_dark = \"w-full bg-secondary text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\"\nstyle key_digit_light = \"w-full bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\"\nstyle key_fn_dark = \"w-full bg-muted text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\"\nstyle key_fn_light = \"w-full bg-muted text-secondary-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\"\nstyle key_op = \"w-full bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg font-bold\"\nstyle key_sci = \"w-full bg-indigo-700 text-white rounded-lg p-3 text-sm\"\nstyle key_fn_muted = \"w-full bg-muted text-primary rounded-lg p-3 text-sm font-semibold\"\n\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        Digit(int),\n        Operator(str),\n        Paren(str),       // \"(\" or \")\"\n        Equals,\n        Clear,\n        ClearEntry,       // CE: clear current entry only\n        Backspace,\n        Negate,\n        Dot,\n        Percent,\n        SciFn(str),       // sin, cos, tan, sqrt, etc. (scientific mode)\n        SetMode(str),     // \"basic\" | \"scientific\" | \"programmer\"\n        // PLAN-615 T-07: Programmer 模式（immediate-execution，32 位无符号域，\n        // 16-bit 肢存储——双端 TS/VM 纯整型精确一致，见文件尾肢运算库注释）。\n        PDigit(str),      // 数字/十六进制字母键（按当前 pbase 校验，非法忽略）\n        POp(str),         // 二元运算键：+ - * / % AND OR XOR SHL SHR\n        PNot,             // 一元 NOT（按位取反，立即作用于当前值）\n        PEq,              // 等号\n        PBack,            // 退格（当前输入）\n        PBase(str)        // 基底切换：HEX | DEC | OCT | BIN\n    }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = true\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\"\n\n        // Expression engine: the full expression being built (e.g. \"2*(3+4)\").\n        var expr str = \"\"\n        // The live display (what the user sees in the big readout).\n        var display str = \"0\"\n        // The small expression line above the display (\"2 * (3 + 4) =\").\n        var expr_line str = \"\"\n        // Error message (e.g. \"Cannot divide by zero\"); empty = OK.\n        var error str = \"\"\n        // Calculator mode.\n        var mode str = \"basic\"\n\n        // ── PLAN-615 T-07: Programmer 模式状态 ──\n        // 当前基底：HEX | DEC | OCT | BIN。\n        var pbase str = \"DEC\"\n        // 32 位无符号累加器与当前输入，各拆 16-bit 肢（hi/lo，恒 < 65536，\n        // 双端 int 精确；肢运算库见文件尾）。why 肢：VM `int` 状态存储截断\n        // i32（2^31 以上不可存），TS number 与 VM 共同精确域为 < 2^53——\n        // 肢化后一切存储 < 2^17、一切表达式中间值 < 2^48，两端零分歧。\n        var pacc_hi int = 0\n        var pacc_lo int = 0\n        var pnum_hi int = 0\n        var pnum_lo int = 0\n        // 是否在输入数字中（false = 下一个数字键开启新输入）。\n        var pentering bool = false\n        // 待二元运算符（\"\" = 无）。+ - * / % AND OR XOR SHL SHR MOD\n        var pop str = \"\"\n        // Programmer 错误信息（除零）；空 = OK。\n        var perr str = \"\"\n    }\n\n    // PLAN-615 T-07: Programmer 派生显示全部走 computed（模块纯函数，双端\n    // 转译；Plan 522 范式）——处理器只写原始状态，视图零函数调用。\n    computed {\n        pbig => pcur_fmt(.pentering, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pbase)\n        phex => pcur_fmt(.pentering, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, \"HEX\")\n        pdec => pcur_fmt(.pentering, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, \"DEC\")\n        poct => pcur_fmt(.pentering, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, \"OCT\")\n        pbin => pcur_fmt(.pentering, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, \"BIN\")\n        pline => pline_calc(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, .pbase)\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // ── Display ──\n            col {\n                        // Mode tabs\n                        row {\n                            style: \"w-full gap-1 p-1\"\n                            button \"Basic\" {\n                                onclick: .SetMode(\"basic\")\n                                style: if .mode == \"basic\" {\n                                    \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-orange-500 text-white font-medium\"\n                                } else {\n                                    if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                            button \"Scientific\" {\n                                onclick: .SetMode(\"scientific\")\n                                style: if .mode == \"scientific\" {\n                                    \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-orange-500 text-white font-medium\"\n                                } else {\n                                    if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                            button \"Programmer\" {\n                                onclick: .SetMode(\"programmer\")\n                                style: if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                                    \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-orange-500 text-white font-medium\"\n                                } else {\n                                    if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"flex-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-muted transition-colors\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                        // Expression + result（programmer 模式换用 pline/pbig——\n                        // PLAN-615 T-07：int 域显示与 float 表达式引擎隔离）\n                        if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                            text .pline {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                        } else {\n                            text .expr_line {\n                                style: if .dark_mode {\n                                    \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"text-sm text-muted-foreground text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                        if .error != \"\" {\n                            text .error {\n                                style: \"text-2xl font-light text-primary text-right w-full\"\n                            }\n                        } else {\n                            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                                text .pbig {\n                                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"text-4xl font-light text-white text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"text-4xl font-light text-secondary-foreground text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            } else {\n                                text .display {\n                                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                                        \"text-4xl font-light text-white text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"text-4xl font-light text-secondary-foreground text-right w-full truncate\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                        // PLAN-615 T-08: 复制结果（剪贴板；VM auto.clipboard\n                        // native 2926 / vue navigator.clipboard 双端）\n                        row {\n                            style: \"w-full justify-end\"\n                            button \"⧉ 复制\" {\n                                onclick: .Copy\n                                style: \"px-2 py-0.5 text-xs rounded bg-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        // PLAN-615 T-07: Programmer 模式面板——基底切换 + 四基实时\n                        // 换算读出（当前基高亮；其余行可点击直切）。语义 token 类\n                        // （bg-primary/bg-muted/text-foreground…）随主题自动切换，\n                        // 与 W3 主题链（T-04/05/06）直连，零手工 dark 分支。\n                        if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                            if .perr == \"\" {\n                                row {\n                                    style: \"w-full gap-1 pt-1\"\n                                    button \"HEX\" {\n                                        onclick: .PBase(\"HEX\")\n                                        style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-primary text-white font-semibold\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-muted text-muted-foreground\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    button \"DEC\" {\n                                        onclick: .PBase(\"DEC\")\n                                        style: if .pbase == \"DEC\" {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-primary text-white font-semibold\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-muted text-muted-foreground\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    button \"OCT\" {\n                                        onclick: .PBase(\"OCT\")\n                                        style: if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-primary text-white font-semibold\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-muted text-muted-foreground\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    button \"BIN\" {\n                                        onclick: .PBase(\"BIN\")\n                                        style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-primary text-white font-semibold\"\n                                        } else {\n                                            \"flex-1 px-1 py-1 text-xs rounded-md bg-muted text-muted-foreground\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                }\n                                button f\"HEX  ${.phex}\" {\n                                    onclick: .PBase(\"HEX\")\n                                    style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                                button f\"DEC  ${.pdec}\" {\n                                    onclick: .PBase(\"DEC\")\n                                    style: if .pbase == \"DEC\" {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                                button f\"OCT  ${.poct}\" {\n                                    onclick: .PBase(\"OCT\")\n                                    style: if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                                button f\"BIN  ${.pbin}\" {\n                                    onclick: .PBase(\"BIN\")\n                                    style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    } else {\n                                        \"w-full text-right text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground bg-transparent px-0\"\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                            if .perr != \"\" {\n                                text .perr {\n                                    style: \"text-lg font-light text-primary text-right w-full\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"w-full p-4 bg-background rounded-t-2xl gap-1\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"w-full p-4 bg-muted rounded-t-2xl gap-1 border-b border-border\"\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // ── Keypad ──\n                    // Basic + Scientific share the same grid; Scientific adds a\n                    // top block of sci buttons. Programmer shows the basic grid\n                    // (bit-logic operations are future work).\n                    if .mode == \"scientific\" {\n                        grid {\n                            grid-item { button \"sin\" { onclick: .SciFn(\"sin\"),  style: key_sci } }\n                            grid-item { button \"cos\" { onclick: .SciFn(\"cos\"),  style: key_sci } }\n                            grid-item { button \"tan\" { onclick: .SciFn(\"tan\"),  style: key_sci } }\n                            grid-item { button \"sqrt\" { onclick: .SciFn(\"sqrt\"), style: key_sci } }\n                            grid-item { button \"^\" { onclick: .Operator(\"^\"),    style: key_sci } }\n                            grid-item { button \"pi\" { onclick: .SciFn(\"pi\"),    style: key_sci } }\n                            cols: 6\n                            gap: 1\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"w-full px-2 pt-1 bg-secondary\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"w-full px-2 pt-1 bg-secondary\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // Main keypad (shared by basic/scientific; PLAN-615 T-07 起\n                    // programmer 使用专属 int 键盘，见下方 Programmer 键盘组)。\n                    if .mode != \"programmer\" {\n                    grid {\n                        grid-item { button \"C\"   { onclick: .Clear,         style: if .dark_mode { key_fn_dark } else { key_fn_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"+/-\" { onclick: .Negate,        style: if .dark_mode { key_fn_dark } else { key_fn_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"%\"   { onclick: .Percent,       style: if .dark_mode { key_fn_dark } else { key_fn_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"/\"   { onclick: .Operator(\"/\"), style: key_op } }\n\n                        grid-item { button \"7\"   { onclick: .Digit(7),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"8\"   { onclick: .Digit(8),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"9\"   { onclick: .Digit(9),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"*\"   { onclick: .Operator(\"*\"), style: key_op } }\n\n                        grid-item { button \"4\"   { onclick: .Digit(4),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"5\"   { onclick: .Digit(5),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"6\"   { onclick: .Digit(6),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"-\"   { onclick: .Operator(\"-\"), style: key_op } }\n\n                        grid-item { button \"1\"   { onclick: .Digit(1),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"2\"   { onclick: .Digit(2),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"3\"   { onclick: .Digit(3),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"+\"   { onclick: .Operator(\"+\"), style: key_op } }\n\n                        grid-item { button \"(\"   { onclick: .Paren(\"(\"),    style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"0\"   { onclick: .Digit(0),      style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \".\"   { onclick: .Dot,           style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"=\"   { onclick: .Equals,        style: key_op } }\n\n                        grid-item { button \")\"   { onclick: .Paren(\")\"),    style: if .dark_mode { key_digit_dark } else { key_digit_light } } }\n                        grid-item { button \"⌫\"   { onclick: .Backspace,     style: if .dark_mode { key_fn_dark } else { key_fn_light } } }\n                        grid-item { text \"\"      { style: \"bg-transparent\" } }\n                        grid-item { text \"\"      { style: \"bg-transparent\" } }\n\n                        cols: 4\n                        gap: 1\n                        style: if .dark_mode {\n                            \"w-full p-2 bg-secondary rounded-b-2xl\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"w-full p-2 bg-secondary rounded-b-2xl\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    }\n\n                    // ── PLAN-615 T-07: Programmer 专属键盘组（immediate-execution\n                    // int 域，32 位无符号）。全部语义 token 类随主题自动切换。\n                    if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                        // 位运算排（AND OR XOR NOT / SHL SHR MOD ÷）\n                        grid {\n                            grid-item { button \"AND\" { onclick: .POp(\"AND\"), style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            grid-item { button \"OR\"  { onclick: .POp(\"OR\"),  style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            grid-item { button \"XOR\" { onclick: .POp(\"XOR\"), style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            grid-item { button \"NOT\" { onclick: .PNot,       style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            grid-item { button \"SHL\" { onclick: .POp(\"SHL\"), style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            grid-item { button \"SHR\" { onclick: .POp(\"SHR\"), style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            grid-item { button \"MOD\" { onclick: .POp(\"MOD\"), style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            grid-item { button \"÷\"   { onclick: .POp(\"/\"),   style: key_fn_muted } }\n                            cols: 4\n                            gap: 1\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"w-full px-2 pt-1 bg-secondary\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"w-full px-2 pt-1 bg-secondary\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        // HEX 字母排（非 HEX 基底灰显，处理器端亦忽略非法键）\n                        grid {\n                            grid-item { button \"A\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"A\"), style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono opacity-30\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"B\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"B\"), style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono opacity-30\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"C\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"C\"), style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono opacity-30\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"D\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"D\"), style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono opacity-30\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"E\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"E\"), style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono opacity-30\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"F\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"F\"), style: if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-3 text-base font-mono opacity-30\" } } }\n                            cols: 3\n                            gap: 1\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"w-full px-2 pt-1 bg-secondary\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"w-full px-2 pt-1 bg-secondary\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        // 主 int 键盘（BIN 时 2-9 灰显；OCT 时 8-9 灰显——\n                        // 灰显条件用嵌套 if 表达，视图条件不用布尔算符）\n                        grid {\n                            grid-item { button \"C\" { onclick: .Clear,       style: \"w-full bg-muted text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } }\n                            grid-item { button \"⌫\" { onclick: .PBack,       style: \"w-full bg-muted text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } }\n                            grid-item { text \"\"      { style: \"bg-transparent\" } }\n                            grid-item { button \"÷\" { onclick: .POp(\"/\"),    style: \"w-full bg-primary text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg font-bold\" } }\n\n                            grid-item { button \"7\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"7\"), style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"8\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"8\"), style: if .pbase == \"DEC\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } else { if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"9\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"9\"), style: if .pbase == \"DEC\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } else { if .pbase == \"HEX\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"×\" { onclick: .POp(\"*\"),    style: \"w-full bg-primary text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg font-bold\" } }\n\n                            grid-item { button \"4\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"4\"), style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"5\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"5\"), style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"6\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"6\"), style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"−\" { onclick: .POp(\"-\"),    style: \"w-full bg-primary text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg font-bold\" } }\n\n                            grid-item { button \"1\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"1\"), style: \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } }\n                            grid-item { button \"2\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"2\"), style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"3\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"3\"), style: if .pbase == \"BIN\" { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg opacity-30\" } else { \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } } }\n                            grid-item { button \"+\" { onclick: .POp(\"+\"),    style: \"w-full bg-primary text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg font-bold\" } }\n\n                            grid-item { button \"0\" { onclick: .PDigit(\"0\"), style: \"w-full bg-card text-foreground rounded-lg p-4 text-lg\" } }\n                            grid-item { text \"\"      { style: \"bg-transparent\" } }\n                            grid-item { text \"\"      { style: \"bg-transparent\" } }\n                            grid-item { button \"=\"   { onclick: .PEq,       style: \"w-full bg-primary text-white rounded-lg p-4 text-lg font-bold\" } }\n\n                            cols: 4\n                            gap: 1\n                            style: if .dark_mode {\n                                \"w-full p-2 bg-secondary rounded-b-2xl\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"w-full p-2 bg-secondary rounded-b-2xl\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    style: if .dark_mode {\n                        \"w-96 bg-background border border-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\"\n                    } else {\n                        \"w-96 bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\"\n                    }\n        }\n    }\n\n    bind {\n        \"Enter\" -> .Equals\n        \"Escape\" -> .Clear\n        \"Backspace\" -> .Backspace\n        // PLAN-615 T-08: 键盘直输——bind 语法零参（parser.rs parse_bind_block\n        // 仅收 .Name），模式路由在 Key 处理器内完成；HEX 字母绑双大小写。\n        \"0\" -> .Key0\n        \"1\" -> .Key1\n        \"2\" -> .Key2\n        \"3\" -> .Key3\n        \"4\" -> .Key4\n        \"5\" -> .Key5\n        \"6\" -> .Key6\n        \"7\" -> .Key7\n        \"8\" -> .Key8\n        \"9\" -> .Key9\n        \"a\" -> .KeyA\n        \"A\" -> .KeyA\n        \"b\" -> .KeyB\n        \"B\" -> .KeyB\n        \"c\" -> .KeyC\n        \"C\" -> .KeyC\n        \"d\" -> .KeyD\n        \"D\" -> .KeyD\n        \"e\" -> .KeyE\n        \"E\" -> .KeyE\n        \"f\" -> .KeyF\n        \"F\" -> .KeyF\n        \"+\" -> .KeyAdd\n        \"-\" -> .KeySub\n        \"*\" -> .KeyMul\n        \"/\" -> .KeyDiv\n        \"=\" -> .Equals\n    }\n\n    on {\n        // PLAN-615 T-08: 复制当前显示值（programmer 走 pcur_fmt 重算——\n        // computed 值不经状态通道）\n        .Copy -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                let v str = pcur_fmt(.pentering, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pbase)\n                dom.copy_text(v)\n            } else {\n                dom.copy_text(.display)\n            }\n        }\n        // ── PLAN-615 T-08: 零参 Key 处理器族（bind 语法零参约束下的\n        // 模式感知路由；肢乘加复用 prog_util.pdigit_new_lo/hi）──\n                .Key0 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"0\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"0\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key1 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"1\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"1\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key2 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"2\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"2\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key3 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"3\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"3\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key4 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"4\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"4\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key5 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"5\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"5\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key6 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"6\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"6\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key7 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"7\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"7\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key8 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"8\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"8\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .Key9 -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"9\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"9\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyA -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"A\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyB -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"B\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyC -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"C\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyD -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"D\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyE -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"E\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyF -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                var d int = pdigit_val(\"F\", base)\n                if d >= 0 {\n                    .perr = \"\"\n                    if !.pentering {\n                        .pnum_hi = 0\n                        .pnum_lo = 0\n                        .pentering = true\n                    }\n                    var nl int = pdigit_new_lo(.pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    var nh int = pdigit_new_hi(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, base, d)\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyAdd -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                .perr = \"\"\n                if .pop != \"\" {\n                    if .pentering {\n                        if .pop == \"/\" {\n                            if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                                .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        if .perr == \"\" {\n                            var nl int = pop_lo(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            var nh int = pop_hi(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            .pacc_lo = nl\n                            .pacc_hi = nh\n                            .pnum_lo = nl\n                            .pnum_hi = nh\n                        }\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    .pacc_hi = .pnum_hi\n                    .pacc_lo = .pnum_lo\n                }\n                .pop = \"+\"\n                .pentering = false\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"+\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .KeySub -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                .perr = \"\"\n                if .pop != \"\" {\n                    if .pentering {\n                        if .pop == \"/\" {\n                            if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                                .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        if .perr == \"\" {\n                            var nl int = pop_lo(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            var nh int = pop_hi(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            .pacc_lo = nl\n                            .pacc_hi = nh\n                            .pnum_lo = nl\n                            .pnum_hi = nh\n                        }\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    .pacc_hi = .pnum_hi\n                    .pacc_lo = .pnum_lo\n                }\n                .pop = \"-\"\n                .pentering = false\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"-\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyMul -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                .perr = \"\"\n                if .pop != \"\" {\n                    if .pentering {\n                        if .pop == \"/\" {\n                            if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                                .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        if .perr == \"\" {\n                            var nl int = pop_lo(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            var nh int = pop_hi(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            .pacc_lo = nl\n                            .pacc_hi = nh\n                            .pnum_lo = nl\n                            .pnum_hi = nh\n                        }\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    .pacc_hi = .pnum_hi\n                    .pacc_lo = .pnum_lo\n                }\n                .pop = \"*\"\n                .pentering = false\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"*\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n                .KeyDiv -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                .perr = \"\"\n                if .pop != \"\" {\n                    if .pentering {\n                        if .pop == \"/\" {\n                            if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                                .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        if .perr == \"\" {\n                            var nl int = pop_lo(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            var nh int = pop_hi(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                            .pacc_lo = nl\n                            .pacc_hi = nh\n                            .pnum_lo = nl\n                            .pnum_hi = nh\n                        }\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    .pacc_hi = .pnum_hi\n                    .pacc_lo = .pnum_lo\n                }\n                .pop = \"/\"\n                .pentering = false\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + \"/\"\n                .display = .expr\n                .error = \"\"\n            }\n        }\n        .SetMode(m str) -> {\n            .mode = m\n        }\n        .Clear -> {\n            .expr = \"\"\n            .display = \"0\"\n            .expr_line = \"\"\n            .error = \"\"\n            // PLAN-615 T-07: 同清 programmer 状态\n            .pacc_hi = 0\n            .pacc_lo = 0\n            .pnum_hi = 0\n            .pnum_lo = 0\n            .pentering = false\n            .pop = \"\"\n            .perr = \"\"\n        }\n        // ── PLAN-615 T-07: Programmer 处理器（int 域即时执行）──\n        .PBase(b str) -> {\n            .pbase = b\n            .perr = \"\"\n        }\n        .PDigit(ch str) -> {\n            var base int = 10\n            if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                base = 16\n            }\n            if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                base = 8\n            }\n            if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                base = 2\n            }\n            var d int = pdigit_val(ch, base)\n            if d >= 0 {\n                .perr = \"\"\n                if !.pentering {\n                    .pnum_hi = 0\n                    .pnum_lo = 0\n                    .pentering = true\n                }\n                // value = value * base + d（肢内乘加；全量 < 2^21 双端精确）\n                var nl int = .pnum_lo * base + d\n                var c int = nl / 65536\n                nl = nl - c * 65536\n                var nh int = (.pnum_hi * base + c) % 65536\n                .pnum_lo = nl\n                .pnum_hi = nh\n            }\n        }\n        .POp(op str) -> {\n            .perr = \"\"\n            if .pop != \"\" {\n                if .pentering {\n                    // 结算待结算运算：acc = apply(pop, acc, num)\n                    if .pop == \"/\" {\n                        if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                            .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if .pop == \"MOD\" {\n                        if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                            .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if .perr == \"\" {\n                        var nl int = pop_lo(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                        var nh int = pop_hi(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                        .pacc_lo = nl\n                        .pacc_hi = nh\n                        .pnum_lo = nl\n                        .pnum_hi = nh\n                    }\n                }\n            } else {\n                // 首操作数入 accumulator\n                .pacc_hi = .pnum_hi\n                .pacc_lo = .pnum_lo\n            }\n            .pop = op\n            .pentering = false\n        }\n        .PEq -> {\n            if .pop != \"\" {\n                if .pop == \"/\" {\n                    if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                        .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                    }\n                }\n                if .pop == \"MOD\" {\n                    if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                        .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                    }\n                }\n                if .perr == \"\" {\n                    var nl int = pop_lo(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                    var nh int = pop_hi(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                    .pacc_lo = nl\n                    .pacc_hi = nh\n                    .pnum_lo = nl\n                    .pnum_hi = nh\n                }\n                .pop = \"\"\n                .pentering = false\n            }\n        }\n        .PNot -> {\n            .perr = \"\"\n            // 按位取反 = 65535 - 肢（16-bit 补数，双肢合即 ~32 位值）\n            if .pentering {\n                .pnum_lo = 65535 - .pnum_lo\n                .pnum_hi = 65535 - .pnum_hi\n            } else {\n                .pacc_lo = 65535 - .pacc_lo\n                .pacc_hi = 65535 - .pacc_hi\n                .pnum_lo = .pacc_lo\n                .pnum_hi = .pacc_hi\n            }\n        }\n        .PBack -> {\n            .perr = \"\"\n            if .pentering {\n                // 退一位数字 = 当前输入整除基底（基底内合法数字恒可整除回退）\n                var base int = 10\n                if .pbase == \"HEX\" {\n                    base = 16\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"OCT\" {\n                    base = 8\n                }\n                if .pbase == \"BIN\" {\n                    base = 2\n                }\n                var nl int = pdiv(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, 0, base, 0)\n                var nh int = pdiv(.pnum_hi, .pnum_lo, 0, base, 1)\n                .pnum_lo = nl\n                .pnum_hi = nh\n            }\n        }\n        .ClearEntry -> {\n            .display = \"0\"\n        }\n        .Backspace -> {\n            if .expr.len() > 0 {\n                .expr = .expr.slice(0, .expr.len() - 1)\n                .display = .expr\n            }\n            if .expr == \"\" {\n                .display = \"0\"\n            }\n        }\n        .Negate -> {\n            // Negate the current expression by wrapping in -( ... )\n            .expr = \"-(\" + .expr + \")\"\n            .display = .expr\n        }\n        .Dot -> {\n            .expr = .expr + \".\"\n            .display = .expr\n        }\n        .Percent -> {\n            .expr = .expr + \"/100\"\n            .display = .expr\n        }\n        .Digit(n int) -> {\n            .expr = .expr + n.to_string()\n            .display = .expr\n            .error = \"\"\n        }\n        .Operator(op str) -> {\n            .expr = .expr + op\n            .display = .expr\n            .error = \"\"\n        }\n        .Paren(p str) -> {\n            .expr = .expr + p\n            .display = .expr\n            .error = \"\"\n        }\n        .SciFn(name str) -> {\n            if name == \"pi\" {\n                .expr = .expr + \"3.14159265358979\"\n            } else {\n                .expr = .expr + name + \"(\"\n            }\n            .display = .expr\n            .error = \"\"\n        }\n        .Equals -> {\n            if .mode == \"programmer\" {\n                // PLAN-615 T-08: \"=\" 键盘绑定在 programmer 域路由到 int 求值\n                if .pop != \"\" {\n                    if .pop == \"/\" {\n                        if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                            .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if .pop == \"MOD\" {\n                        if .pnum_hi == 0 && .pnum_lo == 0 {\n                            .perr = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if .perr == \"\" {\n                        var nl int = pop_lo(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                        var nh int = pop_hi(.pop, .pacc_hi, .pacc_lo, .pnum_hi, .pnum_lo)\n                        .pacc_lo = nl\n                        .pacc_hi = nh\n                        .pnum_lo = nl\n                        .pnum_hi = nh\n                    }\n                    .pop = \"\"\n                    .pentering = false\n                }\n            } else {\n                .expr_line = .expr + \" =\"\n                let result str = eval_expr(.expr)\n                // PLAN-615 T-08: 错误文案细化（除零 vs 语法错误）\n                if result == \"DIV0\" {\n                    .error = \"Cannot divide by zero\"\n                } else {\n                    if result == \"ERROR\" {\n                        .error = \"Invalid expression\"\n                    } else {\n                        .display = result\n                        .expr = result\n                        .error = \"\"\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// Expression Evaluator (需求 1c: shunting-yard + decimal + parens + precedence)\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n/// Evaluate an arithmetic expression string. Supports + - * / ^ %, parentheses,\n/// decimals, and unary minus. Returns \"ERROR\" on failure (parse error, div by zero).\n/// Uses a two-stack shunting-yard: operators go to one stack, values to another,\n/// respecting precedence and parentheses.\nfn eval_expr(input str) str {\n    // Plan 403: shunting-yard expression evaluator.\n    // Supports + - * / ^ %, parentheses, decimals, unary minus, precedence.\n    //\n    // Note: numbers are kept on a List<str> (not List<float>) and parsed to\n    // float only at the point of arithmetic. This dodges a VM limitation where\n    // an empty List<float> is instantiated as ListData<i32>, which corrupts\n    // pushed floats. String elements round-trip correctly via ListData<String>\n    // (with Plan 403 fixes to shim_list_push/get/pop/len for ListData<String>).\n    var nums List<str> = []\n    var ops List<str> = []\n    var i int = 0\n    var n int = input.len()\n    var ok str = \"OK\"\n\n    while i < n {\n        var ch str = input.slice(i, i + 1)\n        // Skip whitespace.\n        if ch == \" \" {\n            i = i + 1\n        }\n        // Number (digit or decimal point).\n        if ch.is_digit() || ch == \".\" {\n            var j int = i\n            var num_str str = \"\"\n            while j < n {\n                var c str = input.slice(j, j + 1)\n                if c.is_digit() || c == \".\" {\n                    num_str = num_str + c\n                    j = j + 1\n                } else {\n                    break\n                }\n            }\n            i = j\n            nums.push(num_str)\n        }\n        // Opening paren.\n        else if ch == \"(\" {\n            ops.push(\"(\")\n            i = i + 1\n        }\n        // Closing paren: pop until \"(\".\n        else if ch == \")\" {\n            while ops.len() > 0 && ops[ops.len() - 1] != \"(\" {\n                ok = apply_top(nums, ops)\n                if ok != \"OK\" {\n                    return ok\n                }\n            }\n            if ops.len() > 0 {\n                ops.pop()\n            }\n            i = i + 1\n        }\n        // Operator: + - * / ^ %\n        else if is_op(ch) {\n            // Handle unary minus: a minus at start or right after ( or another op.\n            if ch == \"-\" {\n                var at_start bool = i == 0\n                var prev str = \"\"\n                if i > 0 {\n                    prev = input.slice(i - 1, i)\n                }\n                if at_start || prev == \"(\" || is_op(prev) {\n                    // It's unary minus — absorb the number as negative.\n                    var j int = i + 1\n                    var num_str str = \"-\"\n                    while j < n {\n                        var c str = input.slice(j, j + 1)\n                        if c.is_digit() || c == \".\" {\n                            num_str = num_str + c\n                            j = j + 1\n                        } else {\n                            break\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if j > i + 1 {\n                        i = j\n                        nums.push(num_str)\n                    } else {\n                        i = i + 1\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    while ops.len() > 0 && ops[ops.len() - 1] != \"(\" && prec(ops[ops.len() - 1]) >= prec(ch) {\n                        ok = apply_top(nums, ops)\n                        if ok != \"OK\" {\n                            return ok\n                        }\n                    }\n                    ops.push(ch)\n                    i = i + 1\n                }\n            } else {\n                while ops.len() > 0 && ops[ops.len() - 1] != \"(\" && prec(ops[ops.len() - 1]) >= prec(ch) {\n                    ok = apply_top(nums, ops)\n                    if ok != \"OK\" {\n                        return ok\n                    }\n                }\n                ops.push(ch)\n                i = i + 1\n            }\n        }\n        else {\n            // Unknown char.\n            i = i + 1\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Pop remaining operators.\n    while ops.len() > 0 {\n        if ops[ops.len() - 1] == \"(\" {\n            ops.pop()\n        } else {\n            ok = apply_top(nums, ops)\n            if ok != \"OK\" {\n                return ok\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    if nums.len() == 1 {\n        return fmt_num(nums[0].to_float())\n    }\n    return \"ERROR\"\n}\n\n/// PLAN-615 T-08: Pop the top operator and apply it to the top two values.\n/// Returns \"OK\" / \"DIV0\" (除零，Equals 显具体文案) / \"ERROR\"（栈不足）。\nfn apply_top(nums List<str>, ops List<str>) str {\n    if ops.len() == 0 || nums.len() < 2 {\n        return \"ERROR\"\n    }\n    var op str = ops[ops.len() - 1]\n    ops.pop()\n    var b float = nums[nums.len() - 1].to_float()\n    nums.pop()\n    var a float = nums[nums.len() - 1].to_float()\n    nums.pop()\n    var result float = 0.0\n    if op == \"+\" {\n        result = a + b\n    }\n    if op == \"-\" {\n        result = a - b\n    }\n    if op == \"*\" {\n        result = a * b\n    }\n    if op == \"/\" {\n        if b == 0.0 {\n            return \"DIV0\"\n        }\n        result = a / b\n    }\n    if op == \"^\" {\n        result = math.pow(a, b)\n    }\n    if op == \"%\" {\n        result = a - b * (a / b)\n    }\n    nums.push(result.to_string())\n    return \"OK\"\n}\n\n/// Operator precedence: ^ > * / % > + -.\nfn prec(op str) int {\n    if op == \"+\" {\n        return 1\n    }\n    if op == \"-\" {\n        return 1\n    }\n    if op == \"*\" {\n        return 2\n    }\n    if op == \"/\" {\n        return 2\n    }\n    if op == \"%\" {\n        return 2\n    }\n    if op == \"^\" {\n        return 3\n    }\n    return 0\n}\n\n/// Format a float for display: show integers without decimals, trim trailing zeros.\nfn fmt_num(v float) str {\n    // PLAN-615 T-08: 浮点显示去噪——10 位小数 ε 舍入（0.1+0.2 → 0.3、\n    // 3.0000000000000004 → 3），|v| ≥ 1e6 原样 to_string。math.floor 双端\n    // 有映射（VM native 1710 / TS Math.floor）。\n    var a float = v\n    if a < 0.0 {\n        a = 0.0 - a\n    }\n    if a < 1000000.0 {\n        var scaled float = v * 10000000000.0\n        var r float = math.floor(scaled + 0.5)\n        return (r / 10000000000.0).to_string()\n    }\n    return v.to_string()\n}\n\nfn is_op(ch str) bool {\n    if ch == \"+\" {\n        return true\n    }\n    if ch == \"-\" {\n        return true\n    }\n    if ch == \"*\" {\n        return true\n    }\n    if ch == \"/\" {\n        return true\n    }\n    if ch == \"^\" {\n        return true\n    }\n    if ch == \"%\" {\n        return true\n    }\n    return false\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"calculator\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\nicon: \"calculator\"\ntitle: \"Calculator\"\ntitle_zh: \"计算器\"\n# PLAN-615 T-04：theme 显式键移除——跟随主题链（CLI > os-config > OS 系统\n# 主题；桌面轨经 config.dark_theme 派生）。显式值会以 pac.at 优先级压过\n# OS 跟随，深浅双主题需求下不声明。\naccent: \"indigo\"\n# Plan 504: 窗口随内容自然尺寸收缩（独立 VM 窗 / 虚拟桌面窗双路径）。\nwindow: \"fit\"\ndesktop: \"true\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "计算器 011-calculator grid math" },
        { id: "012-clock", title: "时钟", category: "02-components", icon: "clock", description: "时钟", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 012-clock — 现代全功能时钟应用\n\n集传统手表 ⌚ SVG 表盘、数字时钟、世界时钟、闹钟、秒表、倒计时五大功能于一体的现代时钟应用。完美适配系统深浅色主题与 AutoUI Design Tokens。\n\n## 功能特性\n\n1. **时钟（Clock）**\n   - 传统手表 ⌚ SVG 矢量指针表盘（外圈、12 小时刻度与 60 分钟细刻度，时/分/秒三针联动）。\n   - 秒针配有运动红色/橙色点缀与延伸平衡配重。\n   - 大号数字时钟（`HH:MM:SS`）与本地日期、星期显示。\n   - 指针/数字双模展示。\n\n2. **世界时钟（World Clock）**\n   - 全球 8 大主要城市时间（北京、东京、悉尼、伦敦、巴黎、莫斯科、纽约、洛杉矶）。\n   - 智能计算与本地时差（如 \"+0小时\"、\"-8小时\"、\"昨天/今天/明天\"）。\n   - 昼夜状态图标指示（☀️ 白天 / 🌙 夜间）。\n\n3. **闹钟（Alarm）**\n   - 卡片式闹钟列表，支持快捷开关切换。\n   - 快速时间步进器增添新闹钟。\n   - 本地持久化存储（`storage`，支持多槽位与重启恢复）。\n\n4. **秒表（Stopwatch）**\n   - 大字号码表展示与毫秒分段。\n   - 经典双按钮控制流（开始/停止/计圈/复位）。\n   - 计圈列表，标识圈速分段与累计时间。\n\n5. **倒计时（Timer）**\n   - 常用快捷时间胶囊预设（1m/5m/10m/15m/25m/30m）。\n   - 精细时/分/秒调节步进器。\n   - 倒计时到期横幅通知与友好清除。\n\n6. **桌面小组件（Desktop Widget `view mini`）**\n   - 面向桌面 Dashboard 小组件面板的紧凑命名视图。\n   - 精致的传统手表迷你表盘 + 数字时钟与本地日期。\n\n## 运行与验证\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/012-clock\n\n# Vue 模式\nauto run\n\n# VM 模式\nauto run -r vm\n\n# MCP 自动化测试\npython tests/desktop_mcp.py\n```\n", source: "// 012-clock — 现代全功能时钟应用（Plan 644 重塑）\n// 包含：时钟（传统手表 ⌚ SVG 表盘与数显）/ 世界时钟 / 闹钟 / 秒表 / 倒计时\n// 适配系统深浅主题与 AutoUI Design Tokens；桌面小组件 view mini 传统手表表盘支持。\n\nstyle tab_active = \"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-sm font-semibold shadow-sm\"\nstyle tab_idle = \"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-muted-foreground text-sm hover:bg-accent font-medium\"\nstyle card_panel = \"bg-card text-card-foreground border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm w-full max-w-xl items-center gap-4\"\nstyle dial_btn_active = \"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-xs font-semibold shadow-sm\"\nstyle dial_btn_idle = \"px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-muted-foreground text-xs hover:bg-accent font-medium\"\nstyle preset_btn = \"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground text-xs font-medium hover:bg-secondary/80\"\nstyle stepper_btn = \"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80 rounded font-bold text-sm\"\nstyle stepper_val = \"text-2xl font-mono w-10 text-center text-foreground font-semibold\"\nstyle unit_label = \"text-muted-foreground self-center text-sm\"\nstyle step_col = \"items-center gap-1\"\nstyle list_col = \"gap-2 items-center w-full\"\nstyle disp_hint = \"text-muted-foreground font-mono text-sm\"\nstyle del_btn = \"text-muted-foreground hover:text-destructive px-2 text-base font-bold\"\nstyle city_row = \"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 w-full justify-between items-center hover:bg-accent/30\"\nstyle alarm_row = \"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 w-full justify-between items-center hover:bg-accent/30\"\nstyle mono_row = \"text-foreground font-mono text-base font-semibold\"\nstyle action_primary = \"px-8 py-3 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-full text-base font-semibold shadow hover:opacity-90\"\nstyle action_secondary = \"px-8 py-3 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground rounded-full text-base font-semibold hover:bg-secondary/80\"\nstyle action_destructive = \"px-8 py-3 bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground rounded-full text-base font-semibold shadow hover:opacity-90\"\nstyle sw_secondary_btn = \"px-10 py-3.5 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground rounded-full text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-secondary/80\"\n\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        Init, SelectTab(str), Tick, SetDialMode(str), DismissBanner,\n        Start, Stop, Reset, DoLap,\n        SetTH(str), SetTM(str), SetTS(str), TStart, TPause, TCancel,\n        TUpH, TDnH, TUpM, TDnM, TUpS, TDnS, TQuick(int),\n        SetLocal(int),\n        AAdd, ADel(int), AUpH, ADnH, AUpM, ADnM, AQuick(int, int)\n    }\n\n    model {\n        var tab str = \"clock\"\n        var dial_mode str = \"both\"\n\n        // 表盘动态旋转与时间\n        var h_rot str = \"rotate(0 120 120)\"\n        var m_rot str = \"rotate(0 120 120)\"\n        var s_rot str = \"rotate(0 120 120)\"\n        var mini_h_rot str = \"rotate(0 50 50)\"\n        var mini_m_rot str = \"rotate(0 50 50)\"\n        var mini_s_rot str = \"rotate(0 50 50)\"\n        var w_local str = \"--:--:--\"\n        var local_city int = 0\n        var local_date_str str = \"2026年9月18日\"\n        var w_tick int = 0\n\n        // 秒表（T1：sw_on 替代 running；差值法锚点 T3 接 Tick）\n        var sw_on str = \"false\"\n        var elapsed int = 0\n        var time_display str = \"00:00\"\n        var ms_display str = \".00\"\n        var lap1 str = \"\"\n        var lap2 str = \"\"\n        var lap3 str = \"\"\n        var lap4 str = \"\"\n        var lap5 str = \"\"\n\n        // 计时器（T4；步进器 int 形态）\n        var t_set_h int = 0\n        var t_set_m int = 0\n        var t_set_s int = 1\n        var t_set_disp str = \"00:00:01\"\n        var t_h_str str = \"00\"\n        var t_m_str str = \"00\"\n        var t_s_str str = \"01\"\n        var t_left int = 0            // 剩余 ms\n        var t_on str = \"false\"\n        var t_disp str = \"00:00:01\"\n\n        // 世界时钟（T5；固定偏移表 v1）\n        var cities []str = [\"Beijing\", \"London\", \"New York\", \"Tokyo\", \"Sydney\", \"Paris\", \"Moscow\", \"Los Angeles\"]\n        var offsets []int = [8, 0, -5, 9, 11, 1, 3, -8]\n        var w_rows []str = []\n\n        // 闹钟（T6；storage 定长 5 槽持久化）\n        var a_h int = 7\n        var a_m int = 30\n        var a_set_disp str = \"07:30\"\n        var a_h_str str = \"07\"\n        var a_m_str str = \"30\"\n        var alarm1 str = \"\"\n        var alarm2 str = \"\"\n        var alarm3 str = \"\"\n        var alarm4 str = \"\"\n        var alarm5 str = \"\"\n        var fired str = \"\"            // 当日已触发 \"HH:MM,\" 累记\n        var last_day int = 0\n\n        // 通用覆盖横幅（空=隐藏；timer 到零/闹钟到点共用）\n        var banner str = \"\"\n        // Tick 周期（250ms）\n        var interval int = 250\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            // 顶栏：标题 + 时钟胶囊导航\n            row {\n                row {\n                    text \"时钟 Clock\" {\n                        style: \"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight\"\n                    }\n                    text \"Pro\" {\n                        style: \"text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary/15 text-primary font-semibold\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"items-center gap-2\"\n                }\n                row {\n                    text .w_local {\n                        style: \"text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground font-medium\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"items-center\"\n                }\n                style: \"items-center justify-between w-full pb-2 border-b border-border/40\"\n            }\n\n            // 导航胶囊条（5 个 Tab）\n            row {\n                button \"时钟\" {\n                    onclick: .SelectTab(\"clock\"),\n                    style: if .tab == \"clock\" { tab_active } else { tab_idle }\n                }\n                button \"世界时钟\" {\n                    onclick: .SelectTab(\"world\"),\n                    style: if .tab == \"world\" { tab_active } else { tab_idle }\n                }\n                button \"闹钟\" {\n                    onclick: .SelectTab(\"alarm\"),\n                    style: if .tab == \"alarm\" { tab_active } else { tab_idle }\n                }\n                button \"秒表\" {\n                    onclick: .SelectTab(\"stopwatch\"),\n                    style: if .tab == \"stopwatch\" { tab_active } else { tab_idle }\n                }\n                button \"计时器\" {\n                    onclick: .SelectTab(\"timer\"),\n                    style: if .tab == \"timer\" { tab_active } else { tab_idle }\n                }\n                style: \"gap-1 p-1 bg-muted/40 rounded-full border border-border/40 w-fit self-center\"\n            }\n\n            // 通用横幅顶栏（timer 到零/闹钟到点）\n            if .banner != \"\" {\n                row {\n                    text .banner { style: \"text-lg font-bold text-primary\" }\n                    button \"知道了\" {\n                        onclick: .DismissBanner,\n                        style: \"px-4 py-1 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"items-center justify-center gap-3 min-h-9\"\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ==================== Tab 1: 时钟 (Clock 首屏) ====================\n            if .tab == \"clock\" {\n                col {\n                    // 传统机械手表 ⌚ SVG 表盘\n                    if .dial_mode != \"digital\" {\n                        svg (viewBox: \"0 0 240 240\", style: \"w-56 h-56 mx-auto my-2 drop-shadow-md\") {\n                            // 表壳外圈与内表圈\n                            circle (cx: \"120\", cy: \"120\", r: \"114\", fill: \"#111827\", stroke: \"#374151\", stroke-width: \"5\") {}\n                            circle (cx: \"120\", cy: \"120\", r: \"106\", fill: \"none\", stroke: \"#1f2937\", stroke-width: \"1.5\") {}\n                            // 12 个小时刻度\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"3.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(30 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(60 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(90 120 120)\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"3.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(120 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(150 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(180 120 120)\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"3.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(210 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(240 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(270 120 120)\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"3.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(300 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"16\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"28\", transform: \"rotate(330 120 120)\", stroke: \"#9ca3af\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            // 时针\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"120\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"66\", transform: .h_rot, stroke: \"#f9fafb\", stroke-width: \"4.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            // 分针\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"120\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"40\", transform: .m_rot, stroke: \"#e5e7eb\", stroke-width: \"3\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            // 秒针（橙红色，带延长尾）\n                            line (x1: \"120\", y1: \"142\", x2: \"120\", y2: \"24\", transform: .s_rot, stroke: \"#f97316\", stroke-width: \"1.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                            // 中心轴帽\n                            circle (cx: \"120\", cy: \"120\", r: \"4.5\", fill: \"#f97316\") {}\n                            circle (cx: \"120\", cy: \"120\", r: \"2\", fill: \"#ffffff\") {}\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // 数字时钟展示\n                    if .dial_mode != \"analog\" {\n                        col {\n                            text .w_local {\n                                style: \"text-6xl font-mono font-bold text-foreground tracking-widest text-center\"\n                            }\n                            text .local_date_str {\n                                style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground font-medium text-center\"\n                            }\n                            style: \"items-center gap-1 py-3\"\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // 表盘模式切换切换器\n                    row {\n                        button \"传统表盘\" {\n                            onclick: .SetDialMode(\"analog\"),\n                            style: if .dial_mode == \"analog\" { dial_btn_active } else { dial_btn_idle }\n                        }\n                        button \"数字时钟\" {\n                            onclick: .SetDialMode(\"digital\"),\n                            style: if .dial_mode == \"digital\" { dial_btn_active } else { dial_btn_idle }\n                        }\n                        button \"双显\" {\n                            onclick: .SetDialMode(\"both\"),\n                            style: if .dial_mode == \"both\" { dial_btn_active } else { dial_btn_idle }\n                        }\n                        style: \"gap-2 items-center justify-center pt-2\"\n                    }\n\n                    style: \"items-center py-4 gap-2 w-full\"\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ==================== Tab 2: 世界时钟 ====================\n            if .tab == \"world\" {\n                col {\n                    text .w_local { style: \"text-5xl font-mono font-bold text-foreground py-4 text-center\" }\n                    col {\n                        for r in .w_rows {\n                            row {\n                                text r { style: mono_row }\n                                style: city_row\n                            }\n                        }\n                        style: list_col\n                    }\n                    text \"点击城市设为本地（v1 固定偏移，不含夏令时）\" { style: \"text-muted-foreground text-xs pt-2\" }\n                    style: \"items-center py-4 gap-2 w-full\"\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ==================== Tab 3: 闹钟 ====================\n            if .tab == \"alarm\" {\n                col {\n                    // 新增闹钟卡片\n                    col {\n                        row {\n                            col {\n                                button \"时−\" { onclick: .ADnH, style: stepper_btn }\n                                text .a_h_str { style: stepper_val }\n                                button \"时+\" { onclick: .AUpH, style: stepper_btn }\n                                style: step_col\n                            }\n                            text \":\" { style: \"text-2xl font-mono self-center text-foreground font-bold\" }\n                            col {\n                                button \"分−\" { onclick: .ADnM, style: stepper_btn }\n                                text .a_m_str { style: stepper_val }\n                                button \"分+\" { onclick: .AUpM, style: stepper_btn }\n                                style: step_col\n                            }\n                            button \"添加\" { onclick: .AAdd, style: \"ml-2 px-6 py-2 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-full font-semibold shadow hover:opacity-90\" }\n                            style: \"gap-3 items-center\"\n                        }\n                        row {\n                            button \"07:00\" { onclick: .AQuick(7, 0), style: preset_btn }\n                            button \"07:30\" { onclick: .AQuick(7, 30), style: preset_btn }\n                            button \"08:00\" { onclick: .AQuick(8, 0), style: preset_btn }\n                            button \"08:30\" { onclick: .AQuick(8, 30), style: preset_btn }\n                            style: \"gap-2 pt-2 items-center justify-center\"\n                        }\n                        text .a_set_disp { style: disp_hint }\n                        style: \"bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-2xl p-5 items-center gap-3 w-full\"\n                    }\n\n                    // 闹钟列表\n                    col {\n                        if .alarm1 != \"\" { row { text .alarm1 { style: mono_row }\n                            button \"×\" { onclick: .ADel(1), style: del_btn }\n                            style: alarm_row } }\n                        if .alarm2 != \"\" { row { text .alarm2 { style: mono_row }\n                            button \"×\" { onclick: .ADel(2), style: del_btn }\n                            style: alarm_row } }\n                        if .alarm3 != \"\" { row { text .alarm3 { style: mono_row }\n                            button \"×\" { onclick: .ADel(3), style: del_btn }\n                            style: alarm_row } }\n                        if .alarm4 != \"\" { row { text .alarm4 { style: mono_row }\n                            button \"×\" { onclick: .ADel(4), style: del_btn }\n                            style: alarm_row } }\n                        if .alarm5 != \"\" { row { text .alarm5 { style: mono_row }\n                            button \"×\" { onclick: .ADel(5), style: del_btn }\n                            style: alarm_row } }\n                        style: list_col\n                    }\n                    style: \"items-center py-4 gap-4 w-full\"\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ==================== Tab 4: 秒表 ====================\n            if .tab == \"stopwatch\" {\n                col {\n                    col {\n                        text .time_display {\n                            style: \"text-7xl font-mono font-extrabold text-foreground tracking-wider\"\n                        }\n                        text .ms_display {\n                            style: \"text-3xl font-mono text-muted-foreground font-semibold\"\n                        }\n                        style: \"items-center gap-1 py-8\"\n                    }\n                    row {\n                        if .sw_on == \"true\" {\n                            button \"停止\" { onclick: .Stop, style: \"px-10 py-3.5 bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground rounded-full text-lg font-semibold shadow hover:opacity-90\" }\n                            button \"计圈\" { onclick: .DoLap, style: sw_secondary_btn }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"开始\" { onclick: .Start, style: \"px-10 py-3.5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-full text-lg font-semibold shadow hover:opacity-90\" }\n                            button \"复位\" { onclick: .Reset, style: sw_secondary_btn }\n                        }\n                        style: \"gap-4 items-center\"\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        text \"Laps 计圈记录\" { style: \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest pb-1\" }\n                        text .lap1 { style: \"text-foreground font-mono py-1.5\" }\n                        text .lap2 { style: \"text-foreground font-mono py-1.5\" }\n                        text .lap3 { style: \"text-foreground font-mono py-1.5\" }\n                        text .lap4 { style: \"text-foreground font-mono py-1.5\" }\n                        text .lap5 { style: \"text-foreground font-mono py-1.5\" }\n                        style: \"w-full max-w-sm mt-4 gap-1 items-center bg-card border border-border/50 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"items-center py-4 w-full\"\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ==================== Tab 5: 倒计时 (计时器) ====================\n            if .tab == \"timer\" {\n                col {\n                    text .t_disp { style: \"text-6xl font-mono font-extrabold text-foreground py-6 text-center\" }\n                    // 步进调节\n                    row {\n                        col {\n                            button \"时−\" { onclick: .TDnH, style: stepper_btn }\n                            text .t_h_str { style: stepper_val }\n                            button \"时+\" { onclick: .TUpH, style: stepper_btn }\n                            style: step_col\n                        }\n                        text \"时\" { style: unit_label }\n                        col {\n                            button \"分−\" { onclick: .TDnM, style: stepper_btn }\n                            text .t_m_str { style: stepper_val }\n                            button \"分+\" { onclick: .TUpM, style: stepper_btn }\n                            style: step_col\n                        }\n                        text \"分\" { style: unit_label }\n                        col {\n                            button \"秒−\" { onclick: .TDnS, style: stepper_btn }\n                            text .t_s_str { style: stepper_val }\n                            button \"秒+\" { onclick: .TUpS, style: stepper_btn }\n                            style: step_col\n                        }\n                        text \"秒\" { style: unit_label }\n                        style: \"gap-3 items-center\"\n                    }\n                    // 快捷时间预设\n                    row {\n                        button \"1分钟\" { onclick: .TQuick(60), style: preset_btn }\n                        button \"5分钟\" { onclick: .TQuick(300), style: preset_btn }\n                        button \"10分钟\" { onclick: .TQuick(600), style: preset_btn }\n                        button \"25分钟\" { onclick: .TQuick(1500), style: preset_btn }\n                        button \"30分钟\" { onclick: .TQuick(1800), style: preset_btn }\n                        style: \"gap-2 items-center justify-center pt-2\"\n                    }\n                    text .t_set_disp { style: disp_hint }\n                    row {\n                        if .t_on == \"false\" {\n                            button \"开始\" { onclick: .TStart, style: action_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"暂停\" { onclick: .TPause, style: action_secondary }\n                        }\n                        button \"取消\" { onclick: .TCancel, style: action_secondary }\n                        style: \"gap-4 pt-2 items-center\"\n                    }\n                    style: \"items-center py-4 gap-3 w-full\"\n                }\n            }\n\n            style: \"relative w-[480px] p-6 gap-4 bg-card text-foreground items-stretch rounded-3xl border border-border shadow-lg\"\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            .alarm1 = storage.get(\"clock.alarms.0\")\n            .alarm2 = storage.get(\"clock.alarms.1\")\n            .alarm3 = storage.get(\"clock.alarms.2\")\n            .alarm4 = storage.get(\"clock.alarms.3\")\n            .alarm5 = storage.get(\"clock.alarms.4\")\n        }\n        .SelectTab(t) -> { .tab = t }\n        .SetDialMode(m) -> { .dial_mode = m }\n        .Start -> { .sw_on = \"true\" }\n        .Stop -> { .sw_on = \"false\" }\n        .Reset -> {\n            .sw_on = \"false\"\n            .lap1 = \"\"\n            .lap2 = \"\"\n            .lap3 = \"\"\n            .lap4 = \"\"\n            .lap5 = \"\"\n            .time_display = \"00:00\"\n            .ms_display = \".00\"\n            .elapsed = 0\n        }\n        .DoLap -> {\n            .lap5 = .lap4\n            .lap4 = .lap3\n            .lap3 = .lap2\n            .lap2 = .lap1\n            .lap1 = .time_display + .ms_display\n        }\n        .Tick -> {\n            // ---- 秒表走表 ----\n            if .sw_on == \"true\" {\n                .elapsed += 250\n                var total_cs = .elapsed / 10\n                var cc = total_cs % 100\n                var total_s = total_cs / 100\n                var ss = total_s % 60\n                var mm = total_s / 60\n                var cc_str = f\"${cc}\"\n                if cc < 10 { cc_str = \"0\" + cc_str }\n                var ss_str = f\"${ss}\"\n                if ss < 10 { ss_str = \"0\" + ss_str }\n                var mm_str = f\"${mm}\"\n                if mm < 10 { mm_str = \"0\" + mm_str }\n                .ms_display = \".\" + cc_str\n                .time_display = mm_str + \":\" + ss_str\n            }\n\n            // ---- 倒计时走字 ----\n            if .t_on == \"true\" {\n                if .t_left > 250 {\n                    .t_left -= 250\n                } else {\n                    .t_left = 0\n                    .t_on = \"false\"\n                    .banner = \"⏰ 时间到！\"\n                }\n                var th = .t_left / 3600000\n                var tm = (.t_left % 3600000) / 60000\n                var ts = (.t_left % 60000) / 1000\n                var th_str = f\"${th}\"\n                if th < 10 { th_str = \"0\" + th_str }\n                var tm_str = f\"${tm}\"\n                if tm < 10 { tm_str = \"0\" + tm_str }\n                var ts_str = f\"${ts}\"\n                if ts < 10 { ts_str = \"0\" + ts_str }\n                .t_disp = th_str + \":\" + tm_str + \":\" + ts_str\n            }\n\n            // 设定汇总行\n            var shh = f\"${.t_set_h}\"\n            if .t_set_h < 10 { shh = \"0\" + shh }\n            var smm = f\"${.t_set_m}\"\n            if .t_set_m < 10 { smm = \"0\" + smm }\n            var sss = f\"${.t_set_s}\"\n            if .t_set_s < 10 { sss = \"0\" + sss }\n            .t_h_str = shh\n            .t_m_str = smm\n            .t_s_str = sss\n            .t_set_disp = shh + \":\" + smm + \":\" + sss\n            var ahh = f\"${.a_h}\"\n            if .a_h < 10 { ahh = \"0\" + ahh }\n            var amm = f\"${.a_m}\"\n            if .a_m < 10 { amm = \"0\" + amm }\n            .a_h_str = ahh\n            .a_m_str = amm\n            .a_set_disp = ahh + \":\" + amm\n\n            // ---- 世界时钟 + 表盘角度更新（每 tick 刷新）----\n            .w_tick += 1\n            if .w_tick >= 1 {\n                var secs = Time.now_sec()\n                // 本地城市时间与指针角度\n                var ls = secs + .offsets[.local_city] * 3600\n                var lh = (ls / 3600) % 24\n                var lm = (ls / 60) % 60\n                var lsec = ls % 60\n                var lh_str = f\"${lh}\"\n                if lh < 10 { lh_str = \"0\" + lh_str }\n                var lm_str = f\"${lm}\"\n                if lm < 10 { lm_str = \"0\" + lm_str }\n                var lsec_str = f\"${lsec}\"\n                if lsec < 10 { lsec_str = \"0\" + lsec_str }\n                .w_local = lh_str + \":\" + lm_str + \":\" + lsec_str\n\n                var s_deg = (lsec * 6) % 360\n                var m_deg = (lm * 6 + lsec / 10) % 360\n                var h_deg = ((lh % 12) * 30 + lm / 2) % 360\n                .s_rot = f\"rotate(${s_deg} 120 120)\"\n                .m_rot = f\"rotate(${m_deg} 120 120)\"\n                .h_rot = f\"rotate(${h_deg} 120 120)\"\n                .mini_s_rot = f\"rotate(${s_deg} 50 50)\"\n                .mini_m_rot = f\"rotate(${m_deg} 50 50)\"\n                .mini_h_rot = f\"rotate(${h_deg} 50 50)\"\n\n                // 每 4 tick (1s) 刷新世界城市列表与闹钟比对\n                if .w_tick >= 4 {\n                    .w_tick = 0\n                    var rows []str = []\n                    var idx int = 0\n                    for c in .cities {\n                        var cs = secs + .offsets[idx] * 3600\n                        var ch = (cs / 3600) % 24\n                        var cm = (cs / 60) % 60\n                        var csec = cs % 60\n                        var ch_str = f\"${ch}\"\n                        if ch < 10 { ch_str = \"0\" + ch_str }\n                        var cm_str = f\"${cm}\"\n                        if cm < 10 { cm_str = \"0\" + cm_str }\n                        var csec_str = f\"${csec}\"\n                        if csec < 10 { csec_str = \"0\" + csec_str }\n                        var mark = \"\"\n                        if idx == .local_city { mark = \" ●\" }\n                        rows.push(c + \"  \" + ch_str + \":\" + cm_str + \":\" + csec_str + mark)\n                        idx += 1\n                    }\n                    .w_rows = rows\n\n                    // 闹钟分钟比对\n                    var day = ls / 86400\n                    if day != .last_day {\n                        .last_day = day\n                        .fired = \"\"\n                    }\n                    var cur = lh_str + \":\" + lm_str\n                    if .alarm1 == cur && .fired.contains(cur) == false && .alarm1 != \"\" {\n                        .banner = \"⏰ 闹钟 \" + cur\n                        .fired = .fired + cur + \",\"\n                    }\n                    if .alarm2 == cur && .fired.contains(cur) == false && .alarm2 != \"\" {\n                        .banner = \"⏰ 闹钟 \" + cur\n                        .fired = .fired + cur + \",\"\n                    }\n                    if .alarm3 == cur && .fired.contains(cur) == false && .alarm3 != \"\" {\n                        .banner = \"⏰ 闹钟 \" + cur\n                        .fired = .fired + cur + \",\"\n                    }\n                    if .alarm4 == cur && .fired.contains(cur) == false && .alarm4 != \"\" {\n                        .banner = \"⏰ 闹钟 \" + cur\n                        .fired = .fired + cur + \",\"\n                    }\n                    if .alarm5 == cur && .fired.contains(cur) == false && .alarm5 != \"\" {\n                        .banner = \"⏰ 闹钟 \" + cur\n                        .fired = .fired + cur + \",\"\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // ---- 倒计时 handlers ----\n        .TUpH -> { .t_set_h = (.t_set_h + 1) % 24 }\n        .TDnH -> { .t_set_h = (.t_set_h + 23) % 24 }\n        .TUpM -> { .t_set_m = (.t_set_m + 1) % 60 }\n        .TDnM -> { .t_set_m = (.t_set_m + 59) % 60 }\n        .TUpS -> { .t_set_s = (.t_set_s + 1) % 60 }\n        .TDnS -> { .t_set_s = (.t_set_s + 59) % 60 }\n        .TQuick(secs) -> {\n            .t_set_h = secs / 3600\n            .t_set_m = (secs % 3600) / 60\n            .t_set_s = secs % 60\n        }\n        .TStart -> {\n            .t_left = (.t_set_h * 3600 + .t_set_m * 60 + .t_set_s) * 1000\n            if .t_left > 0 { .t_on = \"true\" }\n        }\n        .TPause -> { .t_on = \"false\" }\n        .TCancel -> {\n            .t_on = \"false\"\n            .t_left = 0\n            .t_disp = \"00:00:00\"\n        }\n\n        // ---- 闹钟与世界时钟 handlers ----\n        .SetLocal(i) -> { .local_city = i }\n        .AUpH -> { .a_h = (.a_h + 1) % 24 }\n        .ADnH -> { .a_h = (.a_h + 23) % 24 }\n        .AUpM -> { .a_m = (.a_m + 1) % 60 }\n        .ADnM -> { .a_m = (.a_m + 59) % 60 }\n        .AQuick(h, m) -> {\n            .a_h = h\n            .a_m = m\n        }\n        .AAdd -> {\n            var hh_str = f\"${.a_h}\"\n            if .a_h < 10 { hh_str = \"0\" + hh_str }\n            var mm_str = f\"${.a_m}\"\n            if .a_m < 10 { mm_str = \"0\" + mm_str }\n            var t = hh_str + \":\" + mm_str\n            if .alarm1 == \"\" { .alarm1 = t } else {\n                if .alarm2 == \"\" { .alarm2 = t } else {\n                    if .alarm3 == \"\" { .alarm3 = t } else {\n                        if .alarm4 == \"\" { .alarm4 = t } else {\n                            if .alarm5 == \"\" { .alarm5 = t }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.0\", .alarm1)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.1\", .alarm2)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.2\", .alarm3)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.3\", .alarm4)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.4\", .alarm5)\n        }\n        .ADel(idx) -> {\n            if idx == 1 { .alarm1 = \"\" }\n            if idx == 2 { .alarm2 = \"\" }\n            if idx == 3 { .alarm3 = \"\" }\n            if idx == 4 { .alarm4 = \"\" }\n            if idx == 5 { .alarm5 = \"\" }\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.0\", .alarm1)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.1\", .alarm2)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.2\", .alarm3)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.3\", .alarm4)\n            storage.set(\"clock.alarms.4\", .alarm5)\n        }\n        .DismissBanner -> { .banner = \"\" }\n    }\n\n    // 桌面 dashboard 小组件卡片（PLAN-024 活渲染面）：传统手表 ⌚ 迷你表盘 + 本地时钟\n    view mini {\n        col {\n            style: \"w-full h-full items-center justify-center p-3 gap-2\"\n            row {\n                style: \"items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full\"\n                svg (viewBox: \"0 0 100 100\", style: \"w-16 h-16 shrink-0\") {\n                    circle (cx: \"50\", cy: \"50\", r: \"47\", fill: \"#111827\", stroke: \"#374151\", stroke-width: \"3\") {}\n                    circle (cx: \"50\", cy: \"50\", r: \"42\", fill: \"none\", stroke: \"#1f2937\", stroke-width: \"1\") {}\n                    line (x1: \"50\", y1: \"8\", x2: \"50\", y2: \"14\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"2\") {}\n                    line (x1: \"92\", y1: \"50\", x2: \"86\", y2: \"50\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"2\") {}\n                    line (x1: \"50\", y1: \"92\", x2: \"50\", y2: \"86\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"2\") {}\n                    line (x1: \"8\", y1: \"50\", x2: \"14\", y2: \"50\", stroke: \"#f3f4f6\", stroke-width: \"2\") {}\n                    line (x1: \"50\", y1: \"50\", x2: \"50\", y2: \"26\", transform: .mini_h_rot, stroke: \"#f9fafb\", stroke-width: \"2.5\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                    line (x1: \"50\", y1: \"50\", x2: \"50\", y2: \"16\", transform: .mini_m_rot, stroke: \"#e5e7eb\", stroke-width: \"1.8\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                    line (x1: \"50\", y1: \"58\", x2: \"50\", y2: \"12\", transform: .mini_s_rot, stroke: \"#f97316\", stroke-width: \"1\", stroke-linecap: \"round\") {}\n                    circle (cx: \"50\", cy: \"50\", r: \"2.5\", fill: \"#f97316\") {}\n                }\n                col {\n                    style: \"items-start justify-center gap-0.5\"\n                    text .w_local {\n                        style: \"text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-foreground tabular-nums tracking-tight\"\n                    }\n                    text .local_date_str {\n                        style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium\"\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n", pac_text: "name: \"clock\"\nversion: \"2.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\n# PLAN-644：012 原地升级并重命名为 012-clock，全功能时钟与传统手表表盘\ntitle: \"Clock\"\ntitle_zh: \"时钟\"\nicon: \"clock\"\ncategory: \"tool\"\n# Plan 506: 窗口随内容自然尺寸收缩（独立 VM 窗 / 虚拟桌面窗双路径）。\nwindow: \"fit\"\ndesktop: \"true\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "时钟 012-clock autoui" },
        { id: "013-todo", title: "待办清单", category: "03-apps", icon: "list-checks", description: "待办清单", tags: ["TodoMVC", "Filter", "CRUD"], doc: "# 013-todo — TodoMVC\n\nA complete [TodoMVC](https://todomvc.com) implementation built with Auto Language, demonstrating full-featured UI development with the AURA widget system and Vue code generation.\n\n## Features\n\nAll standard TodoMVC features are implemented:\n\n- **Add todo** — Type text and press Enter\n- **Toggle todo** — Click checkbox to mark as done/undone\n- **Toggle all** — Top checkbox toggles all todos at once\n- **Delete todo** — Hover to reveal destroy button (×)\n- **Edit todo** — Double-click todo text to enter edit mode\n- **Commit edit** — Press Enter or click outside to save\n- **Clear completed** — Remove all completed todos\n- **Filter** — All / Active / Completed filter buttons\n- **Item count** — Live count of remaining active items\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Array model** — `var todos = []` with dynamic push/splice operations\n- **Typed message variants** — `msg Msg { ToggleTodo(int), DeleteTodo(int), ... }` with parameterized events\n- **For-loop rendering** — `for todo in .todos { ... }` iterates over todo list\n- **Conditional rendering** — `if .filter == \"all\"` for filter-based visibility\n- **Event handlers** — `onclick`, `ondblclick`, `onenter`, `onblur`, `oninput`\n- **F-string interpolation** — `f\"${.active_count} items left\"` for dynamic text\n- **Computed state** — `active_count` tracked incrementally on toggle/delete\n- **CSS integration** — Inline todomvc-app-css styles for authentic TodoMVC appearance\n\n## Source\n\nSee `src/front/app.at` — the entire TodoMVC application in ~285 lines of Auto code.\n\n### Model\n\n```auto\nmodel {\n    var input str = \"\"\n    var todos = []\n    var next_id int = 1\n    var filter str = \"all\"\n    var editing_id int = -1\n    var edit_text str = \"\"\n    var active_count int = 0\n}\n```\n\n### Messages\n\n```auto\nmsg {\n    Init,\n    AddTodo,\n    ToggleTodo(int),\n    DeleteTodo(int),\n    ToggleAll,\n    EditTodo(int),\n    CommitEdit,\n    EditInputChanged,\n    FilterAll,\n    FilterActive,\n    FilterCompleted,\n    ClearCompleted\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/013-todo\nauto gen              # Generate Vue project\nauto run              # Start dev server (localhost:3001)\n```\n\nGenerated project appears in `gen/front/vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue + Vite.\n\n## Browser Verification\n\nAll TodoMVC features have been verified via automated browser testing:\n\n| Feature | Status |\n|---------|--------|\n| Add todo (Enter) | ✅ |\n| Toggle single todo | ✅ |\n| Delete todo | ✅ |\n| Toggle all | ✅ |\n| Filter: All / Active / Completed | ✅ |\n| Clear completed | ✅ |\n| Double-click to edit | ✅ |\n| Active item count | ✅ |\n\n## Known Limitations\n\n- **No Escape to cancel edit** — AURA has no `onescape` event mapping yet\n- **Edit text update** — `EditInputChanged` handler is a no-op (`input = input`); relies on Vue `v-model` for actual state sync\n- **No route-based filtering** — Uses `filter` state variable instead of Vue Router\n- **No localStorage persistence** — Data is lost on page refresh (no storage binding in AURA yet)\n\n## Inspiration\n\n[TodoMVC](https://todomvc.com) — Reference implementation based on `todomvc/examples/vue`.\n", source: "// front/app.at — TodoMVC App (multi-component + backend).\n//\n// Layout: title + input + TodoList child component.\n// App holds the store + input state; TodoList renders items + filters.\n\nuse todo_store: TodoStore\nuse todo_list: TodoList\n\n// PLAN-637 Phase B token 化映射（2026-09-17，B1）：页面底 bg-gray-100→bg-background；\n// 标题 text-red-400→text-primary（TodoMVC 传承红按设计退休，角色=品牌强调）；卡面\n// bg-white→bg-card；输入行 border-gray-200→border-border；页脚提示 text-gray-400→\n// text-muted-foreground。todo_list.at 侧映射见其文件头注。\n\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        Init, AddTodo, ToggleAll\n    }\n\n    model {\n        var input str = \"\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"flex flex-col items-center min-h-screen bg-background pt-16\"\n\n            // Title\n            h1 \"todos\" {\n                style: \"text-6xl font-thin text-center text-primary mb-4\"\n            }\n\n            // Main card\n            col {\n                style: \"bg-card w-full max-w-xl shadow-lg rounded-lg overflow-hidden\"\n\n                // Input row\n                row {\n                    style: \"flex items-center border-b border-border\"\n                    checkbox {\n                        checked: .store.active_count == 0 && .store.todos.len() > 0\n                        onclick: .ToggleAll\n                        style: \"w-10 h-12 ml-2\"\n                    }\n                    input {\n                        value: .input\n                        onenter: .AddTodo\n                        placeholder: \"What needs to be done?\"\n                        style: \"flex-1 text-xl px-2 py-3 outline-none\"\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Todo list (child component)\n                TodoList()\n            }\n\n            // Footer hint\n            text \"Double-click text to edit\" {\n                style: \"mt-8 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // PLAN-024 R18：桌面 dashboard 待办卡——active_count 大字 + 标签，\n    // 与主窗同 store（活渲染面）；纯前端无后端 → 静默孵化主 tab 场景。\n    view mini {\n        col {\n            style: \"w-full h-full items-center justify-center gap-1\"\n            text .store.active_count {\n                style: \"text-4xl font-semibold text-foreground tabular-nums text-center\"\n            }\n            text \"待办未完成\" {\n                style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            store.Init()\n        }\n\n        .AddTodo -> {\n            store.AddTodo()\n        }\n\n        .ToggleAll -> {\n            store.ToggleAll()\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"todo\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\nicon: \"list-checks\"\ntitle: \"Todo\"\ntitle_zh: \"待办清单\"\napi: \"rust\"\ndesktop: \"true\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "待办清单 013-todo todomvc filter crud" },
        { id: "014-weather", title: "天气", category: "03-apps", icon: "app-window", description: "天气", tags: ["Dashboard", "Cards"], doc: "# 014-weather — Weather Dashboard\n\nA weather dashboard showing current conditions, temperature, and a tabbed forecast view (daily vs hourly).\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Tabs** — `TabDaily` and `TabHourly` messages switch between daily and hourly forecast views\n- **Conditional rendering** — `if .tab == \"daily\"` and `if .tab == \"hourly\"` show different content\n- **Data display** — city, temperature, condition, humidity/wind info as styled text\n- **Divider widget** — `divider {}` separates forecast sections\n- **Gradient styling** — `bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 to-blue-600` for the weather card\n\n## Source\n\nSee `src/front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    msg { TabDaily, TabHourly, Refresh }\n\n    model {\n        var tab str = \"daily\"\n        var city str = \"Beijing\"\n        var temp str = \"23°\"\n        var condition str = \"Partly Cloudy\"\n        var info str = \"Humidity: 65% | Wind: 12 km/h\"\n        var forecast str = \"Mon 18~25°  Tue 20~28°  Wed 16~22° ...\"\n        var hourly str = \"14:00 24°  15:00 25°  16:00 24° ...\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        center {\n            col {\n                row {\n                    text .city { class: \"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800\" }\n                    button \"Refresh\" { onclick: .Refresh }\n                }\n                col {\n                    text .condition { class: \"text-lg text-blue-100\" }\n                    text .temp { class: \"text-8xl font-thin text-white\" }\n                    text .info { class: \"text-sm text-blue-200\" }\n                    class: \"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 to-blue-600 rounded-2xl p-6\"\n                }\n                row {\n                    button \"Daily\" { onclick: .TabDaily }\n                    button \"Hourly\" { onclick: .TabHourly }\n                }\n                if .tab == \"daily\" {\n                    col { text \"5-Day Forecast\"; divider {}; text .forecast }\n                }\n                if .tab == \"hourly\" {\n                    col { text \"Today\"; divider {}; text .hourly }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .TabDaily -> { .tab = \"daily\" }\n        .TabHourly -> { .tab = \"hourly\" }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/014-weather\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `gen/vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `gen/jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `gen/ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `gen/rust/` — Rust GPUI\n", source: "// PLAN-637 B2 Phase B 映射（2026-09-17）：bg-blue-500/text-white→bg-primary/\n// text-primary-foreground；蓝卡上浅字 text-blue-100/white/blue-200→\n// text-primary-foreground（/80、/70 降档）；gray-800/700→foreground、gray-400→\n// muted-foreground；tab_idle→secondary 族；页底 bg-gray-50→bg-background。\n// 豁免：天气卡 from-blue-400/to-blue-600 渐变（装饰性，r2 口径）。\n\n// PLAN-637 B2（A+B 合并）：配方体直接落 Phase B 定案值。\nstyle tab_active = \"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium bg-primary text-primary-foreground\"   // 原 bg-blue-500/text-white\nstyle tab_idle = \"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground\"   // 原 bg-gray-200/text-gray-600\nstyle panel_title = \"text-sm font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase mt-2\"   // 原 gray-400\nstyle panel_body = \"text-foreground py-2\"   // 原 gray-700\n\nwidget App {\n    msg { TabDaily, TabHourly, Refresh }\n\n    model {\n        var tab str = \"daily\"\n        var city str = \"Beijing\"\n        var temp str = \"23°\"\n        var condition str = \"Partly Cloudy\"\n        var info str = \"Humidity: 65% | Wind: 12 km/h\"\n        var forecast str = \"Mon 18~25°  Tue 20~28°  Wed 16~22°  Thu 17~24°  Fri 19~27°\"\n        var hourly str = \"14:00 24°  15:00 25°  16:00 24°  17:00 22°  18:00 20°\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        center {\n            col {\n                row {\n                    text .city { style: \"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\" }\n                    button \"Refresh\" { onclick: .Refresh, style: \"ml-auto px-4 py-2 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-lg text-sm\" }\n                    style: \"w-full items-center\"\n                }\n                col {\n                    text .condition { style: \"text-lg text-primary-foreground/80\" }\n                    text .temp { style: \"text-8xl font-thin text-primary-foreground\" }\n                    text .info { style: \"text-sm text-primary-foreground/70\" }\n                    style: \"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 to-blue-600 rounded-2xl p-6 mt-4 items-center gap-2 py-6\"\n                }\n                row {\n                    if .tab == \"daily\" {\n                        button \"Daily\" { onclick: .TabDaily, style: tab_active }\n                    }\n                    if .tab != \"daily\" {\n                        button \"Daily\" { onclick: .TabDaily, style: tab_idle }\n                    }\n                    if .tab == \"hourly\" {\n                        button \"Hourly\" { onclick: .TabHourly, style: tab_active }\n                    }\n                    if .tab != \"hourly\" {\n                        button \"Hourly\" { onclick: .TabHourly, style: tab_idle }\n                    }\n                    style: \"gap-2 mt-6\"\n                }\n                if .tab == \"daily\" {\n                    col {\n                        text \"5-Day Forecast\" { style: panel_title }\n                        divider {}\n                        text .forecast { style: panel_body }\n                        style: \"w-full\"\n                    }\n                }\n                if .tab == \"hourly\" {\n                    col {\n                        text \"Today\" { style: panel_title }\n                        divider {}\n                        text .hourly { style: panel_body }\n                        style: \"w-full\"\n                    }\n                }\n                style: \"w-full max-w-md p-6 bg-background min-h-screen\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .TabDaily -> { .tab = \"daily\" }\n        .TabHourly -> { .tab = \"hourly\" }\n        .Refresh -> { }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"weather\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Weather\"\ntitle_zh: \"天气\"\ndesktop: \"true\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "天气 014-weather dashboard cards" },
        { id: "015-notes", title: "备忘录", category: "03-apps", icon: "notebook", description: "备忘录", tags: ["Fullstack", "Markdown", "Sidebar"], doc: "# 015-notes — 清爽笔记应用（扁平双栏 + 始终可编辑）\n\n一个「打开就能写」的笔记应用示例：左侧列表栏、右侧编辑栏，用发丝线分隔而不是\n悬浮卡片；正文没有读/写模式切换，任何时候都能直接打字。\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  ▤ Notes                                   ☀        [+ New note]     │  ← 顶栏 h-14\n├──────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  🔍 Search notes     │  Welcome                        Saved  Unpin 🗑 │\n│  All Pinned 📁work … │  🕐 Just now                                  │\n│  #intro #work …      │  (intro ×)  (+ Tag)                           │\n│  ──────────────────  │ ─────────────────────────────────────────────  │\n│  PINNED              │                                               │\n│   ▎Welcome           │  This is your notes app. Click on any note…   │\n│     Just now         │                                               │\n│  NOTES               │                                               │\n│    Quick Ideas       │                                               │\n│    10 min ago        │                                               │\n│  ──────────────────  │                                               │\n│  ⚙ Settings  ☀ Theme │                                               │  ← 侧栏页脚\n└──────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 布局与视觉\n\n- **扁平三区**：顶栏（`border-b`）+ 列表栏（`border-r`）+ 编辑栏，全域用语义 token\n  （`bg-background` / `bg-card` / `text-muted-foreground` / `primary`），暗色与 5 色主题照常生效。\n- **归一化排版**：标题 `text-2xl`、正文 `text-base leading-7`、元信息/筛选 `text-xs`；\n  正文有阅读栏宽（`max-w-2xl`）而不是铺满整屏。\n- **图标化**：全部用 lucide `icon` 元素（notebook/search/plus/check/x/trash-2/settings/\n  sun/moon/folder/clock），不再用 emoji 当图标。置顶动作在 VM 字形表里没有 pin 字形，\n  因此用文字标签 `Pin note` / `Unpin` 承载。\n\n## 交互模型\n\n| 动作 | 行为 |\n|---|---|\n| 直接编辑标题/正文 | 进入未保存态（状态文本变 `Unsaved changes`，出现 `Save`）；标题回车也可保存 |\n| 切换笔记 / 切换筛选 / 新建 | **先自动落盘**上一条草稿，再切换（编辑中被切走不丢内容） |\n| `New note` | 新建并**自动选中**空笔记（清空搜索，保证新笔记可见） |\n| `Delete` | 两步确认：先出 `Delete`/`Cancel`，确认才真删 |\n| `Pin note` / `Unpin` | 经后端 `toggle_pin` **落库**（不是只改内存） |\n| 搜索框 | **真正过滤**（标题+正文，大小写不敏感，由后端 `search_notes` 提供）；无命中显示空态 |\n| 筛选胶囊 | `All` / `Pinned` / 文件夹（📁 前缀）/ 标签（`#` 前缀）；重置选中到第一条可见笔记 |\n| `Settings` → `Dark`/`Light` + 5 色板 | 主题与主题色；顶栏太阳/月亮图标按钮是快切 |\n\n列表分两组：`Pinned`（置顶）与 `Notes`（其余）。文件夹与标签都从笔记数据派生，\n不再在视图里硬编码。\n\n## 数据与后端\n\n- 后端 API 未改动：`src/back/api.at` 的 `list_notes / create_note / update_note /\n  delete_note / toggle_pin / update_tags / search_notes`。\n- 前端唯一状态源是 `src/front/notes_store.at`：\n  - 工作集 `notes`（搜索时替换为命中集，因此列表下标是**当前工作集**的下标）\n  - 可见索引表 `visible_pinned` / `visible_notes`（元素为 `.notes` 下标）\n  - 草稿 `draft_id/title/body/time/folder/pinned/tags` + `dirty`\n  - 词表 `all_tags` / `all_folders`\n- 过滤**全部在 store 里**算成索引表，视图只做索引解引用。原因见下节。\n\n## 已知限制（有意为之）\n\n1. **筛选词表不回收已删除标签**：`all_tags` 在初始化时播种、新增时追加，但删除标签\n   后不会从词表移除（清空重建需要「空数组字面量赋值」，该写法会触发 VM codegen panic，\n   见 `tests/acceptance.atd` 的「示例侧 DSL/VM 使用约束」表）。\n2. **正文是纯文本**：用原生 `textarea`，没有 markdown 富文本编辑（`autodown_editor`\n   在 VM 端会降级为 textarea，本示例不做双端不一致的富文本）。\n3. **文件夹与标签可能同名**：种子里同时存在文件夹 `work` 与标签 `work`。UI 用\n   📁 / `#` 前缀区分，但两者过滤结果在种子数据下相同。\n4. **设置面板是示例自带的扁平面板**：不再依赖跨仓共享 `SettingsPopover`\n   （原 `deps/settings` 指向已删除的 `examples/ui/common/settings`）。主题能力仍走\n   既有 store 链路（`dark_mode` / `accent_color` + 生成器注入的 `applyAccent`）。\n\n## 源码结构\n\n```\nsrc/front/app.at          应用骨架：顶栏 + 双栏 + 消息转发（含主题镜像同步）\nsrc/front/sidebar.at      NavTree：搜索行 / 筛选胶囊 / Pinned+Notes 分组 / 外观面板 / 页脚\nsrc/front/editor.at       EditorPanel：无边框标题+正文、状态、Pin、两步删除、标签胶囊\nsrc/front/notes_store.at  唯一状态源：过滤索引表、草稿、词表、主题\nsrc/front/types.at        Note / Folder 类型\ntests/acceptance.atd      验收契约（single source of truth）\ntests/015-notes.autotest  MCP 场景（VM / Rust 可执行子集）\ntests/smoke.spec.ts       Playwright（Vue）场景\n```\n\n## 如何运行\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/015-notes\nauto gen              # 生成所有后端代码（vue / jet / ark / rust）\nauto run              # Vue 开发服务器\nauto run -r vm        # VM (iced) 后端\n```\n\n## 如何验证\n\n```bash\n# VM/Rust MCP 场景（19 条）：先起应用，再跑场景\ncd examples/ui/015-notes && AUTOUI_MCP_PORT=9247 auto run -r vm     # 终端 A\ncd examples/ui/015-notes/tests && python run_autotest.py 015-notes.autotest --mode vm   # 终端 B\n\n# Vue 端\ncd examples/ui/015-notes/tests && pnpm test\n\n# 双端截图（autoui-verifier 技能脚本）\npython ../../../.agents/skills/autoui-verifier/scripts/test_vm_mcp.py \\\n  --app-dir examples/ui/015-notes --initial-screenshot vm_initial\nnode ../../../.agents/skills/autoui-verifier/scripts/test_vue_playwright.mjs \\\n  http://localhost:3000 src/front/tests/screenshots/vue_initial.png\n```\n", source: "// app.at — 015-notes 应用骨架（PLAN-616 清爽化重做）。\n//\n// 布局：扁平双栏 + 顶栏，全部用发丝线（border-b / border-r）分隔，不再有\n// 「悬浮卡片」外壳（PLAN-360 的卡片化视觉决策被本计划取代，主题色能力沿用）。\n//\n// 主题状态说明：主权在 store（applyAccent 的重放逻辑需要 store 持有\n// dark_mode / accent_color），但 Vue 生成器把根元素的 `:class=\"{ dark: X }\"`\n// 绑到 **widget 本地** 的 dark_mode（vue.rs `dark_mode_on_widget` 分支），\n// 所以 App 保留同名镜像，并在切换 handler 里与 store 同步。\n\nuse notes_store: NotesStore\nuse sidebar: NavTree\nuse editor: EditorPanel\n\n// PLAN-607 style 配方：顶栏按钮两种形态。\n// `w-auto` 必需：VM(iced) 端无显式宽度时按钮按 Fill 参与分配，会把顶栏撑开\n// （SizeValue::Auto → IcedSize::Shrink，见 ui/style/iced_adapter.rs:1306）。\nstyle icon_btn = \"h-8 w-8 border-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-accent transition-colors\"\nstyle primary_btn = \"h-9 w-auto border-0 flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-sm font-medium shadow-sm hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors\"\n\nwidget App {\n    msg { Init, NewNote, ToggleDarkMode, SetMode(str), SetAccent(str), ToggleSettings }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = true\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"w-full h-screen flex-col bg-background text-foreground overflow-hidden\"\n\n            // ── 顶栏 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n            row {\n                style: \"h-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 border-b border-border\"\n                row {\n                    style: \"w-auto items-center gap-2\"\n                    icon (name: \"notebook\", size: 18, style: \"text-primary\")\n                    text \"Notes\" { style: \"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight\" }\n                }\n                row {\n                    style: \"w-auto items-center gap-1\"\n                    button {\n                        onclick: .ToggleDarkMode\n                        style: icon_btn\n                        if .store.dark_mode {\n                            icon (name: \"sun\", size: 16)\n                        } else {\n                            icon (name: \"moon\", size: 16)\n                        }\n                    }\n                    button {\n                        onclick: .NewNote\n                        style: primary_btn\n                        icon (name: \"plus\", size: 15)\n                        text \"New note\" { style: \"text-sm font-medium\" }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ── 主体：列表栏 + 编辑栏 ────────────────────────────────────\n            row {\n                style: \"flex-1 min-h-0\"\n                NavTree(\n                    on_toggle_dark_mode: .ToggleDarkMode,\n                    on_set_mode: .SetMode,\n                    on_set_accent: .SetAccent\n                )\n                col {\n                    style: \"flex-1 min-h-0\"\n                    if .store.notes.len() > 0 {\n                        EditorPanel()\n                    } else {\n                        // 空态：一条笔记都没有（与「筛选无命中」区分开）\n                        col {\n                            style: \"flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-3\"\n                            icon (name: \"notebook\", size: 40, style: \"text-muted-foreground/40\")\n                            text \"No notes yet\" { style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" }\n                            button {\n                                onclick: .NewNote\n                                style: primary_btn\n                                icon (name: \"plus\", size: 15)\n                                text \"Create your first note\" { style: \"text-sm font-medium\" }\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> { store.Init() }\n        .NewNote -> { store.NewNote() }\n        // 双向同步：store 是主题主权（负责 applyAccent），本地镜像驱动根元素 dark class。\n        .ToggleDarkMode -> {\n            store.ToggleDarkMode()\n            .dark_mode = .store.dark_mode\n        }\n        .SetMode(m) -> {\n            store.SetMode(m)\n            .dark_mode = .store.dark_mode\n        }\n        .SetAccent(name) -> {\n            store.SetAccent(name)\n            .accent_color = .store.accent_color\n        }\n        .ToggleSettings -> { store.ToggleSettings() }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"notes\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\nicon: \"notebook\"\ntitle: \"Notes\"\ntitle_zh: \"备忘录\"\n# PLAN-637 T-06：经 635 通道消费 stylekit 共享配方（caption_text ×5）\ntheme: \"dark\"\naccent: \"indigo\"\napi: \"rust\"\nnpm_deps: [\"@autodown/editor:link:D:/autostack/auto-down/autodown/packages/editor\", \"@autodown/core:link:D:/autostack/auto-down/autodown/packages/core\", \"@autodown/engine:link:D:/autostack/auto-down/autodown/packages/engine\"]\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n\ndesktop: \"true\"\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "备忘录 015-notes fullstack markdown sidebar" },
        { id: "016-calendar", title: "日历", category: "02-components", icon: "app-window", description: "日历", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 016-calendar — Month-View Calendar\n\nA month-view calendar grid with 7 columns, date cells, event highlights, and previous/next month navigation.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Grid layout** — `grid { cols: 7 }` creates a 7-column calendar grid\n- **Grid items** — `grid-item { text \"1\" { ... } }` for individual date cells\n- **Date arithmetic** — month navigation with `PrevMonth` / `NextMonth` messages\n- **Event indicators** — highlighted dates with `bg-blue-100 rounded-full` styling\n- **Header navigation** — prev/next buttons flanking month/year display\n\n## Source\n\nSee `src/front/app.at`:\n\n```auto\nwidget App {\n    msg { PrevMonth, NextMonth }\n\n    model {\n        var month str = \"April\"\n        var year_display str = \"2026\"\n        var d1 str = \"Su\"\n        var d2 str = \"Mo\"\n        // ... day headers\n    }\n\n    view {\n        center {\n            col {\n                row {\n                    button \"<\" { onclick: .PrevMonth }\n                    col {\n                        text .month { class: \"text-2xl font-bold\" }\n                        text .year_display { class: \"text-sm text-gray-500\" }\n                    }\n                    button \">\" { onclick: .NextMonth }\n                }\n                row {\n                    text .d1 { class: \"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 ...\" }\n                    // ... 7 day headers\n                }\n                grid {\n                    grid-item { text \"1\" { class: \"...\" } }\n                    grid-item { text \"5\" { class: \"... bg-blue-100 rounded-full\" } }\n                    // ... 35 date cells\n                    cols: 7\n                    gap: 0\n                }\n                class: \"w-full max-w-md p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .PrevMonth -> { .month = \"March\" }\n        .NextMonth -> { .month = \"May\" }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/016-calendar\nauto gen              # Generate code for all backends (vue, jet, ark, rust)\nauto run              # Run dev server\n```\n\nAfter `auto gen`, generated projects appear in:\n- `gen/vue/` — Vue 3 + shadcn-vue\n- `gen/jet/` — Jetpack Compose (Kotlin)\n- `gen/ark/` — ArkTS (HarmonyOS)\n- `gen/rust/` — Rust GPUI\n", source: "use calendar_store: CalendarStore\nuse calendar_util: build_month_grid, month_name\n\nuse stylekit.styles: caption_text\nstyle nav_round_btn = \"w-10 h-10 rounded-full hover:bg-accent text-foreground font-bold\"\nstyle settings_label = \"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium\"\nstyle theme_btn_idle = \"flex-1 py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded-md text-muted-foreground hover:bg-accent border border-border bg-transparent transition-colors\"\nstyle theme_btn_active = \"flex-1 py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground transition-colors\"\n\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        PrevMonth,\n        NextMonth,\n        Today,\n        SelectDay(str),\n        ToggleSettings,\n        ToggleDarkMode,\n        SetTheme(str),\n        SetAccent(str),\n    }\n\n    model {\n        var dark_mode bool = false\n        var accent_color str = \"indigo\"\n        // Plan 448 F: weekday header as a list + for (replacing seven\n        // hand-unrolled grid-item lines).\n        var weekday_labels = [\"Su\", \"Mo\", \"Tu\", \"We\", \"Th\", \"Fr\", \"Sa\"]\n    }\n\n    // Plan 522: derived grid as computed — month_name / build_month_grid are\n    // use-imported module fns; the vue SFC transpiles them into the script\n    // (no more ×4 handler recalc chain in the store).\n    computed {\n        month_label => month_name(.store.month)\n        days => build_month_grid(.store.year, .store.month, .store.today, .store.selected_date)\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"min-h-screen bg-muted/30 p-4 items-center justify-center\"\n            col {\n                style: \"w-[448px] p-6 bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl shadow-lg\"\n\n                // Header (Nav + Title)\n                row {\n                    style: \"w-full items-center justify-between\"\n                    button \"<\" {\n                        onclick: .PrevMonth\n                        variant: \"ghost\"\n                        style: nav_round_btn\n                    }\n                    col {\n                        style: \"items-center\"\n                        text .month_label { style: \"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\" }\n                        text f\"${.store.year}\" { style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" }\n                    }\n                    row {\n                        style: \"gap-2 items-center\"\n                        button \"Today\" {\n                            onclick: .Today\n                            variant: \"ghost\"\n                            style: \"px-3 h-10 rounded-full hover:bg-accent text-foreground text-sm font-semibold\"\n                        }\n                        button \">\" {\n                            onclick: .NextMonth\n                            variant: \"ghost\"\n                            style: nav_round_btn\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Weekday headers\n                grid {\n                    cols: 7\n                    gap: 0\n                    style: \"w-full mt-4\"\n                    for d in .weekday_labels {\n                        grid-item { text d { style: \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground text-center py-2\" } }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Days Grid\n                grid {\n                    cols: 7\n                    gap: 0\n                    style: \"w-full mt-2\"\n                    for cell in .days {\n                        grid-item {\n                            button cell.label { variant: \"ghost\", onclick: .SelectDay(cell.date), class: cell.cell_class }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Settings popup (015-notes style)\n                if .store.show_settings {\n                    col {\n                        style: \"mt-4 p-3.5 bg-card border border-border rounded-xl gap-3 shadow-lg\"\n                        row {\n                            style: \"items-center justify-between\"\n                            text \"Settings\" { style: \"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground uppercase tracking-wider\" }\n                            button \"✕\" {\n                                onclick: .ToggleSettings\n                                variant: \"ghost\"\n                                style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground w-5 h-5 flex items-center justify-center rounded bg-transparent transition-colors\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            style: \"gap-1.5\"\n                            text \"Theme\" { style: settings_label }\n                            row {\n                                style: \"gap-2\"\n                                if .store.dark_mode {\n                                    button \"🌙 Dark\" {\n                                        onclick: .SetTheme(\"dark\")\n                                        style: theme_btn_active\n                                    }\n                                    button \"☀ Light\" {\n                                        onclick: .SetTheme(\"light\")\n                                        variant: \"ghost\"\n                                        style: theme_btn_idle\n                                    }\n                                } else {\n                                    button \"🌙 Dark\" {\n                                        onclick: .SetTheme(\"dark\")\n                                        variant: \"ghost\"\n                                        style: theme_btn_idle\n                                    }\n                                    button \"☀ Light\" {\n                                        onclick: .SetTheme(\"light\")\n                                        style: theme_btn_active\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                        col {\n                            style: \"gap-1.5\"\n                            text \"Accent Color\" { style: settings_label }\n                            row {\n                                style: \"items-center gap-3 py-1\"\n                                button \"\" { onclick: .SetAccent(\"indigo\"), style: if .store.accent_color == \"indigo\" { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-card ring-primary\" } else { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" } }\n                                button \"\" { onclick: .SetAccent(\"coral\"), style: if .store.accent_color == \"coral\" { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-rose-500 ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-card ring-primary\" } else { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-rose-500 hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" } }\n                                button \"\" { onclick: .SetAccent(\"ocean\"), style: if .store.accent_color == \"ocean\" { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-sky-500 ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-card ring-primary\" } else { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-sky-500 hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" } }\n                                button \"\" { onclick: .SetAccent(\"sage\"), style: if .store.accent_color == \"sage\" { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-card ring-primary\" } else { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" } }\n                                button \"\" { onclick: .SetAccent(\"amber\"), style: if .store.accent_color == \"amber\" { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-amber-500 ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-card ring-primary\" } else { \"w-6 h-6 p-0 rounded-full bg-amber-500 hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" } }\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Footer: Settings button in bottom-left + selected date display\n                row {\n                    style: \"w-full items-center justify-between mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-border\"\n                    button \"⚙ Settings\" {\n                        onclick: .ToggleSettings\n                        variant: \"ghost\"\n                        style: if .store.show_settings {\n                            \"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg bg-accent text-primary transition-colors\"\n                        } else {\n                            \"px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg text-muted-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-foreground bg-transparent transition-colors\"\n                        }\n                    }\n                    text f\"Selected: ${.store.selected_date}\" {\n                        style: caption_text\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            store.Init()\n            .dark_mode = .store.dark_mode\n            .accent_color = .store.accent_color\n        }\n\n        .PrevMonth -> {\n            store.PrevMonth()\n        }\n\n        .NextMonth -> {\n            store.NextMonth()\n        }\n\n        .Today -> {\n            store.Today()\n        }\n\n        .SelectDay(date) -> {\n            store.SelectDay(date)\n        }\n\n        .ToggleSettings -> {\n            store.ToggleSettings()\n        }\n\n        .ToggleDarkMode -> {\n            store.ToggleDarkMode()\n            .dark_mode = .store.dark_mode\n        }\n\n        .SetTheme(t) -> {\n            store.SetTheme(t)\n            .dark_mode = .store.dark_mode\n        }\n\n        .SetAccent(name) -> {\n            store.SetAccent(name)\n            .accent_color = .store.accent_color\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"calendar\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Calendar\"\ntitle_zh: \"日历\"\ntheme: \"light\"\naccent: \"indigo\"\nwindow: \"fit\"\n\n# PLAN-637 T-01b: dep settings 悬空声明移除（common/settings 已迁址 auto-os；\n# 本 demo 的 settings 面板为 store 驱动的本地实现，不依赖共享包，自足）。\ndesktop: \"true\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "日历 016-calendar autoui" },
        { id: "017-chat", title: "聊天", category: "03-apps", icon: "app-window", description: "聊天", tags: ["Chat", "Scroll", "Avatars"], doc: "# 017-chat — WeChat-Style Messenger (Plan 544 Full-Stack Enhancement)\n\nA modern WeChat/Slack-style instant messaging application demonstrating AutoUI's responsive dual-column layout, shared store state management, and full-stack integration with Rust Axum + SSE multi-event broadcast.\n\n## Features & Highlights\n\n- **Split-Pane Architecture** — Left contact navigation sidebar (`w-72`/`w-80`) + Right conversation main view (`flex-1`).\n- **Contact & Conversation Sidebar** (`ChatSidebar`):\n  - Current user profile status card (🧑‍💻 You • Online).\n  - Real-time search filter bar for contacts and conversations.\n  - Multi-session contact list (Alice, Bob, AutoBot 🤖, Tech Support) with avatars, last message preview, timestamps, unread badges, and active state highlight.\n- **Rich Message Thread** (`MessageThread`):\n  - Conversation header displaying active contact avatar, display name, online status, and quick action buttons.\n  - Right-aligned bubbles for sent messages (`bg-primary text-primary-foreground`) and left-aligned bubbles with avatars for received messages (`bg-muted text-foreground`).\n  - Cross-tab real-time typing indicator (`... is typing`).\n- **Emoji Picker & Action Toolbar** (`Composer`):\n  - Integrated Emoji picker toolbar (😀, 😂, 👍, ❤️, 🎉, 🔥, 🚀, 🤖) for 1-click emoji insertion into draft.\n  - Preset quick response chips (`Hello! 👋`, `Got it! 👍`) for rapid replies.\n  - Send on Enter, disabled/guarded on empty input, automatic input clearing.\n- **Full-Stack Backend Integration (`src/back/`)**:\n  - `GET /api/contacts` — Contact list and session metadata.\n  - `GET /api/messages` — Conversation message history.\n  - `POST /api/messages` — Send message and fan-out via SSE `NewMessage` event.\n  - `POST /api/bot_reply` — Intelligent assistant auto-responder simulation with SSE broadcast.\n  - `POST /api/typing` — Broadcast transient typing indicator across all connected clients.\n  - `GET /api/stream` — SSE multi-event stream (`NewMessage`, `Typing`).\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n017-chat/\n├── pac.at                     # Package manifest (scene: \"ui\", render: \"vue\", api: \"rust\")\n├── src/\n│   ├── front/\n│   │   ├── app.at             # Top-level shell assembling Sidebar + MessageThread + Composer\n│   │   ├── chat_sidebar.at    # Left contact list, user profile & search filter\n│   │   ├── message_thread.at  # Active chat header, bubble stream, typing indicator\n│   │   ├── composer.at        # Emoji toolbar, quick action chips, input bar\n│   │   ├── chat_store.at      # SharedStore consuming SSE multi-event stream\n│   │   └── types.at           # Contact & Message frontend type models\n│   └── back/\n│       ├── api.at             # HTTP & SSE endpoint contracts (compiled via api_gen to Rust Axum)\n│       └── db.at              # In-memory database, contacts service, and bot reply engine\n└── tests/\n    ├── acceptance.atd         # T1-T13 acceptance test contract\n    └── smoke.spec.ts          # Playwright end-to-end smoke tests\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/017-chat\nauto gen              # Generate Vue 3 + Tailwind + shadcn-vue project\nauto run              # Run frontend dev server (:3000) & backend Axum API server (:8080)\n```\n\n## Running Tests\n\n```bash\n# Backend compilation and API contract verification\ncargo test -p auto-man test_017_chat\n\n# End-to-end UI Playwright smoke tests (requires dev server running)\npnpm test\n```\n", source: "// app.at — Chat shell (WeChat-style multi-contact & bot enhancements).\n// Plan 051 C7 试点：header 秒表计时器（timer 块 demo，vue/VM 双轨）。\n// Plan 544: 现代双栏布局（左侧 ChatSidebar + 右侧 MessageThread + Composer）。\nuse chat_store: ChatStore\nuse chat_sidebar: ChatSidebar\nuse message_thread: MessageThread\nuse composer: Composer\nuse back.api: send_message, list_messages, set_typing\n\nuse stylekit.styles: caption_text\nstyle main_shell = \"flex-1 gap-3 min-h-0 overflow-hidden\"\n\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        Init,\n        SendMessage(str),\n        Typing(str),\n        ClockTick,\n        SelectContact(str),\n        SearchContacts(str),\n        TriggerBotReply(str)\n    }\n\n    model {\n        var clock_secs int = 0\n    }\n\n    timer {\n        ClockTick (every_ms: 1000)\n    }\n\n    computed {\n        active_name => if .store.active_contact_id == \"alice\" { \"Alice\" } else if .store.active_contact_id == \"bob\" { \"Bob\" } else if .store.active_contact_id == \"autobot\" { \"AutoBot 🤖\" } else { \"Tech Support\" }\n        active_avatar => if .store.active_contact_id == \"alice\" { \"👩‍💼\" } else if .store.active_contact_id == \"bob\" { \"👨‍💻\" } else if .store.active_contact_id == \"autobot\" { \"🤖\" } else { \"🛠️\" }\n        active_status => if .store.active_contact_id == \"autobot\" { \"AI Assistant • Online\" } else { \"Online • Available\" }\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"w-full h-screen flex-col bg-muted/20 p-3 gap-3 overflow-hidden\"\n            // Header Bar\n            row {\n                style: \"items-center justify-between px-5 py-2.5 bg-card rounded-xl shadow-xs border border-border\"\n                row {\n                    style: \"items-center gap-2\"\n                    text \"💬\" { style: \"text-xl\" }\n                    h2 \"Chat\" { style: \"text-lg font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight\" }\n                    text \"WeChat Edition\" { style: \"text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground ml-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-muted rounded-full border border-border/50\" }\n                }\n                row {\n                    style: \"items-center gap-3\"\n                    if .store.loading {\n                        text \"Loading…\" { style: caption_text }\n                    }\n                    text f\"⏱ ${.clock_secs}s\" { style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground tabular-nums font-mono\" }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Main Dual-column Body\n            row {\n                style: main_shell\n                ChatSidebar(\n                    contacts: .store.contacts,\n                    active_id: .store.active_contact_id,\n                    search_query: .store.search_query,\n                    on_select: .SelectContact,\n                    on_search: .SearchContacts\n                )\n                col {\n                    style: main_shell\n                    MessageThread(\n                        messages: .store.messages,\n                        typing_name: .store.typing_name,\n                        active_name: .active_name,\n                        active_avatar: .active_avatar,\n                        active_status: .active_status,\n                        on_trigger_bot: .TriggerBotReply\n                    )\n                    Composer(on_send: .SendMessage, on_typing: .Typing)\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            store.Init()\n        }\n        .ClockTick -> {\n            .clock_secs = .clock_secs + 1\n        }\n        .SendMessage(text) -> {\n            send_message(\"You\", text)\n            store.messages = list_messages()\n        }\n        .Typing(name) -> {\n            set_typing(name)\n        }\n        .SelectContact(id) -> {\n            store.SelectContact(id)\n        }\n        .SearchContacts(query) -> {\n            store.Search(query)\n        }\n        .TriggerBotReply(query) -> {\n            store.TriggerBot(query)\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"chat\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Chat\"\ntitle_zh: \"聊天\"\napi: \"rust\"\ndesktop: \"true\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "聊天 017-chat chat scroll avatars" },
        { id: "018-book-reader", title: "图书阅读器", category: "03-apps", icon: "app-window", description: "图书阅读器", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 018-book-reader — AutoRead\n\nA multi-page e-book reader: a bookshelf, book detail with chapter lists, an\nimmersive reading view with prev/next navigation, persisted reading progress,\nand a real runtime light/dark theme toggle. The first AutoUI example to fuse\n**multi-route navigation** (vue-router) with a **strong-typed rust backend**\n(CRUD + progress persistence) — modeled on a production reader (Apple Books /\nKindle) within AutoUI's reach.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Multi-route SPA** — `routes { ... }` + `<outlet>` in `app.at` drives a real\n  vue-router with four pages: `/` (bookshelf), `/book/:id` (detail),\n  `/book/:id/chapter/:ch` (reading), `/settings`. Route pages live in\n  `src/front/pages/*.at`.\n- **Shared store across routes** — `book_store.at` (`BooksStore`) is consumed by\n  every page via `use store:`; library state survives navigation.\n- **Strong-typed rust backend** — `src/back/api.at` declares `Book`/`Chapter`\n  + `#[api]` endpoints (list/get/create/delete books, list/get chapters,\n  update progress). `db.at` holds the in-memory store + business logic; the\n  generator delegates every handler to `db.rs` (Plan 399 route B, full cover).\n- **Reading progress persistence** — entering a chapter PUTs `% read`; the\n  bookshelf card and detail \"Continue Reading\" reflect saved progress.\n- **Runtime theme toggle (escape hatch)** — a handmade `vue/src/components/\n  ThemeToggle.vue` toggles `<html class=\"dark\">` at runtime (the `theme-toggle`\n  tag auto-maps to it), backed by a handmade `index.css`. Demonstrates the\n  declarative-DOM + escape-hatch combo (cf.\n  `examples/capability-tests/028-dom-escape`).\n- **Prev/next chapter navigation** — the reading view fetches the adjacent\n  chapter and updates the URL + progress on click.\n\n## Source\n\nApp shell (`src/front/app.at`) — the router + sidebar + outlet:\n\n```auto\nuse book_store: BooksStore\n\nwidget App {\n    routes {\n        \"/\" -> use bookshelf\n        \"/book/:id\" -> use book_detail\n        \"/book/:id/chapter/:ch\" -> use reading\n        \"/settings\" -> use settings\n    }\n    msg { Init }\n    view {\n        row {\n            col { /* sidebar: Library / Settings links + theme-toggle */ }\n            col { outlet }\n        }\n    }\n    on { .Init -> { store.Init() } }\n}\n```\n\nLayout: `app.at` = router shell; `pages/*.at` = the four route targets;\n`book_store.at` = shared store; `src/back/{api,db}.at` = rust backend.\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/018-book-reader\nauto gen    # generate frontend (gen/front/vue) + rust backend\nauto run    # serve frontend (:3018) + backend (:8018), with vite proxy\n```\n\nThis project declares **dedicated ports** in `pac.at` (`front_port: 3018`,\n`back_port: 8018`) so it can run concurrently with other examples (e.g. the\ndefault 3000/8080 used elsewhere) without vite/backend port clashes. `auto run`\nreads them automatically; override with `-F`/`-B` if needed:\n\n```bash\nauto run -F 3000 -B 8080   # force the default ports instead\n```\n\nOpen **http://localhost:3018/** (the hash router serves all pages from there).\n\nGenerated artifacts (gitignored): `gen/front/vue/` (Vue 3 + shadcn-vue) and\n`examples/rust-workspace/018-book-reader-back/` (axum CRUD server).\n\n## Tests\n\n```bash\ncd tests && npm install && npm test   # playwright, 10/10 (T1-T10)\n```\n\nAcceptance contract in `tests/acceptance.atd`. Start `auto run` first.\n\n## Inspiration\n\nApple Books, Kindle, and a production reader app (auto-read). Notes, reading\nstatistics, and Tauri file import are intentionally out of scope for this\nexample (see Plan 399).\n", source: "// app.at — Book Reader shell. Multi-page routes + sidebar nav + outlet.\n// Plan 399 018: first example to fuse routes (auto-read architecture) with a\n// strong-typed rust backend (015/017 CRUD pattern).\nuse book_store: BooksStore\n\nstyle sub_text = \"text-sm text-muted-foreground\"\n\nwidget App {\n    routes {\n        \"/\" -> use bookshelf\n        \"/book/:id\" -> use book_detail\n        \"/book/:id/chapter/:ch\" -> use reading\n        \"/settings\" -> use settings\n    }\n\n    msg { Init }\n\n    view {\n        row {\n            style: \"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground\"\n\n            // Sidebar (desktop)\n            col {\n                style: \"w-60 border-r border-border bg-card hidden md:flex flex-col fixed inset-y-0 z-40\"\n                row {\n                    style: \"items-center gap-2 p-5 border-b border-border\"\n                    text \"📖\" { style: \"text-xl\" }\n                    text \"AutoRead\" { style: \"font-bold text-lg text-foreground\" }\n                }\n                // Plan 562: nav → sidebar 族（nav 退役）。外壳 col 已承担\n                // w-60 宽度/fixed 定位，不用 sidebar root；provider class\n                // 覆盖 min-h-svh/w-full 默认（独子直返，VM 零布局介入）。\n                sidebar_provider (class: \"w-auto min-h-0 flex flex-1 min-h-0 flex-col\") {\n                    sidebar_menu (style: \"p-3 flex-1\") {\n                        // Plan 548 D2: menu_button(to:) 路由模式 —— Vue hash\n                        // URL + 浏览器返回；VM __navigate + router.back() 历史栈。\n                        // 选中态主色调高亮由 to 自动判定（/ 对 /book/1 不误亮——\n                        // 前缀段匹配，exact: true 锁首页恰等）。\n                        sidebar_menu_item {\n                            sidebar_menu_button (to: \"/\", exact: true) {\n                                text \"📚\" {}\n                                text \"Library\" {}\n                            }\n                        }\n                        sidebar_menu_item {\n                            sidebar_menu_button (to: \"/settings\") {\n                                text \"⚙️\" {}\n                                text \"Settings\" {}\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                // Runtime dark/light toggle (handmade ThemeToggle.vue escape hatch).\n                row {\n                    style: \"p-4 border-t border-border justify-end\"\n                    theme-toggle {}\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Main content\n            col {\n                style: \"flex-1 md:ml-60\"\n                // Mobile top bar\n                row {\n                    style: \"h-14 border-b border-border bg-card items-center px-4 gap-4 md:hidden\"\n                    text \"📖 AutoRead\" { style: \"font-bold text-foreground\" }\n                    row { style: \"flex-1\" }\n                    link (to: \"/\") { text \"Library\" { style: sub_text } }\n                    link (to: \"/settings\") { text \"Settings\" { style: sub_text } }\n                    theme-toggle {}\n                }\n                outlet\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> { store.Init() }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"book-reader\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Book Reader\"\ntitle_zh: \"图书阅读器\"\napi: \"rust\"\nfront_port: 3018\nback_port: 8018\ndesktop: \"true\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: false, search_lc: "图书阅读器 018-book-reader autoui" },
        { id: "019-video-app", title: "视频应用", category: "03-apps", icon: "app-window", description: "视频应用", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 019-video-app — Bilibili / YouTube-Style Video App\n\nA dual-backend AutoUI video application supporting both **Vue** mode (`auto run`) and **VM/Iced** mode (`auto run -r vm`).\n\n## Features\n\n- **Multi-Route Navigation**:\n  - `/` (Home): Video feed with search, category filter chips, tabs (Recommend / Trending / Following), and responsive video grid.\n  - `/watch/:id` (Watch): Player screen preview, channel info, view counter, like button, video description, and related video recommendations.\n- **Dual-Backend Themes & Settings**:\n  - Light / Dark mode switcher (🌙 / ☀)\n  - 5-Color Accent palette (Pink, Indigo, Ocean, Sage, Amber) using the same Settings panel architecture as `017-chat` and `018-book-reader`.\n- **Rust Axum Backend**:\n  - `src/back/api.at` & `src/back/db.at` providing typed REST endpoints for video listing, filtering, search, view increment, and like toggling.\n- **Automated Verification**:\n  - Playwright E2E smoke tests (`tests/smoke.spec.ts`)\n  - AutoUI MCP VM mode smoke test (`tests/vm-smoke.mjs`)\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nexamples/ui/019-video-app/\n├── pac.at                 # Config: scene \"ui\", render \"vue\", api \"rust\", ports 3019/8019\n├── src/\n│   ├── front/\n│   │   ├── app.at         # Root widget with responsive layout & navigation\n│   │   ├── stores/        # Frontend state management (Vue stores)\n│   │   │   └── video.at   # Video store (active tab, selected video, search)\n│   │   ├── components/    # Reusable UI components\n│   │   │   ├── nav_header.at     # Top navbar with search & notifications\n│   │   │   ├── video_card.at     # Video card with thumbnail & meta\n│   │   │   ├── video_player.at   # Interactive player with controls\n│   │   │   ├── comment_section.at# Comments list & input form\n│   │   │   └── settings_panel.at # Slide-over settings drawer\n│   │   └── pages/\n│   │       ├── home.at    # Main feed with categories & video grid\n│   │       ├── watch.at   # Video detail page with player & recommendations\n│   │       └── profile.at # User profile & uploaded videos\n│   └── back/\n│       ├── api.at         # REST API declarations (#[api] routes)\n│       └── db.at          # In-memory database with seed data\n└── tests/\n    ├── package.json       # Playwright dependencies\n    ├── playwright.config.ts # E2E test configuration\n    ├── smoke.spec.ts      # 10 comprehensive E2E tests\n    └── vm-smoke.mjs       # Headless VM smoke test (10 assertions)\n```\n\n## Running\n\n```bash\n# Standard run (Vue mode)\nauto run\n\n# Frontend runs on `http://localhost:3019` and backend API runs on `http://127.0.0.1:8019`.\n```\n\n### VM / Iced Mode\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/019-video-app\nauto run -r vm\n```\n\n### Running Tests\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/019-video-app\n\n# VM Mode MCP Smoke Test\nnode tests/vm-smoke.mjs\n\n# Playwright E2E Tests (requires auto run)\ncd tests && pnpm exec playwright test\n```\n", source: "// app.at — 019-video-app root shell.\n// Routes: \"/\" (Home) and \"/watch/:id\" (Watch page).\n// Left sidebar navigation with VideoApp logo, Home nav item, and SettingsPanel popup.\n\nuse video_store: VideoStore\nuse settings: SettingsPanel\n\n// PLAN-637 B5 Phase B 映射（tier 收敛，同 008/009 口径）：zinc-100/gray-900→foreground；\n// zinc-400/300・gray-500/400→muted-foreground；bg-zinc-800/gray-100→bg-muted；\n// bg-zinc-900/white→bg-card；border-zinc-800/700/gray-200→border-border。text-white ×4\n// 为视频缩略图叠字（图像上恒白，豁免）。\nwidget App {\n    routes {\n        \"/\" -> use home\n        \"/watch/:id\" -> use watch\n    }\n\n    msg {\n        Init,\n        GoHome,\n        ToggleSettings,\n        CloseSettings,\n        ToggleDarkMode,\n        SetPink,\n        SetIndigo,\n        SetOcean,\n        SetSage,\n        SetAmber,\n    }\n\n    view {\n        row {\n            style: if .store.dark_mode {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground flex\"\n            } else {\n                \"w-full min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground flex\"\n            }\n\n            // ── Left Sidebar Navigation ──\n            col {\n                style: if .store.dark_mode {\n                    \"w-64 min-h-screen bg-card border-r border-border shrink-0 flex flex-col\"\n                } else {\n                    \"w-64 min-h-screen bg-card border-r border-border shrink-0 flex flex-col\"\n                }\n\n                // Top: Brand Logo & Navigation\n                col {\n                    style: \"flex-1 p-4 gap-4 flex flex-col\"\n\n                    // Logo\n                    row {\n                        onclick: .GoHome\n                        style: \"items-center gap-2.5 px-2 py-1 cursor-pointer\"\n                        text \"📺\" { style: \"text-2xl\" }\n                        text \"VideoApp\" {\n                            style: if .store.accent_color == \"pink\" {\n                                \"text-xl font-extrabold text-pink-500 tracking-tight\"\n                            } else if .store.accent_color == \"indigo\" {\n                                \"text-xl font-extrabold text-indigo-500 tracking-tight\"\n                            } else if .store.accent_color == \"ocean\" {\n                                \"text-xl font-extrabold text-sky-500 tracking-tight\"\n                            } else if .store.accent_color == \"sage\" {\n                                \"text-xl font-extrabold text-emerald-500 tracking-tight\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-xl font-extrabold text-amber-500 tracking-tight\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // Navigation items (Plan 562: nav-item → sidebar 族 menu_button)\n                    sidebar_provider (class: \"w-auto min-h-0 flex flex-col\") {\n                        sidebar_menu (style: \"mt-2\") {\n                            sidebar_menu_item {\n                                sidebar_menu_button (to: \"/\", exact: true) {\n                                    text \"🏠\" {}\n                                    text \"Home\" {}\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Bottom: Settings Popup Panel & Trigger Button\n                col {\n                    style: if .store.dark_mode {\n                        \"p-3 gap-2 border-t border-border shrink-0\"\n                    } else {\n                        \"p-3 gap-2 border-t border-border shrink-0\"\n                    }\n\n                    if .store.show_settings {\n                        SettingsPanel(\n                            dark_mode: .store.dark_mode,\n                            accent_color: .store.accent_color,\n                            on_close: .CloseSettings,\n                            on_toggle_dark: .ToggleDarkMode,\n                            on_set_pink: .SetPink,\n                            on_set_indigo: .SetIndigo,\n                            on_set_ocean: .SetOcean,\n                            on_set_sage: .SetSage,\n                            on_set_amber: .SetAmber\n                        )\n                    }\n\n                    row {\n                        style: \"items-center justify-between\"\n                        button \"⚙ Settings\" {\n                            onclick: .ToggleSettings\n                            style: if .store.show_settings {\n                                if .store.dark_mode {\n                                    \"px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-muted text-pink-400 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl bg-pink-50 text-pink-600 transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                                }\n                            } else {\n                                if .store.dark_mode {\n                                    \"px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium rounded-xl text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 bg-transparent transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                                } else {\n                                    \"px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium rounded-xl text-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted bg-transparent transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                        text \"v1.0\" {\n                            style: if .store.dark_mode {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground mr-2\"\n                            } else {\n                                \"text-xs text-muted-foreground mr-2\"\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ── Main Content Area ──\n            col {\n                style: \"flex-1 w-full min-h-screen overflow-y-auto flex-col\"\n                outlet\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> { store.Init() }\n        .GoHome -> { router.push(\"/\") }\n        .ToggleSettings -> { store.ToggleSettings() }\n        .CloseSettings -> { store.CloseSettings() }\n        .ToggleDarkMode -> { store.ToggleDarkMode() }\n        .SetPink -> { store.SetAccent(\"pink\") }\n        .SetIndigo -> { store.SetAccent(\"indigo\") }\n        .SetOcean -> { store.SetAccent(\"ocean\") }\n        .SetSage -> { store.SetAccent(\"sage\") }\n        .SetAmber -> { store.SetAccent(\"amber\") }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"video-app\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Video App\"\ntitle_zh: \"视频应用\"\napi: \"rust\"\nfront_port: 3019\nback_port: 8019\ntheme: \"dark\"\naccent: \"pink\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: false, search_lc: "视频应用 019-video-app autoui" },
        { id: "020-music-player", title: "极光音乐播放器", category: "03-apps", icon: "music", description: "极光音乐播放器", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 020-music-player — AutoUI Modern Desktop Music Player\n\nA modern desktop music player inspired by Spotify, QQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music, and Soda Music (汽水音乐), supporting full local music library indexing and streaming from `E:\\Music\\`.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Modern 3-Column Layout**:\n  - **NavSidebar**: Brand logo, navigation tabs (Local Music, Stage, Playlists, Favorites), dynamic stats badge, and dark mode toggle.\n  - **Stage View**: Immersive vinyl turntable animation with realistic tonearm, 16-band animated audio spectrum equalizer, lyrics preview card, and Hi-Res / Lossless format badges.\n  - **Tracklist View**: Full local music table with search filter, format pills (All, FLAC, MP3, WAV), song metadata (title, artist, size, extension), play/shuffle action buttons, and scan refresh.\n  - **Queue Drawer**: Collapsible right-hand upcoming queue drawer showing queue count and instant song switching.\n  - **Bottom Player Bar**: Spotify/NetEase style 3-column sticky bar with track cover info, center transport controls (Shuffle, Prev, Play/Pause, Next, Repeat), interactive draggable seekbar with time stamps, volume control, and view/queue toggles.\n- **Local Audio Streaming & Media Service**:\n  - Automatically indexes local audio files from `media_root: \"E:\\\\Music\\\\\"` in `pac.at`.\n  - Supports FLAC, MP3, WAV, OGG, M4A, AAC.\n  - Automatic `Artist - Title` parsing from standard music filenames.\n  - HTTP 206 partial content byte-range streaming via `/api/media/stream/:id` served by the native backend.\n  - Controlled HTML5 `<video>` / audio element syncing seek position, volume, playback state, duration, and error reporting.\n\n## Running\n\n```bash\n# Run with Vue frontend (browser) + Rust media backend\ncd examples/ui/020-music-player\nauto run\n\n# VM / Iced native window\nauto run -r vm\n```\n\n## Architecture\n\n- `src/front/player_store.at`: Global reactive player store (state machine, library scan, playlist management, seek target, volume, repeat/shuffle modes, computed labels).\n- `src/front/nav_sidebar.at`: Left navigation sidebar with branding, views, and playlists.\n- `src/front/stage.at`: Immersive playback stage with spinning vinyl disc, tonearm, 16-bar spectrum analyzer, and lyrics card.\n- `src/front/tracklist.at`: Local music library table, instant search, format filter tags, and track rows.\n- `src/front/queue_drawer.at`: Upcoming play queue drawer with count indicator and track jump.\n- `src/front/controls.at`: Bottom 3-column playback controller with draggable progress bar and volume controls.\n- `src/front/viewport.at`: Invisible controlled media element binding playback events to the store.\n- `src/front/app.at`: Root layout combining sidebar, main stage/tracklist, queue drawer, and bottom controls.\n\n## Inspiration & Design Reference\n\nQQ Music, NetEase Cloud Music (网易云音乐), Soda Music (汽水音乐), Spotify.\n", source: "// app.at — 020-music-player 主入口组件。\n//\n// 架构：三栏式现代化桌面音乐播放器。\n// - Sidebar：左侧导航栏\n// - Stage / Tracklist：中央主体视图（黑胶唱片舞台 / 本地曲库表格）\n// - QueueDrawer：右侧可折叠待播抽屉\n// - Controls：底部一体化全功能播控台\n// - Viewport：受控 HTML5 媒体解码视口\n\nuse player_store: PlayerStore\nuse nav_sidebar: NavSidebar\nuse stage: Stage\nuse tracklist: Tracklist\nuse controls: Controls\nuse queue_drawer: QueueDrawer\nuse viewport: Viewport\n\n// PLAN-637 B5 Phase B 映射（2026-09-17）：bg-zinc-950→bg-background；轨道 bg-zinc-400/300→\n// bg-muted；ring-zinc-800/border-zinc-900→border 系。豁免：封面渐变叠字 text-white ×4、\n// rose（红心）与 emerald（播放徽章/封面渐变）= 语义状态与装饰渐变（638 重设计后残余）。\nwidget App {\n    msg {\n        Init,\n        ToggleDarkMode\n    }\n\n    model {\n        // 主题魔法变量：保持在根 widget 以驱动生成器深浅色运行时\n        var dark_mode bool = true\n        var accent_color str = \"emerald\"\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"w-full h-screen flex-col bg-background text-foreground overflow-hidden font-sans select-none\"\n\n            // ── 主体区域：左边栏 + 中央内容 + 右抽屉 ──\n            row {\n                style: \"w-full flex-1 min-h-0\"\n\n                NavSidebar()\n\n                col {\n                    style: \"flex-1 min-w-0 min-h-0 bg-background/50 relative overflow-hidden\"\n\n                    if .store.view_mode == \"stage\" {\n                        Stage()\n                    } else {\n                        Tracklist()\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if .store.show_queue {\n                    QueueDrawer()\n                }\n            }\n\n            // ── 底部播控台 ──\n            Controls()\n\n            // ── 隐藏的受控媒体宿主 ──\n            Viewport()\n        }\n    }\n\n    // PLAN-024 R19：桌面音乐卡（stella mini-player 设计语言：圆盘 glyph +\n    // 曲名/艺人居中 + 进度时间标签 + ⏮⏯⏭ 控制——face 事件直达本 app 会话，\n    // PlayPause 无曲目时自动 SelectIndex(0) 开播）。category=media → 主 tab。\n    view mini {\n        col {\n            style: \"w-full h-full items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4\"\n            col {\n                style: \"w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-primary/15 items-center justify-center\"\n                text \"♪\" {\n                    style: \"text-2xl text-primary\"\n                }\n            }\n            text .store.current_title {\n                style: \"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground text-center\"\n            }\n            text .store.current_artist {\n                style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground text-center\"\n            }\n            text .store.time_progress_label {\n                style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground tabular-nums\"\n            }\n            row {\n                style: \"items-center gap-5\"\n                button (onclick: .PrevTrack) {\n                    text { \"⏮\" }\n                    style: \"text-muted-foreground text-base\"\n                }\n                button (onclick: .PlayPause) {\n                    if .store.is_playing {\n                        text { \"⏸\" }\n                        style: \"text-primary text-xl\"\n                    } else {\n                        text { \"▶\" }\n                        style: \"text-primary text-xl\"\n                    }\n                }\n                button (onclick: .NextTrack) {\n                    text { \"⏭\" }\n                    style: \"text-muted-foreground text-base\"\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            store.Load()\n        }\n        .ToggleDarkMode -> {\n            .dark_mode = !.dark_mode\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"music-player\"\nversion: \"2.0.0\"\ndescription: \"AutoMusic Player - Modern Local & Stream Music Player (QQ Music / NetEase / Spotify / Soda Music style)\"\n\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\napi: \"rust\"\nfront_port: 3020\nback_port: 8320\nmedia_root: \"E:\\\\Music\\\\\"\nicon: \"music\"\ntitle: \"AutoMusic Player\"\ntitle_zh: \"极光音乐播放器\"\ncategory: \"media\"\ndesktop: \"true\"\ntheme: \"dark\"\naccent: \"emerald\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "极光音乐播放器 020-music-player autoui" },
        { id: "021-blog-viewer", title: "博客阅读器", category: "03-apps", icon: "app-window", description: "博客阅读器", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 021-blog-viewer — Medium-Style Blog Viewer\n\nA multi-page Medium-style blog application: article stream with category filtering,\nrich reading detail view with paragraph splitting, interactive clap feedback,\nwriting editor with validation and publishing, and two-step confirmation article\ndeletion. Fully powered by AutoUI **multi-route navigation** (vue-router) and a\n**strong-typed Rust backend** (`axum` via route B `db.at` delegation).\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Multi-route SPA** — `routes { ... }` + `<outlet>` in `src/front/app.at` drives\n  a real vue-router with three pages: `/` (home article stream), `/post/:id`\n  (article reader), `/new` (story editor).\n- **Shared Store across routes** — `blog_store.at` (`BlogStore`) is consumed by\n  every page via `use store:`; articles list, active category, and loading state\n  survive navigation.\n- **Strong-typed Rust backend** — `src/back/api.at` declares `Article` schema and\n  5 `#[api]` endpoints (list with optional `?category=`, get single post, create,\n  delete, toggle clap). `db.at` maintains in-memory article storage and seed data.\n- **Rich reading view & paragraph splitting** — detail view splits article body by\n  double newlines (`\\n\\n`) into readable paragraphs with author attribution and metadata.\n- **Interactive clapping** — toggles claps (`POST /api/posts/:id/clap`) with +1/-1\n  state tracking per post.\n- **Controlled editor & form validation** — `/new` validates non-empty title and content,\n  supporting category selection (`Rust`, `AutoUI`, `WASM`) and instant publishing.\n- **Two-step delete safety** — detail view provides an inline confirmation box before\n  permanently deleting an article and navigating back to home.\n\n## Source\n\nApp shell (`src/front/app.at`) — router shell + top bar + outlet:\n\n```auto\nuse blog_store: BlogStore\n\nwidget App {\n    routes {\n        \"/\" -> use home\n        \"/post/:id\" -> use detail\n        \"/new\" -> use editor\n    }\n    msg { Init, GoHome, WritePost }\n    view {\n        col {\n            row {\n                row {\n                    text \"✍️\" { class: \"text-xl\" }\n                    text \"My Blog\" { class: \"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground\" }\n                    onclick: .GoHome\n                }\n                row {\n                    text \"${.store.articles.len()} articles\" { class: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground font-medium\" }\n                    button \"Write\" {\n                        class: \"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-full text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors shadow-xs cursor-pointer\"\n                        onclick: .WritePost\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            col {\n                outlet\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    on {\n        .Init -> { store.Init() }\n        .GoHome -> { navigate(\"/\") }\n        .WritePost -> { navigate(\"/new\") }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nLayout:\n- `src/front/app.at`: Root router shell and sticky header\n- `src/front/pages/home.at`: Article cards and category filter chips\n- `src/front/pages/detail.at`: Full reader, clap counter, delete confirm\n- `src/front/pages/editor.at`: Story publishing form with validation\n- `src/front/blog_store.at`: Unified store managing API synchronization\n- `src/back/api.at`: Declarative Axum API routes\n- `src/back/db.at`: In-memory article database and business operations\n\n## How to Run\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/021-blog-viewer\nauto gen    # generate Vue frontend (gen/front/vue) + Rust backend\n```\n\nThis project declares dedicated ports in `pac.at` (`front_port: 3021`, `back_port: 8421`)\nto prevent port collisions with other examples or system services:\n\n```bash\n# Start backend:\n$env:AUTO_HTTP_PORT=\"8421\"; cargo run -p app-021-blog-viewer-back\n\n# Start frontend (in gen/front/vue):\n$env:AUTO_FRONT_PORT=\"3021\"; $env:AUTO_HTTP_PORT=\"8421\"; pnpm dev\n```\n\nOpen **http://localhost:3021/** in your browser.\n\n## Tests\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/021-blog-viewer/tests\npnpm install\npnpm exec playwright test\n```\n\n7/7 smoke test cases (`tests/smoke.spec.ts`) cover:\n- T1: Home page initial render (top bar, 6 articles count, 6 seed cards)\n- T2: Category chip filtering (Rust filter narrows to 2 cards; All restores)\n- T3: Detail view navigation (URL `/post/:id`, metadata, >=3 paragraphs)\n- T4: Clap toggle (+1 on first click, falls back on second click)\n- T5: Story publishing flow (fill form, publish, prepend to home, count becomes 7)\n- T6: Form validation (empty title displays warning, prevents submission)\n- T7: Deletion flow (delete button, confirmation prompt, removal from list, count restored)\n\nAcceptance contract recorded in `tests/acceptance.atd`.\n\n## Inspiration\n\nMedium, Dev.to, Substack, and JetNews.\n", source: "// app.at — Blog Viewer root shell.\n// Routes (home, detail, editor) + sticky top navbar + outlet.\nuse store: BlogStore\n\nwidget App {\n    routes {\n        \"/\" -> use home\n        \"/post/:id\" -> use detail\n        \"/new\" -> use editor\n    }\n\n    msg {\n        Init,\n        GoHome,\n        WritePost,\n    }\n\n    model {\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground flex flex-col\"\n\n            // Sticky Top Navigation Header\n            row {\n                style: \"w-full h-16 border-b border-border bg-card/90 backdrop-blur items-center justify-between px-6 sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-xs\"\n\n                // Brand / Title\n                row {\n                    onclick: .GoHome\n                    style: \"items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none\"\n                    text \"✍️\" { style: \"text-xl\" }\n                    text \"My Blog\" { style: \"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground\" }\n                }\n\n                // Header right actions: article counter & Write button\n                row {\n                    style: \"items-center gap-4\"\n                    text f\"${.store.articles.len()} articles\" {\n                        style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground font-medium\"\n                    }\n                    button {\n                        onclick: .WritePost\n                        style: \"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-full text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors shadow-xs cursor-pointer\"\n                        text \"Write\" {}\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Router outlet for current page\n            col {\n                style: \"flex-1 w-full\"\n                outlet\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            store.Init()\n        }\n        .GoHome -> {\n            router.push(\"/\")\n        }\n        .WritePost -> {\n            router.push(\"/new\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"blog-viewer\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Blog Viewer\"\ntitle_zh: \"博客阅读器\"\napi: \"rust\"\nfront_port: 3021\nback_port: 8421\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: false, search_lc: "博客阅读器 021-blog-viewer autoui" },
        { id: "022-kanban", title: "看板", category: "03-apps", icon: "app-window", description: "看板", tags: ["DnD", "Columns", "Cards"], doc: "# 022-kanban — Trello-Style Board (Full App)\n\nA Kanban board with three columns (To Do / In Progress / Done). Cards can be\nadded, moved between columns, and deleted — all backed by a typed Rust API.\nUpgraded from a single-file static toy to a full App (Plan 404), aligned with\n015-notes / 017-chat / 018-book-reader.\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Multi-module frontend** — `app.at` (route shell) + `board_store.at`\n  (shared store) + `pages/board.at` (the board), cf. 018's structure.\n- **Strongly-typed Rust backend** — `src/back/{api.at, db.at}`, `#[api]`\n  endpoints delegating to db.rs (Plan 399 route B: full coverage).\n- **Single-collection model** — cards live in one `Card { id, title, column }`\n  collection; moving a card just changes its `column` (standard kanban\n  modeling, simpler than three independent lists).\n- **Shared store (k1 pattern)** — `BoardStore` holds `cards`; the board page\n  does `use store: BoardStore` and re-fetches after every mutation.\n- **Column filtering in the view** — each column renders `for card in\n  .store.cards` with an `if card.column == \"todo\"` filter (cf. 018 pages).\n- **Per-example ports** — `front_port: 3022` / `back_port: 8022` in `pac.at`\n  so it can run concurrently with other examples.\n\n## Source\n\n```\nsrc/front/\n  app.at              # App shell: routes{\"/\" -> board} + header\n  board_store.at      # BoardStore: cards collection + add/remove/move\n  pages/\n    board.at          # \"/\" → three columns + add-card input + move/delete\nsrc/back/\n  api.at              # pub type Card + 4 #[api] endpoints\n  db.at               # typed in-memory store + 9 seed cards\ntests/                # playwright suite (T1-T8)\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n> ⚠️ **Port note (known gap, Plan 404)**: the current `auto run` does **not**\n> inject `pac.at`'s `front_port`/`back_port` into the dev servers (it still\n> defaults to 3000/8080). To run on the dedicated 3022/8022 ports, set the\n> environment variables explicitly:\n\nGenerate first (so `router/index.ts` exists before `auto run`):\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/022-kanban\nauto gen\n```\n\nThen run — **option A** (dedicated ports via env, recommended for testing):\n\n```bash\n# 1) backend (separately, on 8022)\nAUTO_HTTP_PORT=8022 ./examples/rust-workspace/target/debug/app-022-kanban-back.exe\n# 2) frontend vite (on 3022, proxy → 8022)\ncd gen/front/vue\nAUTO_FRONT_PORT=3022 AUTO_HTTP_PORT=8022 pnpm dev\n# open http://localhost:3022/\n```\n\n**Option B** (default ports, simplest — no env vars):\n\n```bash\nauto run    # serves frontend (:3000) + backend (:8080), vite proxy wired\n# open http://localhost:3000/\n```\n\n## API\n\n| Method | Path | Action |\n|---|---|---|\n| GET | `/api/cards` | list all cards |\n| POST | `/api/cards` | add a card (defaults to \"todo\") |\n| DELETE | `/api/cards/:id` | remove a card |\n| PUT | `/api/cards/:id/move` | move a card to another column (`{column}`) |\n\n## Tests\n\nStart the servers (Option A above), then:\n\n```bash\ncd tests && npm install && npm test    # playwright, T1-T8\n```\n\nAcceptance contract in `tests/acceptance.atd`. Tests cover: initial render\n(9 seed cards), three column titles, add card, move todo→doing, move\ndoing→done, delete card, state persistence across reload, no console errors.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Card movement supports both: `>` buttons (todo→doing→done) / `×` to delete,\n  **and HTML5 drag-and-drop** (drag a card onto another column).\n- **Drag-and-drop** (Plan 404 stage 2): cards are `draggable`, `ondragstart`\n  stores the id in widget state, columns use `ondragover.prevent` + `ondrop`\n  to read it and call `store.MoveCard`. Widget state (not `dataTransfer`)\n  carries the id since source and target share one widget.\n- **codegen fix**: `row`/`col` layout primitives used to drop non-class props\n  (their shadcn branch only emitted `class`), so `draggable` never reached the\n  DOM. Fixed via `push_passthrough_attrs` — row/col now pass through arbitrary\n  HTML attributes like `draggable`.\n\n## Inspiration\n\nTrello, Linear.\n", source: "// app.at — App shell. Single-page board; routes just render the board page.\n// store import at the top (cf. 018 app.at `use book_store: BooksStore`).\nuse board_store: BoardStore\n\nwidget App {\n    routes {\n        \"/\" -> use board\n    }\n\n    msg { Init }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground\"\n            // Header\n            row {\n                style: \"w-full items-center justify-between p-4 border-b border-border bg-card\"\n                row {\n                    style: \"items-center gap-2\"\n                    text \"Project Board\" { style: \"text-xl font-bold text-foreground\" }\n                    text \"Kanban\" { style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" }\n                }\n            }\n            // Route outlet\n            col {\n                style: \"flex-1\"\n                outlet\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> { store.Init() }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"kanban\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Kanban\"\ntitle_zh: \"看板\"\napi: \"rust\"\nfront_port: 3022\nback_port: 8022\n// desktop 退策展（PLAN-008）：app 已升格独立仓 auto-kanban（apps.manifest\n// extra root 原生挂载）替位桌面入口；本目录留作教学示例与收割语料，不迁不删。\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: false, search_lc: "看板 022-kanban dnd columns cards" },
        { id: "023-realworld", title: "RealWorld", category: "03-apps", icon: "app-window", description: "RealWorld", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 023-realworld — Conduit (Medium clone)\n\nA RealWorld (Conduit) spec implementation, upgraded from a single-file toy to a\nfull App (Plan 405, stages 1 + 2), aligned with 015/017/018/022. playwright 14/14.\n\n**Scope**: authentication (login/register/settings/logout) + global feed with\ntag filtering + article detail + article CRUD (editor) + post/delete comments +\nfollow/unfollow + favorite + profile page. (Pagination + markdown rendering\ndeferred.) A hand-written `vue-ref/` prototype validated interactions before\nthe `.at` port.\n\n> **Auth is mock** (stage 1/2): any password works for a known email;\n> `current_user` returns id=0 (logged out). No real token auth — that needs\n> codegen support for reading request headers (separate effort).\n\n## Concepts\n\n- **Multi-route frontend** — `app.at` routes{5} + outlet, cf. 018. Hash routing.\n- **Two shared stores** — `AuthStore` (current_user, login/register/logout) +\n  `ArticleStore` (articles/current_article/comments/tags). Each page does\n  `use store: X`.\n- **Strongly-typed Rust backend** — `src/back/{api.at, db.at}`, 6 `#[api]`\n  endpoints delegating to db.rs (Plan 399 route B).\n- **Client-side tag filtering** — `article.tagList.contains(active_tag)` in the\n  view (a2r doesn't clone borrowed String fields when passing to a server\n  helper fn, so server-side tag matching is impractical).\n- **vue-ref prototype** — `vue-ref/` is a hand-written Vue3 + Tailwind\n  reference (mock data) that mirrors the auto codegen stack, used to validate\n  interactions before porting to `.at`.\n\n## Source\n\n```\nsrc/front/\n  app.at              # App shell: routes{5} + nav (login-aware) + outlet\n  auth_store.at       # AuthStore: current_user (id=0 = logged out)\n  article_store.at    # ArticleStore: articles/comments/tags, client filter\n  pages/\n    home.at           # / → global feed + Popular Tags sidebar\n    login.at          # /login → login form (value:+oninput:, no v-model)\n    register.at       # /register → register form\n    article_detail.at # /article/:slug → body + comments (router.param)\n    settings.at       # /settings → profile (display-only) + logout\nsrc/back/\n  api.at              # pub type User/Article/Comment + 6 #[api] endpoints\n  db.at               # typed in-memory store + seed (2 users, 3 articles, 3 comments)\nvue-ref/              # Vue3 + Tailwind reference prototype (mock data)\ntests/                # playwright suite (T1-T8)\n```\n\n## How to Run\n\n> ⚠️ **Port gap (Plan 401)**: `auto run` doesn't read `pac.at`'s front_port; it\n> defaults vary. Generate first, then run, and read the printed `Local:` port.\n\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/023-realworld\nauto gen          # generate vue (routes must exist before run)\nauto run          # backend (:8023) + vite dev (watch the printed Local: port)\n```\n\nOpen the printed URL (hash router — home is `/#/`).\n\n## API (stage 1)\n\n| Method | Path | Action |\n|---|---|---|\n| POST | `/api/users/login` | log in (email + password → User) |\n| POST | `/api/users` | register (username + email + password → User) |\n| GET | `/api/user` | current user (stage 1: always id=0 = logged out; no token auth yet) |\n| GET | `/api/articles` | list all articles (no server filter) |\n| GET | `/api/articles/:slug` | single article |\n| GET | `/api/articles/:slug/comments` | comments for an article |\n\n> Authentication is mock: any password works for a known email; `current_user`\n> returns id=0 (no real token auth in stage 1). Stage 2 adds JWT verification.\n\n## Tests\n\nStart the servers (above), note the vite port, then:\n\n```bash\ncd tests && npm install && npm test    # playwright T1-T8\nRW_URL=http://localhost:<vite-port> npm test   # if port differs from default\n```\n\nAcceptance contract in `tests/acceptance.atd`. Tests cover (T1-T14): feed\nrender, tag filter, article detail, register, login, settings + logout,\nunauthenticated guard, no console errors, **create article (editor)**, **edit\narticle**, feed list, **post comment**, **favorite**, **profile page**.\n\n## Notes / known gotchas (Plan 401 §技术约定, encountered here)\n\n- **`tag` is a reserved soft keyword** (TokenKind::Tag, an enum alias) — cannot\n  be a parameter name; a2r fails with \"expected '{' or type after 'str'\". Used\n  `filter_tag` instead. (Backend.)\n- **store model fields with struct-literal init** (e.g. `var x User = User{...}`)\n  flatten to `null` in codegen — guard templates with `!= nil` before reading\n  fields. (Frontend. Not yet root-fixed; see Plan 401.)\n- **store model field name must not match an imported api function name**\n  (stage 2): codegen emits both `import { fn }` and `const fn = ref(...)`;\n  the const shadows the import → `fn()` fails. Named the field `me` instead of\n  `current_user`. (Frontend.)\n- **a widget cannot back multiple routes** (stage 2): codegen gives them the\n  same route `name`; vue-router drops the duplicate. Merged `/editor` +\n  `/editor/:slug` into one route, using `/editor/new` for create mode.\n- **a2r `List<T>` declaration is order-sensitive** (stage 2): a `List<T>` line\n  after `var result T = T { ...多字段 }` fails to parse. Workaround: declare\n  `List<T>` before the struct-literal `var result`. (Backend. Not root-fixed.)\n- **a2r dual path params** (`/:a/:b`): only the first is extracted. Used a\n  single path param for delete-comment. (Backend.)\n- **Hash routing** — playwright tests must `goto('/#/path')`, not `goto('/path')`.\n- **a2r codegen bugs fixed** (benefit all backends with string ops): a2r_std\n  import path (`use auto_lang::a2r_std`) + back Cargo.toml `auto-lang` dep +\n  `endpoint_has_body` (POST without body params no longer requires a Json body).\n\n## Inspiration\n\nRealWorld (Conduit) — https://realworld-docs.netlify.app/\n", source: "// app.at — App shell. Routes + top nav + outlet. Nav adapts to login state\n// (.store.me.id != 0 = logged in). Cf. 018 app.at routes{...} + outlet.\nuse auth_store: AuthStore\nuse article_store: ArticleStore\n\n// PLAN-637 B5 Phase B 映射（灰阶分层口径）：gray-800/700/600→foreground；gray-500/400→\n// muted-foreground；border-gray-N→border-border；bg-white→bg-card；bg-gray-100→bg-muted；\n// bg-red-50/text-red-500→destructive 族。text-white ×5 为 brand-green 品牌按钮配对字\n// （品牌绿=本 demo 自定义语义色，整体豁免保留）。表单输入框 ×13 消费 stylekit\n// input_field（D1 家族源 demo）。\nwidget App {\n    routes {\n        \"/\" -> use home\n        \"/login\" -> use login\n        \"/register\" -> use register\n        \"/article/:slug\" -> use article_detail\n        \"/settings\" -> use settings\n        \"/editor/:slug\" -> use editor\n        \"/profile/:username\" -> use profile\n    }\n\n    msg { Init, Logout, GoProfile(str) }\n\n    view {\n        col {\n            style: \"min-h-screen font-serif text-foreground\"\n            // Top nav\n            row {\n                style: \"w-full border-b border-border px-4 py-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto items-center gap-4\"\n                link (to: \"/\") {\n                    text \"conduit\" { style: \"text-brand-green text-xl font-bold no-underline\" }\n                }\n                row {\n                    style: \"ml-auto gap-4 text-sm\"\n                    link (to: \"/\") { text \"Home\" { style: \"text-foreground\" } }\n                    if .store.me != nil {\n                        if .store.me.id != 0 {\n                            link (to: \"/editor/new\") { text \"New Post\" { style: \"text-foreground\" } }\n                            link (to: \"/settings\") { text \"Settings\" { style: \"text-foreground\" } }\n                            text .store.me.username {\n                                onclick: .GoProfile(.store.me.username)\n                                style: \"text-foreground cursor-pointer\"\n                            }\n                        } else {\n                            link (to: \"/login\") { text \"Sign in\" { style: \"text-foreground\" } }\n                            link (to: \"/register\") { text \"Sign up\" { style: \"text-foreground\" } }\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        link (to: \"/login\") { text \"Sign in\" { style: \"text-foreground\" } }\n                        link (to: \"/register\") { text \"Sign up\" { style: \"text-foreground\" } }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            // Route outlet\n            col {\n                outlet\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            store.Init()\n            store.LoadFeed()\n        }\n        .Logout -> { store.Logout() }\n        .GoProfile(username str) -> { router.push(\"/profile/\" + username) }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "name: \"realworld\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"RealWorld\"\ntitle_zh: \"RealWorld\"\napi: \"rust\"\nfront_port: 3023\nback_port: 8023\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: false, search_lc: "realworld 023-realworld autoui" },
        { id: "024-charts", title: "图表", category: "04-systems", icon: "app-window", description: "图表", tags: ["Data", "SVG", "Animation"], doc: "# 024-charts — regeneration SPEC\n\n> Purpose: 图表工坊——编辑数据系列、切换图表类型、观察几何重算的交互式\n> demo。AutoOS 系统监视器/图表应用的孵化形态（Design 21 App 轨道填洞 ①）。\n> **Frontend-only, in-memory data, no backend.** 几何模式复用 widgets-gallery\n> Charts 分组的已验证实现（Plan 437 §0.6.E/F/G/H）。\n\n## Functional spec (regenerate from this, no code)\n\n单视图图表工坊：\n\n- **Layout**: 顶部标题栏；主体为左右行布局——左侧数据面板（固定宽），\n  右侧图表区（自适应）。\n- **数据**: 月度 x 三系列（Desktop / Mobile / Tablet），6 个月份 record\n  列表（gallery 契约形状 `{ m, desktop, mobile, tablet }`），内存态、\n  M1 不可编辑数值（M2 流式追加）。\n- **类型切换**: 四个按钮（Line / Bar / Area / Donut），当前类型高亮；\n  切换零重算（几何在 Init 一次算全四类，view 按类型分支渲染）。\n- **系列开关**: 每系列一行——色块 + 名称 + checkbox（可见性）+ 统计串\n  （last/max）。关闭系列即从图上隐藏该系列（line/bar/area）。\n- **几何**（全部 Auto 内联计算，Init 一次）：\n  - line: linear scale，每系列一条 M/L path；\n  - bar: band scale（slot = 内宽/月数，槽内三等分），每系列一条合成\n    path（每柱 M/h/v/h-Z 子路径）；\n  - area: 线 path + 下探底边闭合 Z 的填充 path（fill-opacity 0.25），\n  - donut: **末月构成**（最后一月三系列占比切片），d3-arc 风格外弧 A +\n    内弧回程 Z，大弧标志 span>π，循环累进角度（math.cos/sin 直调——\n    §0.6.H 根因已修的落地验证）。\n- **M1 简化（记录在案）**: 刻度对全部三系列取 max（隐藏系列不触发\n  重算/rescale）；donut 忽略可见性（plan §6：donut 限静态分布展示）。\n\n## Data model\n\n```\nmonthly: List of { m str, desktop int, mobile int, tablet int }\nchartType str ∈ {\"line\",\"bar\",\"area\",\"donut\"}\ndVisible/mVisible/tVisible bool\n每类型每系列一条 path str（lineD/lineM/lineT、barD/…、areaD/…、donutD/…）\nlabels str（月份拼接）、donutLegend str、stats{D,M,T} str\n```\n\n## Architecture notes (what the AI should know)\n\n- Widget tier: `row/col/button/checkbox/text/svg+path/line`（SVG 直通，\n  Plan 442 A4）；无 tabs 受控绑定——类型切换用按钮行 + 条件样式\n  （tabs 的 value 受控绑定未验证，M1 不冒险）。\n- 几何纪律（437 §0.6.D）：float 中间量显式声明 `float`；int→float 经\n  存储强转或与 float 字面量混合；`math.*` 可直调（含循环体内）。\n- 系列编辑（M2+）走整表重建（append/filter 模式，013 先例），避免就地改。\n- 几何代码故意三份内联（Init 一次算全）而非按需重算——handler 间无法\n  互相调用、模块级 fn 不进 vue SFC（§0.6.E-3），M1 取\"零重算\"形态。\n\n## Known deferrals (do NOT try to add these — they need unbuilt features)\n\n- **双模式展示**（已落地）: **静态模式** = 初始/Reset 展示种子月度数据\n  （Jan–Jun 三系列，`seed` 为不变式源）；**流式模式** = `.Tick`（model\n  `interval int = 400` 作周期 + `running` str 门控，handler 内自决——\n  Plan 402 语义）每 tick 追加一个数据点（纯整数算术锯齿波\n  `150+(tickN*37)%120` 族——f64 值入 record 的比较链未验证，整数保平安）\n  并按 `windowLen`（8/12/20 可调）滑出旧点；line/bar/area/stats 重算，\n  donut 保持静态构成。Play/Pause/Reset 三键：Play 启动流式、Pause 停、\n  **Reset 重建 monthly=seed 并全量重算（回到静态展示，tickN 归零）**。\n- **数值编辑**（系列数值增删改）: 后续引入（整表重建模式，013 先例）。\n- **组件化渲染函数**（LineChart 等）: 待 Plan 435 统一声明体系合入\n  后由 437 收口，M1 页面内联形态。\n- **vm 实机/desktop_mcp/golden**: M3 辖区。\n", source: "// front/app.at - Charts 图表工坊(Plan 445 M1 → Plan 484 M4 组件化迁移)\n//\n// 806 行内联几何(Init/Reset/.Tick 三份复制)退役,四类图改为 official\n// 包裸名原语消费(line-chart/bar-chart/area-chart/donut-chart):几何由\n// 组件 Init 派生(纯幂等),父级只维护数据与交互状态。流式滑窗\n// (.Tick 追数据点)语义不变:monthly 数据变化 → 子组件 props 重播种 →\n// Init 重放 → 几何自动重算(ADR-19)。\n\nstyle tab_btn = \"px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-md border bg-background hover:bg-accent\"\nstyle tab_btn_primary = \"px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground\"\nstyle section_label = \"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide\"\nstyle list_label = \"text-sm font-medium flex-1\"\nstyle seg_input = \"px-2 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-md border bg-background flex-1\"\nstyle seg_btn_primary = \"px-2 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground flex-1\"\nstyle row_gap2 = \"items-center gap-2\"\n\nwidget App {\n    use { package: official from \"components\" }\n\n    msg { Init, SetLine, SetBar, SetArea, SetDonut, ToggleDesktop, ToggleMobile, ToggleTablet, Play, Pause, Reset, SetWin8, SetWin12, SetWin20 }\n\n    model {\n        // ---- 状态 ----\n        chartType str = \"line\"\n        dVisible bool = true\n        mVisible bool = true\n        tVisible bool = false\n\n        // ---- 流式:running(str \"true\"/\"false\")门控启停(012 惯例) ----\n        interval int = 400\n        running str = \"false\"\n        windowLen int = 12\n        tickN int = 0\n\n        // ---- 数据(双模式):seed 为静态展示源(Reset 的不变式);\n        // monthly 为当前展示数据 ----\n        seed = [\n            { m: \"Jan\", desktop: 186, mobile: 80,  tablet: 40 },\n            { m: \"Feb\", desktop: 305, mobile: 200, tablet: 90 },\n            { m: \"Mar\", desktop: 237, mobile: 120, tablet: 60 },\n            { m: \"Apr\", desktop: 73,  mobile: 190, tablet: 110 },\n            { m: \"May\", desktop: 209, mobile: 130, tablet: 70 },\n            { m: \"Jun\", desktop: 214, mobile: 140, tablet: 85 }\n        ]\n        monthly = [\n            { m: \"Jan\", desktop: 186, mobile: 80,  tablet: 40 },\n            { m: \"Feb\", desktop: 305, mobile: 200, tablet: 90 },\n            { m: \"Mar\", desktop: 237, mobile: 120, tablet: 60 },\n            { m: \"Apr\", desktop: 73,  mobile: 190, tablet: 110 },\n            { m: \"May\", desktop: 209, mobile: 130, tablet: 70 },\n            { m: \"Jun\", desktop: 214, mobile: 140, tablet: 85 }\n        ]\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> { }\n\n        // ---- 类型切换/系列开关:单行 handler ----\n        .SetLine -> { .chartType = \"line\" }\n        .SetBar -> { .chartType = \"bar\" }\n        .SetArea -> { .chartType = \"area\" }\n        .SetDonut -> { .chartType = \"donut\" }\n        .ToggleDesktop -> {\n            if .dVisible {\n                .dVisible = false\n            } else {\n                .dVisible = true\n            }\n        }\n        .ToggleMobile -> {\n            if .mVisible {\n                .mVisible = false\n            } else {\n                .mVisible = true\n            }\n        }\n        .ToggleTablet -> {\n            if .tVisible {\n                .tVisible = false\n            } else {\n                .tVisible = true\n            }\n        }\n\n        // ---- 流式控制 ----\n        .Play -> { .running = \"true\" }\n        .Pause -> { .running = \"false\" }\n        .SetWin8 -> { .windowLen = 8 }\n        .SetWin12 -> { .windowLen = 12 }\n        .SetWin20 -> { .windowLen = 20 }\n\n        // ---- 滑窗:追数据点 + 滑出旧点(几何重算交给组件) ----\n        .Tick -> {\n            if .running == \"true\" {\n                .tickN = .tickN + 1\n                var nd = 150 + (.tickN * 37) % 120\n                var nm = 100 + (.tickN * 53) % 130\n                var nt = 50 + (.tickN * 29) % 90\n                var lbl = f\"t${.tickN}\"\n                var out = []\n                var first = true\n                var over = .monthly.len() >= .windowLen\n                for d in .monthly {\n                    if over && first {\n                        first = false\n                    } else {\n                        out.push(d)\n                    }\n                }\n                out.push({ m: lbl, desktop: nd, mobile: nm, tablet: nt })\n                .monthly = out\n            }\n        }\n\n        // ---- Reset:monthly 重建自 seed(不变式) ----\n        .Reset -> {\n            .running = \"false\"\n            .tickN = 0\n            var out = []\n            for d in .seed {\n                out.push(d)\n            }\n            .monthly = out\n        }\n    }\n\n    view {\n        col (style: \"min-h-screen bg-background p-6 gap-4\") {\n            col (style: \"gap-1\") {\n                h1 \"图表工坊\" { style: \"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\" }\n                text \"切换类型 → 开关系列 → 观察渲染。几何由官方 chart 组件自动计算(484 组件化迁移)。\" { style: \"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" }\n            }\n\n            row (style: \"gap-6 items-start flex-1\") {\n                // ---- 左:数据面板 ----\n                col (style: \"w-72 shrink-0 rounded-lg border p-4 gap-4\") {\n                    text \"Chart type\" { style: section_label }\n                    col (style: \"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\") {\n                        if .chartType == \"line\" {\n                            button \"Line ●\" { onclick: .SetLine, style: tab_btn_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"Line\" { onclick: .SetLine, style: tab_btn }\n                        }\n                        if .chartType == \"bar\" {\n                            button \"Bar ●\" { onclick: .SetBar, style: tab_btn_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"Bar\" { onclick: .SetBar, style: tab_btn }\n                        }\n                        if .chartType == \"area\" {\n                            button \"Area ●\" { onclick: .SetArea, style: tab_btn_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"Area\" { onclick: .SetArea, style: tab_btn }\n                        }\n                        if .chartType == \"donut\" {\n                            button \"Donut ●\" { onclick: .SetDonut, style: tab_btn_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"Donut\" { onclick: .SetDonut, style: tab_btn }\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    text \"Series\" { style: section_label }\n                    row (style: row_gap2) {\n                        span (style: \"w-3 h-3 rounded-sm bg-[#2563eb] shrink-0\") {}\n                        text \"Desktop\" { style: list_label }\n                        checkbox {\n                            checked: .dVisible,\n                            onclick: .ToggleDesktop\n                        }\n                    }\n                    row (style: row_gap2) {\n                        span (style: \"w-3 h-3 rounded-sm bg-[#16a34a] shrink-0\") {}\n                        text \"Mobile\" { style: list_label }\n                        checkbox {\n                            checked: .mVisible,\n                            onclick: .ToggleMobile\n                        }\n                    }\n                    row (style: row_gap2) {\n                        span (style: \"w-3 h-3 rounded-sm bg-[#d97706] shrink-0\") {}\n                        text \"Tablet\" { style: list_label }\n                        checkbox {\n                            checked: .tVisible,\n                            onclick: .ToggleTablet\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    text \"Streaming\" { style: section_label }\n                    row (style: \"gap-2\") {\n                        if .running == \"true\" {\n                            button \"⏸ Pause\" { onclick: .Pause, style: \"px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-md bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground flex-1\" }   // Phase B: Pause red→secondary（012 先例）\n                        } else {\n                            button \"▶ Play\" { onclick: .Play, style: \"px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground flex-1\" }   // Phase B: Play green→primary（012 先例）\n                        }\n                        button \"Reset\" { onclick: .Reset, style: tab_btn }\n                    }\n                    row (style: \"gap-2\") {\n                        if .windowLen == 8 {\n                            button \"8 ●\" { onclick: .SetWin8, style: seg_btn_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"8\" { onclick: .SetWin8, style: seg_input }\n                        }\n                        if .windowLen == 12 {\n                            button \"12 ●\" { onclick: .SetWin12, style: seg_btn_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"12\" { onclick: .SetWin12, style: seg_input }\n                        }\n                        if .windowLen == 20 {\n                            button \"20 ●\" { onclick: .SetWin20, style: seg_btn_primary }\n                        } else {\n                            button \"20\" { onclick: .SetWin20, style: seg_input }\n                        }\n                    }\n                    text \"双模式:初始/Reset 为静态月度展示;Play 后每 400ms 追加点并滑出旧点。几何由组件自动重算。\" { style: \"text-xs text-muted-foreground\" }\n                }\n\n                // ---- 右:图表区(官方组件消费) ----\n                col (style: \"flex-1 rounded-lg border p-4 gap-2\") {\n                    if .chartType == \"line\" {\n                        line-chart (index: \"m\") {\n                        data: .monthly\n                        fields: [\"desktop\", \"mobile\", \"tablet\"]\n                        labels: [\"Desktop\", \"Mobile\", \"Tablet\"]\n                    }\n                    }\n                    if .chartType == \"bar\" {\n                        bar-chart (index: \"m\") {\n                        data: .monthly\n                        fields: [\"desktop\", \"mobile\", \"tablet\"]\n                        labels: [\"Desktop\", \"Mobile\", \"Tablet\"]\n                    }\n                    }\n                    if .chartType == \"area\" {\n                        area-chart (index: \"m\") {\n                        data: .monthly\n                        fields: [\"desktop\", \"mobile\", \"tablet\"]\n                        labels: [\"Desktop\", \"Mobile\", \"Tablet\"]\n                    }\n                    }\n                    if .chartType == \"donut\" {\n                        donut-chart (index: \"m\") {\n                        data: .monthly\n                        field: \"desktop\"\n                    }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n", pac_text: "// pac.at - Charts 图表工坊（App 轨道填洞 ①·Plan 445）\n//\n// 编辑数据/切换类型/观察渲染的交互式图表 demo——AutoOS 系统监视器与\n// 图表应用的孵化形态。M1 vue 先行；M3 补 vm 实机（038 双后端惯例）。\n\nname: \"charts\"\nversion: \"0.1.0\"\ndescription: \"Charts playground - edit series, switch chart type, watch geometry recompute (vue/vm)\"\n\nscene: \"ui\"\nrender: \"vue\"\ntitle: \"Charts\"\ntitle_zh: \"图表\"\nfront_port: 4024\ndesktop: \"true\"\n\ndep stylekit {\n    path: \"../stylekit\"\n}\n", loadable: true, search_lc: "图表 024-charts data svg animation" },
        { id: "026-database", title: "数据库工作室", category: "04-systems", icon: "app-window", description: "数据库工作室", tags: ["AutoUI"], doc: "# 026-database — Database Studio (SQLite 可视化客户端)\n\n> **AutoOS 默认应用矩阵 · App 轨道填洞 ③ (Plan 439)**\n> 端口: `4026` (Vue 前端) / `8026` (API) | 场景: `ui` | 渲染引擎: `vue` / `vm`\n\n---\n\n## 概述\n\n**Database Studio** 是 AutoOS 默认应用矩阵中的 SQLite 可视化管理客户端，提供轻量、现代且响应迅速的数据库管理体验。\n\n### 核心特性\n\n1. **数据库对象树导航 (Database Object Tree)**\n   - 树状层级浏览 Tables (7), Views (2), Indexes (3)。\n   - 对象名与行数徽章实时展示，支持实时搜索过滤。\n2. **DataTable 深水区能力**\n   - **分页控制**：支持首页、上一页、下一页、末页快速跳转，可自由切换页容量 (10/25/50/100)。\n   - **列排序**：点击表头即时升降序重排，表头带方向指示。\n   - **数据检索**：支持快速多字段模糊过滤。\n   - **类型徽章与样式**：NULL 值斜体弱化展示，数值右对齐。\n   - **大数据集验证**：内置 10,000 行 `audit_logs` 表用于检验切片性能。\n3. **表结构与 DDL 检视 (Schema Inspector)**\n   - 字段规格明细清单（CID、字段名、数据类型、Not Null、Default Value、主键 PK 标识）。\n   - 索引清单（索引名、字段、唯一性约束）。\n   - 格式化 `CREATE TABLE ...` DDL 源码卡片。\n4. **SQL 查询控制台 (SQL Console)**\n   - 快捷预设 SQL 模板（Customers、High-Value Products、Orders、Error Test）。\n   - SQL 执行耗时 (ms) 与返回行数统计。\n   - 结果集 DataTable 呈现。\n   - 详尽的错误路径反馈面板。\n5. **写操作与事务模拟 (Transaction / Dirty Tracking)**\n   - 新增记录表单与行就地删除。\n   - 事务脏状态计数 (`Uncommitted` 徽章)。\n   - `Commit` 提交与 `Rollback` 撤销操作闭环。\n\n---\n\n## 快速运行与构建\n\n### 1. Vue 模式\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/026-database\nauto run\n```\n在浏览器中打开 `http://localhost:4026`。\n\n### 2. 构建与类型检查\n```bash\nauto build\n```\n\n### 3. VM 模式与自动化 MCP 测试\n```bash\ncd examples/ui/026-database/tests\npython desktop_mcp.py\n```\n", source: "// front/app.at — Database Studio SQLite 可视化客户端（Plan 439 M1-M3·App 轨道填洞 ③）\n//\n// 数据库对象树导航 + DataTable 深水区（分页/排序/搜索/类型徽章/万行窗口化）\n// + 表结构（Schema/DDL）+ SQL 控制台（执行/耗时/错误反馈）+ 事务级编辑与提交。\n\nuse components.tree_util: filter_tree, collect_ids, toggle_id\n\n// PLAN-637 B4 注记：本 demo 为 475 组件包形态（widget 内 use { package } 块），\n// 顶层 stylekit use 与之解析互斥（caption_text 判 undefined），caption ×4 暂留\n// 字面量——待框架修复后回迁（已知债，见 b4-evidence-summary）。\nwidget App {\n    use { package: official from \"./components\" }\n    msg {\n        Init,\n        SelectTab(str),\n        SelectTable(str),\n        SelectView(str),\n        SelectIndex(str),\n        NextPage,\n        PrevPage,\n        FirstPage,\n        LastPage,\n        SetPageSize10,\n        SetPageSize25,\n        SetPageSize50,\n        SortCol(str),\n        SearchChanged(str),\n        TreeFilterChanged(str),\n        SetSql(str),\n        RunSql,\n        ClearSql,\n        PresetSqlCustomers,\n        PresetSqlProducts,\n        PresetSqlOrders,\n        PresetSqlError,\n        ToggleNewRowModal,\n        InputNameChanged(str),\n        InputContactChanged(str),\n        InputCityChanged(str),\n        InputCountryChanged(str),\n        SaveNewRow,\n        DeleteRow(int),\n        CommitTx,\n        RollbackTx,\n        ResetDb\n    }\n\n    model {\n        // ---- 视图与导航状态 ----\n        activeTab str = \"data\"          // \"data\" | \"schema\" | \"console\"\n        activeTable str = \"customers\"   // 当前选中的表名\n        activeType str = \"table\"        // \"table\" | \"view\" | \"index\"\n        treeFilter str = \"\"             // 对象树过滤文本\n        dbNodesFull List = [\n            { id: \"db/app\", label: \"app (SQLite)\", kind: \"dir\", icon: \"\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"\", children: [\n                { id: \"g/tables\", label: \"Tables\", kind: \"dir\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"7\", children: [\n                    { id: \"t/customers\", label: \"customers\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"91\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"t/products\", label: \"products\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"77\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"t/orders\", label: \"orders\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"830\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"t/categories\", label: \"categories\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"8\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"t/employees\", label: \"employees\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"9\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"t/audit_logs\", label: \"audit_logs\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"10k\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"t/regions\", label: \"regions\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"table\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"4\", children: [] }\n                ] },\n                { id: \"g/views\", label: \"Views\", kind: \"dir\", icon: \"eye\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"2\", children: [\n                    { id: \"v/order_summary\", label: \"order_summary\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"eye\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"v/product_catalog\", label: \"product_catalog\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"eye\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"\", children: [] }\n                ] },\n                { id: \"g/indexes\", label: \"Indexes\", kind: \"dir\", icon: \"zap\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"3\", children: [\n                    { id: \"i/idx_orders_customer\", label: \"idx_orders_customer\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"zap\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"i/idx_products_category\", label: \"idx_products_category\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"zap\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"\", children: [] },\n                    { id: \"i/idx_orders_date\", label: \"idx_orders_date\", kind: \"file\", icon: \"zap\", is_leaf: false, badge: \"\", children: [] }\n                ] }\n            ] }\n        ]\n        dbSelId str = \"\"\n        dbExpanded List = [\"db/app\", \"g/tables\", \"g/views\", \"g/indexes\"]\n\n        // ---- 分页与排序状态 ----\n        page int = 1\n        pageSize int = 10\n        totalPages int = 1\n        totalRows int = 91\n        filteredCount int = 91\n        showingText str = \"Showing 1 - 10 of 91 rows\"\n        searchKw str = \"\"\n        sortCol str = \"id\"\n        sortDir str = \"asc\"\n\n        // 列头排序指示\n        hId str = \"ID ↑\"\n        hCol1 str = \"Company Name\"\n        hCol2 str = \"Contact Name\"\n        hCol3 str = \"City\"\n        hCol4 str = \"Country\"\n        hCol5 str = \"Phone\"\n\n        // ---- 表结构与 DDL 元数据 ----\n        schemaColumns = []\n        schemaIndexes = []\n        schemaDdl str = \"\"\n        tableStatsText str = \"Table: customers · 6 Columns · 91 Records · ~14 KB\"\n\n        // ---- 活跃展示的数据切片 ----\n        activeRows = []\n\n        // ---- 事务与脏数据状态 ----\n        dirtyCount int = 0\n        showNewRowModal bool = false\n        newName str = \"\"\n        newContact str = \"\"\n        newCity str = \"\"\n        newCountry str = \"\"\n        txStatusMsg str = \"\"\n\n        // ---- SQL 控制台状态 ----\n        sqlInput str = \"SELECT * FROM customers LIMIT 20;\"\n        sqlStatus str = \"idle\"          // \"idle\" | \"success\" | \"error\"\n        sqlDurationMs int = 0\n        sqlErrorMsg str = \"\"\n        sqlResultCount int = 0\n        sqlResultCols = []\n        sqlResultRows = []\n\n        // ---- 原始数据库表数据 ----\n        customers = [\n            { id: 1, col1: \"Alfreds Futterkiste\", col2: \"Maria Anders\", col3: \"Berlin\", col4: \"Germany\", col5: \"030-0074321\" },\n            { id: 2, col1: \"Ana Trujillo Emparedados\", col2: \"Ana Trujillo\", col3: \"México D.F.\", col4: \"Mexico\", col5: \"(5) 555-4729\" },\n            { id: 3, col1: \"Antonio Moreno Taquería\", col2: \"Antonio Moreno\", col3: \"México D.F.\", col4: \"Mexico\", col5: \"(5) 555-3932\" },\n            { id: 4, col1: \"Around the Horn\", col2: \"Thomas Hardy\", col3: \"London\", col4: \"UK\", col5: \"(171) 555-7788\" },\n            { id: 5, col1: \"Berglunds snabbköp\", col2: \"Christina Berglund\", col3: \"Luleå\", col4: \"Sweden\", col5: \"0921-12 34 65\" },\n            { id: 6, col1: \"Blauer See Delikatessen\", col2: \"Hanna Moos\", col3: \"Mannheim\", col4: \"Germany\", col5: \"0621-08460\" },\n            { id: 7, col1: \"Blondel père et fils\", col2: \"Frédérique Citeaux\", col3: \"Strasbourg\", col4: \"France\", col5: \"88.60.15.31\" },\n            { id: 8, col1: \"Bólido Comidas preparadas\", col2: \"Martín Sommer\", col3: \"Madrid\", col4: \"Spain\", col5: \"(91) 555 22 82\" },\n            { id: 9, col1: \"Bon app'\", col2: \"Laurence Lebihan\", col3: \"Marseille\", col4: \"France\", col5: \"91.24.45.40\" },\n            { id: 10, col1: \"Bottom-Dollar Markets\", col2: \"Elizabeth Lincoln\", col3: \"Tsawwassen\", col4: \"Canada\", col5: \"(604) 555-4729\" },\n            { id: 11, col1: \"B's Beverages\", col2: \"Victoria Ashworth\", col3: \"London\", col4: \"UK\", col5: \"(171) 555-1212\" },\n            { id: 12, col1: \"Cactus Comidas para llevar\", col2: \"Patricio Simpson\", col3: \"Buenos Aires\", col4: \"Argentina\", col5: \"(1) 135-5555\" },\n            { id: 13, col1: \"Centro comercial Moctezuma\", col2: \"Francisco Chang\", col3: \"México D.F.\", col4: \"Mexico\", col5: \"(5) 555-3392\" },\n            { id: 14, col1: \"Chop-suey Chinese\", col2: \"Yang Wang\", col3: \"Bern\", col4: \"Switzerland\", col5: \"0452-076545\" },\n            { id: 15, col1: \"Comércio Mineiro\", col2: \"Pedro Afonso\", col3: \"Sao Paulo\", col4: \"Brazil\", col5: \"(11) 555-7647\" }\n        ]\n\n        products = [\n            { id: 1, col1: \"Chai Tea\", col2: \"Beverages\", col3: \"$18.00\", col4: \"39 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 2, col1: \"Chang Beer\", col2: \"Beverages\", col3: \"$19.00\", col4: \"17 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 3, col1: \"Aniseed Syrup\", col2: \"Condiments\", col3: \"$10.00\", col4: \"13 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 4, col1: \"Chef Anton's Cajun Seasoning\", col2: \"Condiments\", col3: \"$22.00\", col4: \"53 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 5, col1: \"Chef Anton's Gumbo Mix\", col2: \"Condiments\", col3: \"$21.35\", col4: \"0 in stock\", col5: \"Discontinued\" },\n            { id: 6, col1: \"Grandma's Boysenberry Spread\", col2: \"Condiments\", col3: \"$25.00\", col4: \"120 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 7, col1: \"Uncle Bob's Organic Dried Pears\", col2: \"Produce\", col3: \"$30.00\", col4: \"15 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 8, col1: \"Northwoods Cranberry Sauce\", col2: \"Condiments\", col3: \"$40.00\", col4: \"6 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 9, col1: \"Mishi Kobe Niku\", col2: \"Meat/Poultry\", col3: \"$97.00\", col4: \"29 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 10, col1: \"Ikura Salmon Caviar\", col2: \"Seafood\", col3: \"$31.00\", col4: \"31 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 11, col1: \"Queso Cabrales\", col2: \"Dairy Products\", col3: \"$21.00\", col4: \"22 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" },\n            { id: 12, col1: \"Queso Manchego La Pastora\", col2: \"Dairy Products\", col3: \"$38.00\", col4: \"86 in stock\", col5: \"Active\" }\n        ]\n\n        orders = [\n            { id: 10248, col1: \"VINET\", col2: \"1996-07-04\", col3: \"France\", col4: \"$32.38\", col5: \"Shipped\" },\n            { id: 10249, col1: \"TOMSP\", col2: \"1996-07-05\", col3: \"Germany\", col4: \"$11.61\", col5: \"Shipped\" },\n            { id: 10250, col1: \"HANAR\", col2: \"1996-07-08\", col3: \"Brazil\", col4: \"$65.83\", col5: \"Shipped\" },\n            { id: 10251, col1: \"VICTE\", col2: \"1996-07-08\", col3: \"France\", col4: \"$41.34\", col5: \"Shipped\" },\n            { id: 10252, col1: \"SUPRD\", col2: \"1996-07-09\", col3: \"Belgium\", col4: \"$51.30\", col5: \"Shipped\" },\n            { id: 10253, col1: \"HANAR\", col2: \"1996-07-10\", col3: \"Brazil\", col4: \"$58.17\", col5: \"Delivered\" },\n            { id: 10254, col1: \"CHOPS\", col2: \"1996-07-11\", col3: \"Switzerland\", col4: \"$22.98\", col5: \"Shipped\" },\n            { id: 10255, col1: \"RICSU\", col2: \"1996-07-12\", col3: \"Switzerland\", col4: \"$148.33\", col5: \"Delivered\" },\n            { id: 10256, col1: \"WELLI\", col2: \"1996-07-15\", col3: \"Brazil\", col4: \"$13.97\", col5: \"Processing\" },\n            { id: 10257, col1: \"HILAA\", col2: \"1996-07-16\", col3: \"Venezuela\", col4: \"$81.91\", col5: \"Processing\" }\n        ]\n\n        categories = [\n            { id: 1, col1: \"Beverages\", col2: \"Soft drinks, coffees, teas, beers, and ales\", col3: \"12 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" },\n            { id: 2, col1: \"Condiments\", col2: \"Sweet and savory sauces, relishes, spreads, seasonings\", col3: \"12 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" },\n            { id: 3, col1: \"Confections\", col2: \"Desserts, candies, and sweet breads\", col3: \"13 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" },\n            { id: 4, col1: \"Dairy Products\", col2: \"Cheeses and butter\", col3: \"10 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" },\n            { id: 5, col1: \"Grains/Cereals\", col2: \"Breads, crackers, pasta, and cereal\", col3: \"7 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" },\n            { id: 6, col1: \"Meat/Poultry\", col2: \"Prepared meats\", col3: \"6 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" },\n            { id: 7, col1: \"Produce\", col2: \"Dried fruit and bean curd\", col3: \"5 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" },\n            { id: 8, col1: \"Seafood\", col2: \"Seaweed and fish\", col3: \"12 items\", col4: \"Active\", col5: \"None\" }\n        ]\n\n        employees = [\n            { id: 1, col1: \"Nancy\", col2: \"Davolio\", col3: \"Sales Representative\", col4: \"Sales\", col5: \"x5467\" },\n            { id: 2, col1: \"Andrew\", col2: \"Fuller\", col3: \"Vice President, Sales\", col4: \"Executive\", col5: \"x3457\" },\n            { id: 3, col1: \"Janet\", col2: \"Leverling\", col3: \"Sales Representative\", col4: \"Sales\", col5: \"x3355\" },\n            { id: 4, col1: \"Margaret\", col2: \"Peacock\", col3: \"Sales Representative\", col4: \"Sales\", col5: \"x5176\" },\n            { id: 5, col1: \"Steven\", col2: \"Buchanan\", col3: \"Sales Manager\", col4: \"Sales\", col5: \"x3453\" },\n            { id: 6, col1: \"Michael\", col2: \"Suyama\", col3: \"Sales Representative\", col4: \"Sales\", col5: \"x428\" }\n        ]\n\n        audit_logs = [\n            { id: 1001, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:14:02\", col2: \"LOGIN_SUCCESS\", col3: \"admin\", col4: \"192.168.1.102\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1002, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:15:23\", col2: \"SELECT_QUERY\", col3: \"admin\", col4: \"192.168.1.102\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1003, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:16:45\", col2: \"UPDATE_ROW\", col3: \"operator\", col4: \"192.168.1.105\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1004, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:18:11\", col2: \"INSERT_ROW\", col3: \"operator\", col4: \"192.168.1.105\", col5: \"201 Created\" },\n            { id: 1005, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:20:00\", col2: \"CHECKPOINT\", col3: \"system\", col4: \"127.0.0.1\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1006, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:22:15\", col2: \"VACUUM_ANALYZE\", col3: \"system\", col4: \"127.0.0.1\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1007, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:25:30\", col2: \"SCHEMA_INSPECT\", col3: \"analyst\", col4: \"192.168.1.110\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1008, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:28:44\", col2: \"EXPLAIN_QUERY\", col3: \"analyst\", col4: \"192.168.1.110\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1009, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:30:12\", col2: \"BACKUP_START\", col3: \"cron\", col4: \"127.0.0.1\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1010, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:32:59\", col2: \"BACKUP_DONE\", col3: \"cron\", col4: \"127.0.0.1\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1011, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:35:10\", col2: \"HEALTH_CHECK\", col3: \"monitor\", col4: \"127.0.0.1\", col5: \"200 OK\" },\n            { id: 1012, col1: \"2026-09-02 10:38:22\", col2: \"SELECT_QUERY\", col3: \"guest\", col4: \"192.168.1.140\", col5: \"200 OK\" }\n        ]\n    }\n\n    computed {\n        dbNodes => filter_tree(.dbNodesFull, .treeFilter)\n    }\n\n    on {\n        .Init -> {\n            // 初始化表头与元数据\n            .hId = \"ID ↑\"\n            .hCol1 = \"Company Name\"\n            .hCol2 = \"Contact Name\"\n            .hCol3 = \"City\"\n            .hCol4 = \"Country\"\n            .hCol5 = \"Phone\"\n\n            .schemaColumns = [\n                { cid: 0, name: \"id\", type: \"INTEGER\", notnull: \"YES\", dflt: \"NULL\", pk: \"PK\" },\n                { cid: 1, name: \"company_name\", type: \"TEXT\", notnull: \"YES\", dflt: \"NULL\", pk: \"-\" },\n                { cid: 2, name: \"contact_name\", type: \"TEXT\", notnull: \"NO\", dflt: \"NULL\", pk: \"-\" },\n                { cid: 3, name: \"city\", type: \"TEXT\", notnull: \"NO\", dflt: \"NULL\", pk: \"-\" },\n                { cid: 4, name: \"country\", type: \"TEXT\", notnull: \"NO\", dflt: \"NULL\", pk: \"-\" },\n                { cid: 5, name: \"phone\", type: \"TEXT\", notnull: \"NO\", dflt: \"NULL\", pk: \"-\" }\n            ]\n            .schemaIndexes = [\n                { name: \"pk_customers\", cols: \"id\", unique: \"UNIQUE (PRIMARY KEY)\" },\n                { name: \"idx_customers_country\", cols: \"country\", unique: \"INDEX\" }\n            ]\n            .schemaDdl = \"CREATE TABLE customers (\\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\\n  company_name TEXT NOT NULL,\\n  contact_name TEXT,\\n  city TEXT,\\n  country TEXT,\\n  phone TEXT\\n);\"\n            .tableStatsText = \"Table: customers · 6 Columns · 15 Records in RAM (91 in DB) · ~14 KB\"\n\n            // 载入初始数据行切片\n            var sl = []\n            var i = 0\n            for r in .customers {\n                if i < .pageSize {\n                    sl.push(r)\n                }\n                i = i + 1\n            }\n            .activeRows = sl\n            .totalRows = .customers.len()\n            .filteredCount = .customers.len()\n            .totalPages = 2\n            .showingText = f\"Showing 1 - ${sl.le